<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="NUM" style="id">UWA- Ngulu Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Uwazilo</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kitabu cha Uwazilo</para>
  <para style="toc2">Uwazilo</para>
  <para style="toc3">Uwazi</para>
  <para style="mt2">Kitabu cha</para>
  <para style="mt1">Uwazilo</para>
  <para style="imt">ULONGOELO</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongoelo</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="NUM 1" />
  <para style="s">Kuwazigwa kwa nk'hongo kwa Waizilaili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 1:1" />Mwe dizuwa dya nk'hongo dyo mwezi wa kaidi mwo mwaka wa kaidi, aho want'hu wa Izilaeli weze walawe Misili, Mnungu alongaga na Musa mwe Dihema Dikukile uko kwe dijangwa dya Sinai akamgamba, <verse eid="NUM 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 1:2" />“Weye na Haluni mdamanye uwazilo wa want'hu wose wa Izilaeli viligane ne zink'holo zawe na mp'huga zawe. Muwandike mazina ya wagosi wose. <verse eid="NUM 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 1:3" />Wawazeni wagosi wose viligane na mafyo ya watowani wawe, kukongela miaka milongo miidi na kugendeela wakudaha kunda watowani, <verse eid="NUM 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 1:4" />naho no mwambizwe ni mgosi yumwenga mwe kila kabila.” <verse eid="NUM 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 1:5" />Aya nayo mazina ya wagosi wakuunga wakwambize.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 1:5">Kulawa mwe dikabila dya Lubeni naakwambize naande ni Elisuli mwana Shediuli. <verse eid="NUM 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 1:6" />Mwe dikabila dya Simeoni naande ni Shelumieli mwana Sulishadai. <verse eid="NUM 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 1:7" />Mwe dikabila dya Yuda ni Nashoni mwana Aminadabu. <verse eid="NUM 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 1:8" />Mwe dikabila dya Isakali ni Nesaneli mwana Suali. <verse eid="NUM 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 1:9" />Mwe dikabila dya Zabuloni ni Eliyabu mwana Heloni. <verse eid="NUM 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 1:10" />Mwe dikabila dya Efulaimu ni Elishama mwana Amihudi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 1:10">Mwe dikabila dya Manase nadyo ni Gamalieli mwana Pedasuli. <verse eid="NUM 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 1:11" />Mwe dikabila dya Benjamini ni Abidani mwana Gidioni. <verse eid="NUM 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 1:12" />Mwe dikabila dya Dani ni Ahiezeli mwana Amishadai. <verse eid="NUM 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 1:13" />Mwe dikabila dya Asheli ni Pagieli mwana Okilani. <verse eid="NUM 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 1:14" />Mwe dikabila dya Gadi ni Eliyasafu mwana Deueli. <verse eid="NUM 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 1:15" />Mwe dikabila dya Nafutali ni Ahila mwana Enani.<verse eid="NUM 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 1:16" />Awo wagosi nawo wasagulagwa ni Mnungu mwa want'hu wa Izilaeli, naho wandaga ni vilongozi we zink'holo mwe Izilaeli.<verse eid="NUM 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 1:17" />Ivo Musa na Haluni awetangaga wagosi awo watambulagwa mazina yawe. <verse eid="NUM 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 1:18" />Mwe dizuwa dya nk'hongo dyo mwezi wa kaidi wawetengaga want'hu wose vileke wawazigwe, kila yumwenga viligane ne mp'huga yakwe no lukolo lwakwe. Wawandikaga want'hu wandaga na miaka kukongela milongo miidi na kugendeela viligane ne zink'holo zawe ne zimp'huga zawe, <verse eid="NUM 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 1:19" />Ivo Musa awawazaga want'hu awo uko kwe dijangwa dya Sinai enga ivo Zumbe amlagize.<verse eid="NUM 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 1:20" />Welekwa walawaga mwe dikabila dya Lubeni uyo nt'hulasasu ywa Izilaeli. Wagosi wose wandaga na miaka milongo miidi na kugendeela awo wadahaga kuita kwe nk'hondo wawandikagwa mazina yawe viligane ne zink'holo zawe ne zimp'huga zawe. <verse eid="NUM 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 1:21" />Uwazilo wa want'hu awo wandaga magana milongo mine na mtandatu na magana mashano. <verse eid="NUM 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 1:22" />Welekwa walawaga mwe dikabila dya Simioni. Wagosi wose wa miaka milongo miidi na kugendeela awo wadahaga kuita kwe nk'hondo wawazagwa no kuwandikwa mazina yawe viligane ne zink'holo zawe ne zimp'huga zawe. <verse eid="NUM 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 1:23" />Welekwa wose walawaga mwe kabila dya Simioni wandaga want'hu alufu milongo mishano na kenda na magana matatu. 59,300 <verse eid="NUM 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 1:24" />Welekwa walawaga mwe dikabila dya Gadi. Wagosi wose wandaga na miaka milongo miidi wadahaga kuita kwe nk'hondo wawandikagwa mazina yawe viligane ne zink'holo zawe ne zimp'huga zawe. <verse eid="NUM 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 1:25" />Welekwa walawaga mwe dikabila dya Gadi wandaga want'hu alufu milongo mine na shano na magana mtandatu na milongo mishano. 45,650 <verse eid="NUM 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 1:26" />Welekwa walawaga mwe dikabila dya Yuda. Wagosi wose wabuzaga miaka milongo miidi awo wadahaga kuita kwe nk'hondo wawandikagwa mazina yawe viligane ne zink'holo zawe ne zimp'huga zawe. <verse eid="NUM 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 1:27" />Wadya wawazigwe mwe kabila dya Yuda wandaga want'hu alufu milongo mfungate na mine na magana mtandatu. 74,600 <verse eid="NUM 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 1:28" />Welekwa walawaga mwe dikabila dya Isikali. Wagosi wose wabuzaga miaka milongo miidi awo wadahaga kuita kwe nk'hondo wawandikagwa mazina yawe viligane ne zink'holo zawe ne zimp'huga zawe, <verse eid="NUM 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 1:29" />wadya wawazigwe mwe kabila dya Isakali wandaga want'hu magana milongo mishano na mine na magana mane. 54,400. <verse eid="NUM 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 1:30" />Welekwa walawaga mwe dikabila dya Zabuloni. Wagosi wose wabuzaga miaka milongo miidi awo wadahaga kuita kwe nk'hondo wawandikagwa mazina yawe viligane ne zink'holo zawe ne zimp'huga zawe, <verse eid="NUM 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 1:31" />wadya wawazigwe mwe dikabila dya Zabuloni wandaga want'hu alufu milongo mishano na mfungate na magana mane. 57,400 <verse eid="NUM 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 1:32" />Welekwa walawaga mwe dikabila dya Ifulaimu. Wagosi wose wandaga na miaka milongo miidi awo wadahaga kuita kwe nk'hondo wawandikagwa mazina yawe viligane ne zink'holo zawe ne zimp'huga zawe, <verse eid="NUM 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 1:33" />wadya wawazigwe mwe kabila dya Efulaimu wandaga want'hu alufu milongo mine na magana mashano. 40,500 <verse eid="NUM 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 1:34" />Welekwa walawaga mwe dikabila dya Manase. Wagosi wose wandaga na miaka milongo miidi awo wadahaga kuita kwe nk'hondo wawandikagwa mazina yawe viligane ne zink'holo zawe ne zimp'huga zawe <verse eid="NUM 1:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 1:35" />wadya wawazigwe mwe dikabila dya Manase wandaga want'hu alufu milongo mitatu na miidi na magana maidi. 32,200 <verse eid="NUM 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 1:36" />Welekwa walawaga mwe dikabila dya Benjamini. Wagosi wose wandaga na miaka milongo miidi awo wadahaga kuita kwe nk'hondo wawandikagwa mazina yawe viligane ne zink'holo zawe ne zimp'huga zawe. <verse eid="NUM 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 1:37" />Wadya wawazigwe mwe dikabila dya Benjamini wandaga want'hu alufu milongo mitatu na mishano na magana mane. 35,400 <verse eid="NUM 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 1:38" />Welekwa walawaga mwe dikabila dya Dani. Wagosi wose wandaga na miaka milongo miidi na kugendeela awo wadahaga kuita kwe nk'hondo wawandikagwa mazina yawe viligane ne zink'holo zawe ne zimp'huga zawe <verse eid="NUM 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 1:39" />Welekwa walawaga mwe dikabila dya Dani wandaga want'hu alufu milongo mtandatu na miidi na magana mfungate. 62,700 <verse eid="NUM 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 1:40" />Welekwa walawaga mwe dikabila dya Asheli. Wagosi wose wandaga na miaka milongo miidi awo wadahaga kuita kwe nk'hondo wawandikagwa mazina yawe viligane ne zink'holo zawe ne zimp'huga zawe. <verse eid="NUM 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 1:41" />Wadya walawile mwe kabila dya Asheli wandaga want'hu alufu milongo mine na umwenga na magana mashano. 41,500 <verse eid="NUM 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 1:42" />Welekwa walawaga mwe dikabila dya Nafutali. Wagosi wose wandaga na miaka milongo miidi awo wadahaga kuita kwe nk'hondo wawandikagwa mazina yawe viligane ne zink'holo zawe ne zimp'huga zawe. <verse eid="NUM 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 1:43" />Wadya wawazigwe mwe dikabila dya Nafutali wandaga want'hu alufu milongo mishano na mitatu na magana mane. 53,400<verse eid="NUM 1:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 1:44" />Want'hu awa ni wadya wawazigwe ni Musa na Haluni wakambizwa ni wadya vilongozi mlongo na waidi wa Izilaeli, kila kilongozi andaga kakimaila lukolo lwakwe. <verse eid="NUM 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 1:45" />Waizilaeli wose wandaga na miaka milongo miidi na kugendeela awo wadahaga kuita kwe nk'hondo, awo wawazagwa viligane ne zimp'huga zawe. <verse eid="NUM 1:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 1:46" />Uwazilo wa awo wose wandaga ni alufu magana mtandatu na mitatu na magana mashano na milongo mishano. 603,550.<verse eid="NUM 1:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 1:47" />Mna zimp'huga ze dikabila dya Lawi hawawazagwa mwa want'hu awo, <verse eid="NUM 1:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 1:48" />kwaviya Zumbe amgambaga Musa, <verse eid="NUM 1:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 1:49" />“Use kuwawaza want'hu we dikabila dya Lawi hegu kuwahanganya hamwenga na makabila matuhu ya Izilaeli. <verse eid="NUM 1:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 1:50" />Vituhu vakwe uwatende walawi awo kunda wakaulizi we Dihema Dikukile ne vint'hu vakwe vose. Nawadinule ne vint'hu vakwe vose, woho nawande wandima wa uumo, naho nawakime nk'hambi zawe wakadizunguluka. <verse eid="NUM 1:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 1:51" />Mwo lupisi lwo kudisamiza Dihema Walawi nawo wo kudisamiza, naho lupisi lwo kudikima lunabula aawo Walawi nawo wo kudikima, mnt'hu yeyose hi Mlawi akuunga adisogeele naakomwe. <verse eid="NUM 1:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="NUM 1:52" />Waizilaeli watuhu nawaziike zink'hambi zawe mafyo kwa mafyo, kila yumwenga akanda ne difyo dyakwe ne kiwalo che difyo dyakwe. <verse eid="NUM 1:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="NUM 1:53" />Mna Walawi wazenge nk'hambi zawe zikuzunguluka Dihema Dikukile wadyamile vileke mnt'hu yeyose asekudisogeela hagihi sema maya ya Zumbe yana wemukile want'hu wa Izilaeli.” <verse eid="NUM 1:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="NUM 1:54" />Kwa ivo Wazilaeli wadamanyaga enga ivo Zumbe Mnungu amsigiilaga Musa.<verse eid="NUM 1:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="NUM 2" />
  <para style="s">Sigilizi ye mizengele ye nk'hambi ya Waizilaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 2:1" />Aya nayo Zumbe Mnungu awasigiilaga Musa na Haluni. <verse eid="NUM 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 2:2" />“Waizilaeli waike nk'hambi zawe, kila kabila nedikale aho ili bendela yakwe ne zimp'huga zawe. Nediike nk'hambi yakwe kudizunguluka Dihema Dikukile.<verse eid="NUM 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 2:3" />“Wakuunga waike nk'hambi kwe nt'hendelo yo ulailo wa zuwa nawande mwe difyo dya want'hu wa kiwalo cha Yuda, kilongozi ywawe naande Nashoni mwana Aminadabu, <verse eid="NUM 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 2:4" />Uwazilo we difyo dyakwe wandaga alufu milongo mfungate na mine na milongo mtandatu. 74,600<verse eid="NUM 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 2:5" />“Dikabila dya Isakali nedinde dya kaidi mwo kuika ink'hambi mwa want'hu wa Yuda, kilongozi ywawe naande Nesaneli mwana Suali, <verse eid="NUM 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 2:6" />Uwazilo we difyo dyakwe wandaga alufu milongo mishano na mine na magana mane. 54,400 <verse eid="NUM 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 2:7" />Akajika kilongozi ywe dikabila dya Zabuloni naande Eliyabi mwana Heloni. <verse eid="NUM 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 2:8" />Uwazilo we difyo dyakwe nounde want'hu alufu milongo mishano na mfungate na magana mane. 57,400 <verse eid="NUM 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 2:9" />Uwazilo mwe nk'hambi ya Yuda wandaga want'hu alufu gana na milongo mnane na mtandatu na magana mane. Awo nawo nawalongole kila wakakonga int'hambo. 186,400<verse eid="NUM 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 2:10" />“Mwe nt'hendelo ya Kusini, wadya wandile hasi ye bendela ye difyo dya Lubeni viligane ne difyo dyawe kilongozi ywawe naande Elizuli mwana Shedeuli, <verse eid="NUM 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 2:11" />uwazilo wa want'hu we difyo dyakwe nawande want'hu alufu milongo mine na mtandatu na magana mashano. 46,500 <verse eid="NUM 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 2:12" />Akajika want'hu wa kabila dya Simioni nawatimile mwo kuika nk'hambi hagihi na Lubeni wakalongozwa ni Shelumieli mwana Sulishadai, <verse eid="NUM 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 2:13" />uwazilo wawe nawande want'hu milongo magana mashano na kenda na magana matatu. <verse eid="NUM 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 2:14" />Naho neditimile ni dikabila dya Gadi, dikalongozwa ni Eliyasafu mwana Deueli, <verse eid="NUM 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 2:15" />naho uwazilo wawe nawande want'hu alufu milongo mine na mishano na magana mtandatu na milongo mishano. 45,650 <verse eid="NUM 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 2:16" />Uwazilo wa wose mwe nk'hambi ya Luben ni want'hu alufu gana dimwenga na milongo mishano na umwenga na magana mane na milongo mishano. 151,450 Awo nawo nawatimile kila wakakonga int'hambo.<verse eid="NUM 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 2:17" />“Niho difyo dya want'hu we dikabila dya Walawi dikanda hagati ye zink'hambi zose kila naho wakanda wenula Idihema Idyo Dikukile nawakonge int'hambo, kila fyo neditambe viligane na hant'hu hakwe aho ili ibendela yakwe.<verse eid="NUM 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 2:18" />“Kwe nt'hendelo ya Usweelo wa zuwa, wadya we hasi ye bendela ye nk'hambi ya Ifulaimu nawaike nk'hambi viligane na mafyo yawe. Kilongozi ywawe naande ni Elishama mwana Amihudi, <verse eid="NUM 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 2:19" />uwazilo wa want'hu we difyo dyawe nawande want'hu alufu milongo mine na magana mashano. 40,500 <verse eid="NUM 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 2:20" />Dikalawa idifyo dya Waifulaimu neditimile difyo dye dikabila dya Manase dikalongozwa ni Gamalieli mwana Pedasuli, <verse eid="NUM 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 2:21" />Uwazilo wawe nawande want'hu alufu milongo mitatu na miidi na magana maidi. 32,200 <verse eid="NUM 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 2:22" />Akajika ni dikabila dya Benjamini dikalongozwa ni Abidani mwana Gidioni, <verse eid="NUM 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 2:23" />uwazilo wawe nawande want'hu alufu milongo mitatu na mishano na magana mane. 35,400 <verse eid="NUM 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 2:24" />Uwazilo wa want'hu mwe nk'hambi ya Efulaimu wandaga want'hu alufu gana na mnane na gana dimwenga. 108,100. Difyo idi dya Ifulaimu nedinde dya katatu kila int'hambo ikakonga.<verse eid="NUM 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 2:25" />“Mafyo ya wadya we bendela ya Dani nawaike nk'hambi kwe nt'hendelo ya kasikazi, wakalongozwa ni Ahizeli mwana Amishadai, <verse eid="NUM 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 2:26" />uwazilo wawe nawande want'hu alufu milongo mtandatu na maidi na magana mfungate. 62,700 <verse eid="NUM 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 2:27" />Want'hu we dikabila dya Asheli nawo watimilaga wakalawa awo wakalongozwa ni Pagieli mwana Okilani, <verse eid="NUM 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 2:28" />uwazilo wawe wandaga want'hu alufu milongo mine na imwenga na magana mashano. 41,500<verse eid="NUM 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 2:29" />“Akajika naho watimilaga want'hu we diakabila dya Nafutali wakalongozwa ni Ahila mwana Enani, <verse eid="NUM 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 2:30" />uwazilo wawe wandaga want'hu alufu milongo mishano na nt'hatu na magana mane. 53,400 <verse eid="NUM 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 2:31" />Uwazilo wa want'hu we nk'hambi ya Dani wandaga alufu milongo gana na milongo mishano na mfungate na magana mtandatu. 157,600. Difyo idi dya Dani nidyo nedizigiile mwo utafi viligane ne zibendela zawe.”<verse eid="NUM 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 2:32" />Awo nawo Waizilaeli wawazigwa viligane ne zink'holo zawe na mwe zink'hambi na mafyo yawe. Wose kwa hamwenga wandaga alufu magana mtandatu na nt'hatu na magana mashano na milongo mishano. 603,550 <verse eid="NUM 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 2:33" />Mna Walawi hawawazigwe hamwenga na Wazilaeli watuhu enga ivo Zumbe amsigiile Musa.<verse eid="NUM 2:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 2:34" />Ivo nivo Waizilaeli wadamanye kila kint'hu enga viya Zumbe amsigiile Musa. Waikaga nk'hambi zawe wakatimila zibendela zawe mwo utafi wawe kila yumwenga kwajili yo lukolo lwakwe ne mp'huga yakwe.<verse eid="NUM 2:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="NUM 3" />
  <para style="s">Wana wa Haluni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 3:1" />Ivi nivo vyeleko va Haluni na Musa mwo lupisi ludya Zumbe eze alonge na Musa mo Mnima Sinai. <verse eid="NUM 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 3:2" />Aya nayo mazina ya wana Haluni na vyeleko vakwe. Nadabu nt'hulasasu na Abihu na Eleazali na Isamali. <verse eid="NUM 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 3:3" />Niyo wakukizwa na kuikwa lumwe mwo undima wo ulava nt'hambiko. <verse eid="NUM 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 3:4" />Mna Nadabu na Abihu wabanikaga umwo wamlavilaga Zumbe Mnungu moto houmwelele uko kwe dijangwa dya Sinai. Awo wandaga hawana wana ivo Eleazali na Isamali wadamanyaga ndima ya ulava nt'hambiko mwo ugima wa tati yawe Haluni.<verse eid="NUM 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Walawi wasagulwa wande wandima wa walava nt'hambiko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 3:5" />Akajika Zumbe niyo amgamba Musa, <verse eid="NUM 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 3:6" />“Wegale Walawi kwa mlava nt'hambiko Haluni vileke wande wandima wakwe. <verse eid="NUM 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 3:7" />Nawamdamanyile ndima Haluni na Waizilaeli hamwenga na ha want'hu wose aho wakudamanyila undima he Dihema Dikukile. <verse eid="NUM 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 3:8" />Nawande wakaulizi we vyombo vose ve Dihema Dikukile na kuwambiza Waizilaeli umwo wakadamanya ndima zawe Hant'hu Hakukile. <verse eid="NUM 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 3:9" />Ndima wenk'higwe Walawi ni kunda wambizi wa Haluni na wanawe awo walava nt'hambiko walavigwe mwa Waizilaeli kwajili ya kuwadamanyila ndima. <verse eid="NUM 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 3:10" />Uwasagule Haluni na wanawe vileke wadamanye ndima ya ulavant'hambiko. Mnt'hu yeyose akuunga adisogeele Dihema Dikukile naakomwe.”<verse eid="NUM 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 3:11" />Niyo Zumbe amgamba Musa, <verse eid="NUM 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 3:12" />“Ivi haluse hiwasagula Walawi mwe Izilaeli yose, kila nt'hulasasu ywe kilume naelekwe mwe mp'huga ya Izilaeli, Walawi awo nawande wangu, <verse eid="NUM 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 3:13" />kwaviya kila nt'hulasasu mwe Izilaeli naande ywangu. Mwo lupisi ludya nize niwakome nt'hulasasu wose mwe isi ya Misili niyo wakukizwa kila nt'hulasasu mwe Izilaeli, naho kila nt'hulasasu ywa mnt'hu hegu mifugwa yawe naande ywangu. Ni miye Zumbe.”<verse eid="NUM 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Walawi wawazwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 3:14" />Zumbe alongaga na Musa mwe dijangwa dya Sinai akamgamba, <verse eid="NUM 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 3:15" />“Wana wa Lawi wose wawazigwe viligane na zink'holo zawe ne zimp'huga zawe, kila mwana ywa kilume kukongela mwezi umwenga na kugendeela.” <verse eid="NUM 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 3:16" />Ivo niyo wawazigwa ni Musa enga ivo Zumbe asigiile.<verse eid="NUM 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 3:17" />Awa nawo wandaga wana wa Lawi, Gelishoni, Kohasi na Melali. <verse eid="NUM 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 3:18" />Aya nayo mazina ya wana wa Gelishoni viligane ne zimp'huga zawe, Libini na Shimei. <verse eid="NUM 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 3:19" />Wana wa Kohasi viligane ne zimp'huga zawe ni Amlani, Izihali, Hebuloni na Uzieli. <verse eid="NUM 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 3:20" />Wana wa Melali viligane ne zink'holo zawe ni Mahili na Mushi. Awa nawo welekwa wa Walawi viligane ne zink'holo zawe.<verse eid="NUM 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 3:21" />Walibuni na Washimei walawa kwo lukolo lwa Gelishoni. <verse eid="NUM 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 3:22" />Uwazilo wawe viligane na ivo wawazigwe wagosi kukongela mwezi umwenga na kugendeela wandaga alufu mfungate na magana mashano. 7,500 <verse eid="NUM 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 3:23" />Zink'holo za Wagelishoni zaungagwa kuika nk'hambi kwe nt'hendelo ya ulailo wa zuwa kunyuma ye Dihema Dikukile. <verse eid="NUM 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 3:24" />Eliyasafu mwana Laeli andaga niye mkulu ywo lukolo lwa Wagelishoni. <verse eid="NUM 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 3:25" />Ndima za Wagelishoni zandaga ni ukaulizi we Dihema Dikukile hamwenga ne ngubiko yakwe hamwenga ne dipazia ne nk'hili ye Dihema Dikukile, <verse eid="NUM 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 3:26" />mapazia yo uwa uzunguluke Dihema Dikukile na hant'hu ho kulavila nt'hambiko ne dipazia dye nk'hili dyo uwa ne zisigi zakwe.<verse eid="NUM 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 3:27" />Kohasi niye andaga ichotoko che zink'holo za Waamlani na Waishalina na Wahebloni na Wauzieli, awo nawo wandile nk'holo za Wakohasi. <verse eid="NUM 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 3:28" />Viligane no uwazilo wa wagosi wose kukongela mwezi umwenga na kugendeela wandaga alufu mnane na magana mtandatu, 8,600 awo nawo wadaga wandima wa Hant'hu Hakukile. <verse eid="NUM 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 3:29" />Zink'holo za wana Kohasi neziungwa ziike nk'hambi zawe kwe nt'hendelo ya Kusini ya Hant'hu Hakukile, <verse eid="NUM 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 3:30" />Elisafani naye akanda niye mkulu ywe zink'holo za Wakohasi. <verse eid="NUM 3:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 3:31" />Awo nawo wandaga wandima yo ukaulizi we Disanduku dye Ndagano ne meza ne kinala che vimuli na hant'hu ho kulavila nt'hambiko hakufunk'hizila ubani ne vint'hu vose vo undima wo ulava nt'hambiko Hant'hu Hakukile ne dipazia dikupanga hant'hu hakukile na hakukise. Undima wose uwo wandaga ni wawe.<verse eid="NUM 3:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 3:32" />Eleazali mwana Haluni mlava nt'hambiko aikagwa kunda mkulu mwa wakulu wa Walawi kunda mnyamp'hala mwa wandima wose wa Hant'hu Hakukile.<verse eid="NUM 3:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 3:33" />Melali niye andaga ichotoko che zink'holo za Wamahili na Wamushi awo nawo wandile nk'holo za Melali. <verse eid="NUM 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 3:34" />Uwazilo we zink'holo za Melali viligane no uwazilo wa wagosi wose kukongela mwezi umwenga na kugendeela wandaga want'hu alufu mtandatu na magana maidi. 6,200 <verse eid="NUM 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 3:35" />Mkulu wo lukolo lwa Melali andaga ni Suliali mwana Abihaili. Want'hu awa waungagwa waike nk'hambi zawe mwe nt'hendelo ya kaskazini ye Dihema Dikukile. <verse eid="NUM 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 3:36" />Awa nawo wandaga wandima wo ukaulizi we zimbao ze Dihema Dikukile ne mizengo yakwe ne visimiko vakwe ne vihambajengo vakwe vose vikutozeleza Dihema Dikukile. Undima wose we vint'hu ivi nounda wawe. <verse eid="NUM 3:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 3:37" />Iviya iviya waungagwa waike mizengo ne visimiko vakwe ne zimambo zakwe ne zisigi zakwe.<verse eid="NUM 3:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 3:38" />Musa na Haluni na wana wawe waungagwa kuika nk'hambi yawe kulongole ye Dihema Dikukile kwe nt'hendelo yo ulailo wa zuwa. Undima wawe wandaga kuwambiza Waizilaeli kwa dyodyose nawakadiunga aho Hant'hu Hakukile. Mnt'hu yeyose naasogeele naakomwe. <verse eid="NUM 3:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 3:39" />Uwazilo wa Walawi viligane ne zink'holo zawe wagosi wawazagwa kukongela mwezi umwenga na kugendeela, awo Musa na Haluni wawazaga kwa sigilizi ya Zumbe, wandaga want'hu alufu milongo miidi na maidi. 22,000<verse eid="NUM 3:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Walawi waguha Nt'hulasasu we kilume kwa Waizilaeli.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 3:40" />Zumbe amgambaga Musa, “Wawaze nt'hula sasu we kilume wa mwezi umwenga na kugendeela niyo wawandika mazina yawe. <verse eid="NUM 3:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 3:41" />Unizaguile miye Zumbe walawi wa nt'hulasasu mwa Wazilaili na mifugwa yose ya Walawi nayo ikimale mwa nt'hulasasu ye mifugwa ya Wazilaili.” <verse eid="NUM 3:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 3:42" />Ivo Musa awawazaga nt'hulasasu wose wa Wazilaili enga ivo Zumbe amsigiilaga. <verse eid="NUM 3:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 3:43" />Uwazilo wa nt'hulasasu wose we kilume enga ivo wawazigwe na mazina yawe, kukongela mwezi umwenga na kugendeela, wandaga alufu milongo miidi na magana maidi na milongo mfungate na nt'hatu. 22,273<verse eid="NUM 3:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 3:44" />Zumbe Mnungu amgambaga Musa, <verse eid="NUM 3:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 3:45" />“Niikile Walawi wose wande nt'hulasasu mwa Wazilaili. Naho uniikile welekwa wa nk'hongo we mifugwa yose ya Walawi mwa welekwa wa nk'hongo we mifugwa ya Wazilaili. Ni miye Zumbe. <verse eid="NUM 3:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 3:46" />Mna kwaviya weyuko nt'hula sasu wengi kujink'ha Walawi awo wasump'huule want'hu magana maidi na milongo mfungate na nt'hatu awo waungwa wakombolwe kulawa kwangu, <verse eid="NUM 3:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 3:47" />nauhokele kwa kila mgosi matundu shekeli shano, viligane ne kihimo kiikigwe cha hant'hu Hakukile, <verse eid="NUM 3:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 3:48" />na matundu ayo yo kuwakomboela wadya Wazilaili wasump'huule nouyenk'hize kwa Haluni na wanawe.” <verse eid="NUM 3:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 3:49" />Ivo Musa aduganyaga matundu yo ukombola kulawa kwa awo wasump'hulaga mwo uwazilo wakombolwe ni walawi, <verse eid="NUM 3:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 3:50" />ahokelaga kulawa kwa nt'hulasasu wa Waizilaeli. Ahokelaga matundu magana mlongo na magana matatu na milongo mtandatu na shano 1,365 viligane ne kihimo cha hant'hu hakukile, <verse eid="NUM 3:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 3:51" />niyo Musa awenk'ha Haluni na wanawe yadya matundu ya maliho enga ivo Zumbe Mnungu amgambaga adamanye.<verse eid="NUM 3:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="NUM 4" />
  <para style="s">Ndima ya Walawi mwo lukolo lwa Kohasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 4:1" />Zumbe niyo awagamba Musa na na Haluni, <verse eid="NUM 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 4:2" />“Wawazeni want'hu wose wo lukolo lwa Kohasi, na yumwenga ywo lukolo lwa Lawi kwa kutimila nk'holo zawe, <verse eid="NUM 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 4:3" />naho uwawandike wagosi wose kukongela miyaka mlongo mitatu mpaka milongo mishano awo wakudaha undima mwe Dihema Dikukile. <verse eid="NUM 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 4:4" />Indima ya wana wa Kohasi mwe Dihema Dikukile ni ukaulizi we vint'hu vikukise. <verse eid="NUM 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 4:5" />Hakeza mpaka ho kusamiza ink'hambi, Haluni na wanawe nawengile mwe Dihema waseleze dipazia dikupanga hant'hu Hakukile na Hakukise dya kundani vileke wagubikile Disanduku dye Ndagano. <verse eid="NUM 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 4:6" />Kulanga mwe idyo dipazia nawaike ngubiko ya nk'hingo ihuhile ya kala dya kwe bahali, akajika wagubike kitambala cha buluu niyo wagela mwe idya mikimaila yakwe.<verse eid="NUM 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 4:7" />“Mnanga mwe meza ya kulaviliza mikate ikuikwa kwa Zumbe nawatandike kitambala cha buluu mnanga mwe suke iyo nawaike mabeseni na vihungu na nyiga na vikombe va kulavila malavo yo vint'hu vo kunywa. Mikate iyo neiikigwe mnanga mwe meza mazuwa yose. <verse eid="NUM 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 4:8" />Akajika nawaguhe kitambala kink'hundu niyo wagubikila vint'hu ivo vose, mnanga mwe meza nawagubike na ngubiko ya nk'hingo ihuhile ya kala dya kwe bahali akajika nawegale mihiko yo kwinuila.<verse eid="NUM 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 4:9" />“Nawaguhe suke ye buluu niyo wagubikila kinala che vimuli ne vimuli vakwe ne mikasi yakwe ne vihungu vakwe vo kuikila nk'hala za moto na vint'hu vakwe vose vo kugeela mavuta ye mizeituni kwajili ye ndima iyo. <verse eid="NUM 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 4:10" />Nawakigubike hamwenga ne vint'hu vakwe vose mwe nk'hingo ihuhile ya kala dya kwe bahali na kuinyinya mnanga ye mihiko yo kwinuila.<verse eid="NUM 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 4:11" />“Akajika nawatandike kitambala kibuluu mnanga mwe kilingo cho kutambikila kidamanywe kwa zahabu, nawahagubike kwa kingo ihuhile ya kala dye kwe bahali. Akajika naasomeke mihiko yakwe yo kwinuila. <verse eid="NUM 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 4:12" />Nawaguhe vint'hu vose vidamanyile ndima aho hant'hu hakukile no kugubika mwe icho kitambala kibuluu na kuvigubika ne nk'hingo iyo. Akajika naaviike mnanga mwe mihiko yo kwinuila. <verse eid="NUM 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 4:13" />Nawause maivu aho hant'hu ho kulavila nt'hambiko hadamanywe kwa shaba, niyo watandika kitambala cha zambalau. <verse eid="NUM 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 4:14" />Mnanga mwakwe nawaike vyombo vose vandile vikadamanyila mviko hadya hant'hu ho kulavilant'hambiko, vyetezo na uma na vipawa na nyiga. Naho mnanga mwakwe nawagubike na nk'hingo iyo niyo waigela mihiko ya kwinuila. <verse eid="NUM 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 4:15" />Umwo Haluni na wanawe wakanda wagubika kale Hant'hu Hakukile ne vint'hu vakwe vose vileke utafi ukonge, want'hu wo lukolo lwa Kohasi nawavinule. Mna woho hawakuzumilwa kuvi kwafa ivint'hu ivo vikukile sema wana komigwe. Ino niyo ndima ya want'hu wo lukolo lwa Kohasi kila aho Dihema Dikukile dikasamaizwa. <verse eid="NUM 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 4:16" />Eleazali mwana mlava nt'hambiko Haluni aungigwa kunda mkaulizi wa mavuta ye vimuli no ubani una mhemp'he na malavo ya nk'hande ya kila mazuwa na mavuta ya kuhaka yo kuikila vint'hu mwo undima umwo mwe Dihema Dikukile.”<verse eid="NUM 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 4:17" />Zumbe awagambaga Musa na Haluni, <verse eid="NUM 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 4:18" />“Msekuleka lukolo lwe mp'huga ya Kohasi mwa Walawi lukakomigwa umwo waneza hagihi ne vyombo ivo vikukile, <verse eid="NUM 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 4:19" />Ivo elo vileke muwahonye ne mbuli ino, Haluni na wanawe wengile kundani niyo wawapangila awo want'hu kila yumwenga na undima wakwe na icho akuungwa kwinula. <verse eid="NUM 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 4:20" />Mna welekwa wa Kohasi wasekwingila niyo wakaula vint'hu ivo vikukise, wanadamanya ivo nawabanike.”<verse eid="NUM 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ndima ya Walawi wo lukolo lwa Wagelisoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 4:21" />Zumbe amgambaga Musa, <verse eid="NUM 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 4:22" />“Want'hu wo lukolo lwa Gelisoni wawazigwe viligane ne zink'holo zawe ne zimp'huga zawe. <verse eid="NUM 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 4:23" />Wagosi wose wakukongela miyaka milongo mitatu na wa milongo mishano, wose wakudaha kudamanya ndima mwe Dihema Dikukile. <verse eid="NUM 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 4:24" />Undima wawe nounde ni uno. <verse eid="NUM 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 4:25" />Awo nawenule dipazia dye Dihema Dikukile, hamwenga ne ngubiko yakwe ne nk'hingo ihuhile mnanga mwakwe ne dipazia dye nk'hili, <verse eid="NUM 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 4:26" />dipazia ne zisigi zo uwa umnk'handa mwe Dihema Dikukile na hant'hu ho kulavila nt'hambiko ne dipazia dye nk'hili ye uwa ne vint'hu vose vo undima. Iyo niyo indima yawe. <verse eid="NUM 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 4:27" />Undima wawe wose, unde wa kwinula hegu ndima nt'huhu neidamanywe viligane na ivo Haluni na wanawe ivo wasigiile. Nouwapangile undima wawe ne vint'hu vose wakuungwa kuvinula. <verse eid="NUM 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 4:28" />Ino niyo indima ya lukolo lwa Gelishoni mwe Dihema Dikukile. Nawadamanye ndima wakalongozwa ni Isamali mwa Haluni mlavant'hambiko.<verse eid="NUM 4:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ndima ya Walawi mwo lukolo lwa Melali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 4:29" />“Naho uwawaze wana Melali vikuligana ne zink'holo zawe ne zimp'huga zawe. <verse eid="NUM 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 4:30" />Wawazigwe wagosi wose kukongela miyaka milongo mitatu mpaka milongo mishano, wose wakudaha undima mwe Dihema Dikukile. <verse eid="NUM 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 4:31" />Undima wawe nounde ni kwinula mbao ze Dihema Dikukile no mkiki, <verse eid="NUM 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 4:32" />hamwenga ne mikimaila ikudizunguluka uwa ne visimiko vakwe ne vigingi vakwe na luzigi hamwenga ne vint'hu vakwe vose. Uwasigigiile kila yumwenga viligane na ivo akuungwa enule. <verse eid="NUM 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 4:33" />Iyo niyo indima ya want'hu wo lukolo lwa Melali mwe ndima yawe yose mndani mwe Dihema Dikukile wakalongozwa ni Isamali mwana mlavant'hambiko Haluni.”<verse eid="NUM 4:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Walawi wawazigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 4:34" />Ivo, Musa na Haluni na vilongozi wawe wose wawawazaga want'hu wo lukolo lwa Kohasi viligane ne zimp'huga zawe, <verse eid="NUM 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 4:35" />niyo wawawaza want'hu wose wata miyaka milongo mitatu mpaka milongo mishano. Awo waonekaga kugamba nawadahe undima mwe Dihema Dikukile. <verse eid="NUM 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 4:36" />Uwazilo wawe viligane ne zink'holo zawe wandaga want'hu alufu mbili na magana mfungate na milongo mishano. 2,750 <verse eid="NUM 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 4:37" />Awo nawo wawazigwe mwo lukolo lwa Kohasi wose wadamanyaga ndima mwe Dihema Dikukile, ivo Musa na Haluni niyo wawawaza enga ivo Zumbe amsigiile Musa.<verse eid="NUM 4:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 4:38" />Uwazilo wa want'hu wo lukolo lwa Gelishoni viligane ne zimp'huga zawe, <verse eid="NUM 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 4:39" />we miyaka milongo mitatu mpaka milongo mishano awo waonekaga kugamba wadaha undima mwe Dihema Dikukile. <verse eid="NUM 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 4:40" />Wandaga want'hu alufu mbili na magana mtandatu na milongo mitatu. 2,630 <verse eid="NUM 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 4:41" />Uwo nuwo uwazilo wa want'hu we zink'holo za wana Gelishoni awo wandaga wandima mwe Dihema Dikukile awo wawazagwa ni Musa na Haluni enga ivo Zumbe amsigiilaga Musa. <verse eid="NUM 4:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 4:42" />Uwazilo wa want'hu wo lukolo lwa Melali viligane na zink'holo zawe ne zimp'huga zawe, <verse eid="NUM 4:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 4:43" />wata miyaka milongo mitatu mpaka milongo mishano, awo wawagilwe mwo undima we Dihema Dikukile, <verse eid="NUM 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 4:44" />Uwazilo wawe wandaga want'hu alufu nt'hatu na magana maidi. <verse eid="NUM 4:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 4:45" />Uno nuwo uwazilo wa want'hu wo lukolo lwa Melali awo wawazagwa ni Musa na Haluni enga ivo Zumbe amsigiilaga Musa.<verse eid="NUM 4:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 4:46" />Walawi wose niyo wawazigwe ni Musa na Haluni ne vilongozi wa want'hu viligane ne zimp'huga zawe ne zink'holo zawe, <verse eid="NUM 4:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 4:47" />kukongela miyaka milongo mitatu mpaka miyaka milongo mishano wose wawagilwe kudamanya ndima yo kwinula Dihema Dikukile. <verse eid="NUM 4:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 4:48" />Uwazilo wa want'hu awo wandaga alufu mnane na magana mashano na milongo mnane. <verse eid="NUM 4:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 4:49" />Kila yumwenga enk'hagwa ndima yakwe yo kudamanya mwo kwinula Dihema Dikukile enga ivo Zumbe amsigiilaga Musa.<verse eid="NUM 4:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="NUM 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 5:1" />Zumbe amgambaga Musa, <verse eid="NUM 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 5:2" />“Wagambile Waizilaeli wamlave kuse ye nk'hambi kila mnt'hu mta matana na kila mnt'hu akulawa ufila na yeyose akegeile usavu kwa kutoza kint'hu kifile. <verse eid="NUM 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 5:3" />walaveni kuse ye nk'hambi want'hu wose wagosi kwa wavele, wanase kugela usavu nk'hambi yangu iyo hwikala.” <verse eid="NUM 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 5:4" />Waizilaeli nivo watendaga, wawalava kuse ye nk'hambi, enga ivo Zumbe amsigiilaga Musa.<verse eid="NUM 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Maliho yo uwavu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 5:5" />Ivi nivo Zumbe amsigiilaga Musa, <verse eid="NUM 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 5:6" />“Wagambile Wazilaeli uneva mnt'hu yeyose mgosi hegu mvele anakola masa kwa miawe naande na masa kwa miye Zumbe Mnungu, <verse eid="NUM 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 5:7" />vamuunga akweiile wavu wakwe. Mnt'hu uyo naalave maliho yakint'hile. Naho noongezele imwenga ya shano ya maliho ayo niyo amwink'ha uyo amtendele wavu. <verse eid="NUM 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 5:8" />Mna uneva mnt'hu uyo kabanika naho kaswesa ndugu ywa hagihi akudaha kuhokela maliho ayo, ivo maliho ayo ya masa nayande ya Zumbe wenk'higwe walavant'hambiko, maliho ayo ni hamwenga na dolome ya mwiivano ya kuusila wavu wakwe. <verse eid="NUM 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 5:9" />Malavo yose yakukile yakulavigwa ni Wazilaili, nayande yakwe mlavant'hambiko. <verse eid="NUM 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 5:10" />Kila kint'hu alavilwe Zumbe nekinde cha mlavant'hambiko na kila kint'hu akumlavilwa mlava nt'hambiko, icho nekinde cha mlavant'hambiko.”<verse eid="NUM 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Masa ya mvele akufanyanywa kunda mgoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 5:11" />Zumbe amgambaga Musa, <verse eid="NUM 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 5:12" />Longa na Wazilaili uwagambe, “Uneva mkaza mt'hu kaganika niyo aswesa uhuwilwa kwa mgosiwe, <verse eid="NUM 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 5:13" />kwa kugenda na mgosi mtuhu haheina mgosiwe hegu mnt'hu yeyose kumanya, uyo kakegela usavu, naho hahana muwona ywe mbuli iyo kwaviya hagwiligwe ugoni. <verse eid="NUM 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 5:14" />Niyo mgosiwe anengilwa ni kiyangayanga na wivu kwa mkaziwe akegeile usavu, hata uneva mkaziwe hakegeile usavu, <verse eid="NUM 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 5:15" />ivo wose waidi nawaite kwa mlavant'hambiko na kwigala malavo yakuungigwa, malavo ayo ni kopo dimwenga dya unga wa shaili, mna isekugelwa mavuta hegu ubani, kwaviya ni malavo ya nk'hande ya yakulavigwa kwa mgosi akumfanyanya mkaziwe.<verse eid="NUM 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 5:16" />“Mlavant'hambiko naamsogeze hagihi uyo mvele, no kumkimalisa kwa Zumbe. <verse eid="NUM 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 5:17" />Akajika naagide mazi yakukile mwo lwiga niyo aguha nt'hifu ya sanga hasi mwe Dihema Dikukile na kuigela mwa ayo amazi vileke yande yesungu. <verse eid="NUM 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 5:18" />Mlavant'hambiko namwigale yudya mvele kwa Zumbe no kuzichakula zifili na kumwik'ha mvele uyo malavo ya nk'hande ikulavigwa kwajili yo wivu wa mgosiwe. Mlavant'hambiko mwenye naatoze chombo kiya cha mazi yesungu yakwigala ligito. <verse eid="NUM 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 5:19" />Akajika mlavant'hambiko namwelise yudya mvele akamgamba, ‘Uneva hugendile na mgosi mtuhu na kukegela usavu ukanda na mgosiyo, mazi aya yesungu hayakwigaile ligito. <verse eid="NUM 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 5:20" />Mna uneva kugenda na mgosi mtuhu ukamanya una mgosiyo nounde kukegela usavu, <verse eid="NUM 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 5:21" />Mnungu akutende ligito mwa want'hu wako, unde mgumba naho inda yako itutuke. <verse eid="NUM 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 5:22" />Mazi ayo yakugela ligito yengile mwe nda yako na kukutenda mgumba na nda yako itutuke.’ Mvele uyo neetikile ‘Taile.’<verse eid="NUM 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 5:23" />“Naho mlavant'hambiko naawandike maligito ayo mwe kitabu niyo ayasunt'hila mwa mazi vileke ayo yesungu, <verse eid="NUM 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 5:24" />akajika naamnywese mvele uyo amazi ayo yesungu yakugela ligito, mazi ayo nayamwingile na kumtenda alumiswe uneva katenda ivo, <verse eid="NUM 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 5:25" />mlavant'hambiko naakonge kuguha yadya malavo ye nk'hande yo wivu mwe mikono ya uyo mvele na kuyaika kwa Zumbe niyo ayegala he kilingo cho kutambikila. <verse eid="NUM 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 5:26" />Naho naaguhe kifumba kimwenga cha malavo ayo ya nk'hande no kuyoka aho hant'hu hakukile kunda lukumbusa, akajika namnywese uyo mvele mazi ayo. <verse eid="NUM 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 5:27" />Akajika ukunywa, uneva handile mhuwilwa kwa mgosiwe niyo akegela usavu mazi ayo yakugela ligito neyengile mwe nda yakwe nakunda yesungu, nda yakwe nayo neitutuke naivo naande mgumba. Mvele uyo naande kaligitwa mwa want'hu wakwe. <verse eid="NUM 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 5:28" />Mna uneva mvele uyo hakegeile usavu naho kazumilwa kwa Zumbe, haaligitwe naho naande na cheleko.<verse eid="NUM 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 5:29" />“Ivo, uno nuwo umwiko wo wivu uneva mvele kaganika niyo akegela usavu kwa mgosi mtuhu umwo akamanya kugamba ana mgosiwe, <verse eid="NUM 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 5:30" />hegu hata mgosi amfanyanya vihile mkaziwe. Mlavant'hambiko naamkimalise mvele uyo kwa Zumbe niyo mlavant'hambiko amdamanyila imiko iyo yose. <verse eid="NUM 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 5:31" />Mgosiwe haande na masa yeyose mna mvele naande na masa.”<verse eid="NUM 5:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="NUM 6" />
  <para style="s">Sigilizi ne Kilapi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 6:1" />Zumbe amgambaga Musa, <verse eid="NUM 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 6:2" />“Uwagambe Waizilaeli ivi, uneva mgosi hegu mvele naakelise kukeika kwa Zumbe, <verse eid="NUM 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 6:3" />akeike hale no ukozi, asekunywa divai hegu mp'hombe yoyose idamanywe kwa zabibu hegu kudya zabibu ziivile hegu zinyaile. <verse eid="NUM 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 6:4" />Mazuwa ayo yose akanda mkilapi asekudya kint'hu chochose kidamanywe kwa zabibu hegu mbeyu za zabibu hegu makoa yakwe.<verse eid="NUM 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 6:5" />“Mwo lupisi lwose aikile kilapi cho kukeika kwa Zumbe, haamogigwe mpaka ibinde lupisi lwe kilapi chakwe cho kukeika kwa Zumbe. Mnt'hu uyo aungwa azileke zifili zakwe zise kumogwa. <verse eid="NUM 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 6:6" />Lupisi lwose aikile kilapi cha kukeika kwa Zumbe asekusogeela kimba chochose, <verse eid="NUM 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 6:7" />kikanda cha ise abanike hegu nine hegu lumbudye hegu nduguye ywa kigosi vileke anase kukegela usavu, kwaviya kiwalo che kilapi cho kukeika kwa Zumbe kimwo mtwi wakwe. <verse eid="NUM 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 6:8" />Lupisi lwose lwe kilapi cho kukeika kwa Zumbe, yehe naande kakuka.<verse eid="NUM 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 6:9" />“Uneva mnt'hu anetukila kabanika hagihi na mnt'hu mta kilapi, file za uyo mta kilapi nezigeligwe usavu, naamoge fili zakwe mwe dizuwa dya mfungate kwa kukukizwa kwakwe. <verse eid="NUM 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 6:10" />Mwe dizuwa dya mnane neegale suwa mbili hegu makinda maidi ya suwa manga kwa mlavant'hambiko he nk'hili ye Dihema Dikukile. <verse eid="NUM 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 6:11" />Mlavant'hambiko naailave imwenga inde malavo ya kuusa wavu, int'huhu nayo neinde ni malavo ya kokwa kwaviya kadamanya wavu kwa kunda hagihi ne kimba. Naakekukize naho zifili zakwe mwe dizuwa iidyo. <verse eid="NUM 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 6:12" />Naaike naho kilapi cha kukeika kwa Zumbe kwa mazuwa yakwe ya kukepanga. Mazuwa ayo ya nk'hongo yasekuwazigwa kwaviya fili zakwe zandile zikuka zigeligwa usavu. Naalave dolome dya mwaka umwenga kunda malavo ya masa.<verse eid="NUM 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 6:13" />“Uno nuwo umwiko wo mwiika kilapi aho lupisi lwake lukasila. Neegalwe kwe nk'hili ye Dihema Dikukile, <verse eid="NUM 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 6:14" />niyo alava malavo yakwe kwa Zumbe, ndolome ya mwaka umwenga hediina lema dyodyose kwa malavo yo kokwa, naho naalave mwate wa mwaka umwenga howiina lema dyodyose kwa malavo yo kuusila wavu na dolome dimwenga hediina lema dyodyose kwa malavo yo utondowazi. <verse eid="NUM 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 6:15" />Iviya iviya naalave nt'hangulu ya mikate haigeilwe ugwadu, mikate iyo ya unga idamanywe kwa mavuta na mikate midodo ihakigwe mavuta hamwenga na malavo ya nk'hande na malavo yo kunywa.<verse eid="NUM 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 6:16" />“Mlavant'hambiko namlavile Zumbe vint'hu vose hamwenga na malavo yakwe yo wavu na malavo yakwe yo kokwa. <verse eid="NUM 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 6:17" />Namlavile Zumbe nt'hambiko ya ngoto kunda malavo ya utondowazi, naailave hamwenga na nt'hangulu ye mikate haigeilwe ugwadu, naho naalave malavo ya nk'hande na malavo yo kunywa. <verse eid="NUM 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 6:18" />Mwiika kilapi uyo naamoge zifili zakwe aho he nk'hili ye Dihema Dikukile niyo azoka mwo moto uwo wihasi ye nt'hambiko ikulavigwa kwajili yo utondowazi.<verse eid="NUM 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 6:19" />“Akajink'ha mlava nt'hambiko naaguhe mkono we ndolome inyemswe hamwenga no mkate umwenga ugeilwe ugwadu, ilaile mwe nt'hangulu na mikate midodo haigeilwe ugwadu. Naamwink'he mta kilapi mwe mikono yakwe, aho eze ibinde kumoga fili zakwe izo andile nazo mwe kuika kilapi. <verse eid="NUM 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 6:20" />Akajika mlavant'hambiko naavinule vint'hu ivo kunda malavo kwa Zumbe. Vint'hu ivi ni malavo yakukile kwa mlavant'hambiko, vikanda ni hamwenga ne kifua kinulwe ne kiga kilavigwe kunda malavo. Yakajika ayo yose, mta kilapi adaha kunywa divai.<verse eid="NUM 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 6:21" />“Ino niyo imiko kwa mnt'hu aikile kilapi. Malavo yakwe kwa Mnungu yaligane ne kilapi chakwe, haheina kufanyanya kint'hu chochose kituhu akudaha kulava naadamanye viligane ne kilapi aikile.”<verse eid="NUM 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uvikilwa wa Mnungu kombokela kwa Walavant'hambiko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 6:22" />Zumbe niyo amgamba Musa, <verse eid="NUM 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 6:23" />“Mgambile Haluni na wanawe, ivi nivo nomuwavikile Waizilaili, muwagambe,<verse eid="NUM 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 6:24" />‘Zumbe awavikile na kuwadima,<verse eid="NUM 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 6:25" />Zumbe awakaule kwa ukise na kuwadamanyila uwedi.<verse eid="NUM 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 6:26" />Zumbe awalagiseni uwedi wakwe na kuwenk'ha utondowazi.’<verse eid="NUM 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 6:27" />“Ivi nivo walavant'hambiko nawawavikile Wazilaili, wanadamanya ivo name neniwavikile.”<verse eid="NUM 6:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="NUM 7" />
  <para style="s">Malavo ye vilongozi yo kudiika kwa Zumbe Dihema Dikukile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 7:1" />Musa eze ibinde kukimalisa Dihema, adihakaga mavuta aditende Dikukile dyoho hamwenga ne vint'hu vakwe vose. Ahahakaga mavuta hant'hu ho kulavila nt'hambiko hamwenga ne vint'hu vakwe vose. <verse eid="NUM 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 7:2" />Vilongozi wa Izilaeli wakulu we zink'holo na vilongozi wa makabila, walavaga malavo yawe awo nawo wamwambizaga Musa kuwawaza want'hu wa Izilaeli. <verse eid="NUM 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 7:3" />Wamwigailaga Zumbe malavo yawe, magali mtandatu yagubikwe, na majeku mlongo na maidi na gali dimwenga kwa kila vilongozi waidi, na jeku dimwenga kwa kila kilongozi. Yakajika ayo wavigalaga kwe Dihema Dikukile, <verse eid="NUM 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 7:4" />Zumbe niyo amgamba Musa, <verse eid="NUM 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 7:5" />“Hokela malavo aya kulawa kwawe vileke yande mwe ndima ye Dihema Dikukile, uwenk'he Walawi kila yumwenga kwajili ye ndima yakwe.” <verse eid="NUM 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 7:6" />Ivo, Musa aguhaga magali na majeku niyo awenk'ha Walawi. <verse eid="NUM 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 7:7" />Wagelisholi niyo wenk'hwa magali maidi na majeku mane viligane ne ndima yawe, <verse eid="NUM 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 7:8" />Wamelali nawo wenk'hagwa magali mane na majeku mnane kwa kuwambiza mwe zindima zawe zose. Wagelishoni na Wamelali walongozagwa ni Isamali mwana mlava nt'hambiko Haluni. <verse eid="NUM 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 7:9" />Mna Musa hawenk'hile chochose Wakohasi kwaviya woho nawanda na undima wo kwinula vint'hu vikukile vikuungwa kuhagatwa.<verse eid="NUM 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malavo ye vilongozi kwajili ye kilingo cho kutambikila.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 7:10" />Vilongozi awo walavaga malavo yawe kwa kuika kwa Zumbe hant'hu ho kulavila nt'hambiko mwe dizuwa diya hahakagwa mavuta. <verse eid="NUM 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 7:11" />Zumbe niyo amgamba Musa, “Kila zuwa kilongozi yumwenga naalave malavo yakwe kwajili ya kuhaika kwa Zumbe hant'hu ho kulavila nt'hambiko.”<verse eid="NUM 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 7:12" />Uyo alavaga malavo mwe dizuwa dye nk'hongo, andaga Nashoni mwana Aminadabu ywe dikabila dya Yuda. <verse eid="NUM 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 7:13" />Malavo yakwe yandaga kihungu kidamanywe kwa masawa kilo imwenga na nusu, na beseni dimwenga dya masawa dyandaga dya lobo nt'hatu ye kilo viligane ne vihimo viikigwe ve Dihema Dikukile. Kihungu ne dibeseni idyo nevinda vimema unga udinyike uhanganywe na mavuta kwajili ya malavo ya nk'hande, <verse eid="NUM 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 7:14" />kihungu kimwenga kidamanywe kwa zahabu uzami wakwe wandaga kilo mlongo chamemaga ubani, <verse eid="NUM 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 7:15" />njeku imwenga na ndolome imwenga ya ndolome ya mwaka umwenga kwajili ya malavo yo kokwa, <verse eid="NUM 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 7:16" />fulata imwenga kwajili ya malavo yo kuusa wavu, <verse eid="NUM 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 7:17" />na njeku mbili na ndolome shano na fulata shano na wanangoto washano wa mwaka umwenga, kwajili ya malavo yo utondowazi. Aya yandaga ni malavo ya Nashoni mwana Aminadabu. <verse eid="NUM 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 7:18" />Uyo alavaga malavo mwe dizuwa dya kaidi andaga Nesaneli mwana Suali, kilongozi ywa kabila dya Isakali, <verse eid="NUM 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 7:19" />alavaga kihungu kimwenga kidamanywe kwa masawa uzami wakwe wandaga kilo imwenga na nusu, na lwiga lumwenga dya masawa dya lobo nt'hatu ya kilo viligane ne vihimo ve Dihema Dikukile, kihungu na biga idyo vamemaga unga udinyike uhanganywe na mavuta kwajili ya malavo ya nk'hande, <verse eid="NUM 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 7:20" />kihungu kimwenga kidamanywe kwa zahabu uzami wakwe wandaga gilamu gana na mlongo chamemaga ubani, <verse eid="NUM 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 7:21" />njeku imwenga na ndolome imwenga ya ndolome ya mwaka umwenga kwajili ya malavo yo kokwa, <verse eid="NUM 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 7:22" />fulata imwenga kwajili ya malavo yo kuusa wavu, <verse eid="NUM 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 7:23" />na njeku mbili na ndolome shano na fulata shano na wanangoto washano wa mwaka umwenga, kwajili ya malavo yo utondowazi. Aya yandaga ni malavo ya Nesaneli mwana Zuali. <verse eid="NUM 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 7:24" />Zuwa dya katatu lwandaga lupisi lwa Eliyabu mwana Heloni, kilongozi ywa kabila dya Zabuloni. <verse eid="NUM 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 7:25" />Malavo yakwe yandaga kihungu kimwenga kidamanywe kwa masawa uzami wakwe wandaga kilo imwenga na nusu, na lwiga lumwenga ludamanywe kwa masawa uzami wakwe wandaga lobo nt'hatu ya kilo viligane ne kihimo che Dihema Dikukile. Ivo vamemaga unga dinyike uhanganywe na mavuta kwajili ya malavo ya nk'hande. <verse eid="NUM 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 7:26" />kihungu kimwenga kidamanywe kwa zahabu uzami wakwe wandaga kilo mlongo chamemaga ubani, <verse eid="NUM 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 7:27" />njeku imwenga na ndolome imwenga ya ndolome ya mwaka umwenga kwajili ya malavo yo kokwa, <verse eid="NUM 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 7:28" />fulata imwenga kwajili ya malavo yo kuusa wavu, <verse eid="NUM 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 7:29" />na njeku mbili na ndolome shano na fulata shano na wanangoto washano wa mwaka umwenga, kwajili ya malavo yo utondowazi. Aya yandaga ni malavo ya Eliyabu mwana Heloni. <verse eid="NUM 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 7:30" />Zuwa dya kane Elisuli mwana Shedeuli kilongozi ewa dikabila dya Lubeni. <verse eid="NUM 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 7:31" />Malavo yakwe yandaga kihungu kimwenga kidamanywe kwa masawa uzami wakwe wandaga kilo imwenga na nusu, na lwiga lumwenga ludamanywe kwa masawa uzami wakwe wandaga lobo nt'hatu ya kilo viligane ne kihimo che Dihema Dikukile. Ivo vamemaga unga dinyike uhanganywe na mavuta kwajili ya malavo ya nk'hande. <verse eid="NUM 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 7:32" />kihungu kimwenga kidamanywe kwa zahabu uzami wakwe wandaga kilo mlongo chamemaga ubani, <verse eid="NUM 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 7:33" />njeku imwenga na ndolome imwenga ya ndolome ya mwaka umwenga kwajili ya malavo yo kokwa, <verse eid="NUM 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 7:34" />fulata imwenga kwajili ya malavo yo kuusa wavu, <verse eid="NUM 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 7:35" />na njeku mbili na ndolome shano na fulata shano na wanangoto washano wa mwaka umwenga, kwajili ya malavo yo utondowazi. Aya yandaga ni malavo ya Elisuli mwana Shedeuli. <verse eid="NUM 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 7:36" />Zuwa dya shano Shelumieli mwana Sulishadai kilongozi ywe dikabila dya Simeoni. <verse eid="NUM 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 7:37" />Malavo yakwe yandaga kihungu kimwenga kidamanywe kwa masawa uzami wakwe wandaga kilo imwenga na nusu, na lwiga lumwenga ludamanywe kwa masawa uzami wakwe wandaga lobo nt'hatu ya kilo viligane ne kihimo che Dihema Dikukile. Ivo vamemaga unga dinyike uhanganywe na mavuta kwajili ya malavo ya nk'hande. <verse eid="NUM 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 7:38" />kihungu kimwenga kidamanywe kwa zahabu uzami wakwe wandaga kilo mlongo chamemaga ubani, <verse eid="NUM 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 7:39" />njeku imwenga na ndolome imwenga ya ndolome ya mwaka umwenga kwajili ya malavo yo kokwa, <verse eid="NUM 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 7:40" />fulata imwenga kwajili ya malavo yo kuusa wavu, <verse eid="NUM 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 7:41" />na njeku mbili na ndolome shano na fulata shano na wanangoto washano wa mwaka umwenga, kwajili ya malavo yo utondowazi. Aya yandaga ni malavo ya Shelumieli mwana Zulishadai. <verse eid="NUM 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 7:42" />Zuwa dya mtandatu Eliyasafu mwana Deueli kilongozi ywa kabila dya Gadi. <verse eid="NUM 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 7:43" />Malavo yakwe yandaga kihungu kimwenga kidamanywe kwa masawa uzami wakwe wandaga kilo imwenga na nusu, na lwiga lumwenga ludamanywe kwa masawa uzami wakwe wandaga lobo nt'hatu ya kilo viligane ne kihimo che Dihema Dikukile. Ivo vamemaga unga dinyike uhanganywe na mavuta kwajili ya malavo ya nk'hande. <verse eid="NUM 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 7:44" />kihungu kimwenga kidamanywe kwa zahabu uzami wakwe wandaga kilo mlongo chamemaga ubani, <verse eid="NUM 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 7:45" />njeku imwenga na ndolome imwenga ya ndolome ya mwaka umwenga kwajili ya malavo yo kokwa, <verse eid="NUM 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 7:46" />na fulata imwenga kwajili ya malavo ya kuusila wavu, <verse eid="NUM 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 7:47" />na njeku mbili na ndolome shano na fulata shano na wanangoto washano wa mwaka umwenga, kwajili ya malavo yo utondowazi. Aya yandaga ni malavo ya Eliyasafu mwana Deuli. <verse eid="NUM 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 7:48" />Zuwa dya mfungate ezaga Elishama mwana Amihudi kilongozi ywa kabila dya Efulaimu. <verse eid="NUM 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 7:49" />Malavo yakwe yandaga kihungu kimwenga kidamanywe kwa masawa uzami wakwe wandaga kilo imwenga na nusu, na lwiga lumwenga ludamanywe kwa masawa uzami wakwe wandaga lobo nt'hatu ya kilo viligane ne kihimo che Dihema Dikukile. Ivo vamemaga unga dinyike uhanganywe na mavuta kwajili ya malavo ya nk'hande. <verse eid="NUM 7:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 7:50" />kihungu kimwenga kidamanywe kwa zahabu uzami wakwe wandaga kilo mlongo chamemaga ubani, <verse eid="NUM 7:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 7:51" />njeku imwenga na ndolome imwenga ya ndolome ya mwaka umwenga kwajili ya malavo yo kokwa, <verse eid="NUM 7:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="NUM 7:52" />na fulata imwenga kwajili ya malavo ya kuusila wavu, <verse eid="NUM 7:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="NUM 7:53" />na njeku mbili na ndolome shano na fulata shano na wanangoto washano wa mwaka umwenga, kwajili ya malavo yo utondowazi. Aya yandaga ni malavo ya Elishama mwana Amihudi. <verse eid="NUM 7:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="NUM 7:54" />Zuwa dya mnane andaga Gamaeli mwana Pedasuli, kilongozi ywa kabila dya Manase. <verse eid="NUM 7:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="NUM 7:55" />Malavo yakwe yandaga kihungu kimwenga kidamanywe kwa masawa uzami wakwe wandaga kilo imwenga na nusu, na lwiga lumwenga ludamanywe kwa masawa uzami wakwe wandaga lobo nt'hatu ya kilo viligane ne kihimo che Dihema Dikukile. Ivo vamemaga unga dinyike uhanganywe na mavuta kwajili ya malavo ya nk'hande. <verse eid="NUM 7:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="NUM 7:56" />kihungu kimwenga kidamanywe kwa zahabu uzami wakwe wandaga kilo mlongo chamemaga ubani, <verse eid="NUM 7:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="NUM 7:57" />njeku imwenga na ndolome imwenga ya ndolome ya mwaka umwenga kwajili ya malavo yo kokwa, <verse eid="NUM 7:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="NUM 7:58" />na fulata imwenga kwajili ya malavo ya kuusila wavu, <verse eid="NUM 7:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="NUM 7:59" />na njeku mbili na ndolome shano na fulata shano na wanangoto washano wa mwaka umwenga, kwajili ya malavo yo utondowazi. Aya yandaga ni malavo ya Gamalieli mwana Padasuli.<verse eid="NUM 7:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="NUM 7:60" />Zuwa dya kenda Abidani mwana Gidioni, kilongozi ywe dikabila dya Benjamini. <verse eid="NUM 7:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="NUM 7:61" />Malavo yakwe yandaga kihungu kimwenga kidamanywe kwa masawa uzami wakwe wandaga kilo imwenga na nusu, na lwiga lumwenga ludamanywe kwa masawa uzami wakwe wandaga lobo nt'hatu ya kilo viligane ne kihimo che Dihema Dikukile. Ivo vamemaga unga dinyike uhanganywe na mavuta kwajili ya malavo ya nk'hande. <verse eid="NUM 7:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="NUM 7:62" />kihungu kimwenga kidamanywe kwa zahabu uzami wakwe wandaga kilo mlongo chamemaga ubani, <verse eid="NUM 7:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="NUM 7:63" />njeku imwenga na ndolome imwenga ya ndolome ya mwaka umwenga kwajili ya malavo yo kokwa, <verse eid="NUM 7:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="NUM 7:64" />fulata imwenga kwajili ya malavo yo kuusa wavu, <verse eid="NUM 7:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="NUM 7:65" />na njeku mbili na ndolome shano na fulata shano na wanangoto washano wa mwaka umwenga, kwajili ya malavo yo utondowazi. Aya yandaga ni malavo ya Abidani mwana Gidioni. <verse eid="NUM 7:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="NUM 7:66" />Zuwa dya mlongo atimilaga Ahiezeli mwana Amishadai, kilongozi ywa kabila dya Dani. <verse eid="NUM 7:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="NUM 7:67" />Malavo yakwe yandaga kihungu kimwenga kidamanywe kwa masawa uzami wakwe wandaga kilo imwenga na nusu, na lwiga lumwenga ludamanywe kwa masawa uzami wakwe wandaga lobo nt'hatu ya kilo viligane ne kihimo che Dihema Dikukile. Ivo vamemaga unga dinyike uhanganywe na mavuta kwajili ya malavo ya nk'hande. <verse eid="NUM 7:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="NUM 7:68" />kihungu kimwenga kidamanywe kwa zahabu uzami wakwe wandaga kilo mlongo chamemaga ubani, <verse eid="NUM 7:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="NUM 7:69" />njeku imwenga na ndolome imwenga ya ndolome ya mwaka umwenga kwajili ya malavo yo kokwa, <verse eid="NUM 7:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="NUM 7:70" />na fulata imwenga kwajili ya malavo ya kuusila wavu, <verse eid="NUM 7:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="NUM 7:71" />na njeku mbili na ndolome shano na fulata shano na wanangoto washano wa mwaka umwenga, kwajili ya malavo yo utondowazi. Aya yandaga ni malavo ya Ahiezeli mwana Amishadai. <verse eid="NUM 7:71" /><verse number="72" style="v" sid="NUM 7:72" />Zuwa dya mlongo na umwenga atimilaga Pagieli mwana Okilani, kilongozi ywe dikabila dya Asheli. <verse eid="NUM 7:72" /><verse number="73" style="v" sid="NUM 7:73" />Malavo yakwe yandaga kihungu kimwenga kidamanywe kwa masawa uzami wakwe wandaga kilo imwenga na nusu, na lwiga lumwenga ludamanywe kwa masawa uzami wakwe wandaga lobo nt'hatu ya kilo viligane ne kihimo che Dihema Dikukile. Ivo vamemaga unga dinyike uhanganywe na mavuta kwajili ya malavo ya nk'hande, <verse eid="NUM 7:73" /><verse number="74" style="v" sid="NUM 7:74" />kihungu kimwenga kidamanywe kwa zahabu uzami wakwe wandaga kilo mlongo chamemaga ubani, <verse eid="NUM 7:74" /><verse number="75" style="v" sid="NUM 7:75" />njeku imwenga na ndolome imwenga ya ndolome ya mwaka umwenga kwajili ya malavo yo kokwa, <verse eid="NUM 7:75" /><verse number="76" style="v" sid="NUM 7:76" />na fulata imwenga kwajili ya malavo ya kuusila wavu, <verse eid="NUM 7:76" /><verse number="77" style="v" sid="NUM 7:77" />na njeku mbili na ndolome shano na fulata shano na wanangoto washano wa mwaka umwenga, kwajili ya malavo yo utondowazi. Aya yandaga ni malavo ya Pagieli mwana Okilani. <verse eid="NUM 7:77" /><verse number="78" style="v" sid="NUM 7:78" />Zuwa dya mlongo na kaidi atimilaga Ahila mwana Enani, kilongozi ywe dikabila dya Nafutali. <verse eid="NUM 7:78" /><verse number="79" style="v" sid="NUM 7:79" />Malavo yakwe yandaga kihungu kimwenga kidamanywe kwa masawa uzami wakwe wandaga kilo imwenga na nusu, na lwiga lumwenga ludamanywe kwa masawa uzami wakwe wandaga lobo nt'hatu ya kilo viligane ne kihimo che Dihema Dikukile. Ivo vamemaga unga dinyike uhanganywe na mavuta kwajili ya malavo ya nk'hande. <verse eid="NUM 7:79" /><verse number="80" style="v" sid="NUM 7:80" />kihungu kimwenga kidamanywe kwa zahabu uzami wakwe wandaga kilo mlongo chamemaga ubani, <verse eid="NUM 7:80" /><verse number="81" style="v" sid="NUM 7:81" />njeku imwenga na ndolome imwenga ya ndolome ya mwaka umwenga kwajili ya malavo yo kokwa, <verse eid="NUM 7:81" /><verse number="82" style="v" sid="NUM 7:82" />na fulata imwenga kwajili ya malavo ya kuusila wavu, <verse eid="NUM 7:82" /><verse number="83" style="v" sid="NUM 7:83" />na njeku mbili na ndolome shano na fulata shano na wanangoto washano wa mwaka umwenga, kwajili ya malavo yo utondowazi. Aya yandaga ni malavo ya Ahila mwana Enani. <verse eid="NUM 7:83" /><verse number="84" style="v" sid="NUM 7:84" />Malavo yose yalavigwe na vilongozi wa Izilaeli kwajili ya hant'hu ho kulavila nt'hambiko, zuwa diya dize diikwe mwo undima kwa Zumbe zandaga vihungu mlongo na mbili vidamanywe kwa masawa, vihungu mlongo na viidi vidamanywe kwa masawa na nyiga mlongo na mbili zidamanywe kwa zahabu. <verse eid="NUM 7:84" /><verse number="85" style="v" sid="NUM 7:85" />Kila kihungu kidamanywe kwa masawa uzami wakwe kilo imwenga na nusu, kila kihungu kidamanywe kwa masawa chandaga na uzani wa lobo nt'hatu ya kilo. ivo vose vandaga gilamu magana mtandatu viligane na vihimo viikigwe ve Dihema Dikukile. <verse eid="NUM 7:85" /><verse number="86" style="v" sid="NUM 7:86" />Viya vihungu va zahabu mlongo na viidi vamemaga ubani, kila kimwenga uzami wakwe wandaga shekeli mlongo viligane ne vihimo viikigwe ve Dihema Dikukilene. Kwa hamwenga vihungu vidamanywe kwa zahabu uzami wakwe shekeli gana na milongo miidi. <verse eid="NUM 7:86" /><verse number="87" style="v" sid="NUM 7:87" />Uwazilo we mifugwa yose ya malavo yo kokwa zandaga njeku mlongo na ndolome mlongo na mbili na wanangoto mlongo na mbili wa mwaka umwenga, na malavo ya unga udinyike na fulata mlongo na mbili kwajili ya malavo kuusila wavu. <verse eid="NUM 7:87" /><verse number="88" style="v" sid="NUM 7:88" />Uwazilo we mifugwa kwa malavo ya utondowazi wandaga njeku milongo miidi na mine na ndolome milongo mtandatu na fulata milongo mtandatu na wana ngoto milongo mtandatu wa mwaka umwenga. Ayo nayo yandaga malavo kwajili ya hant'hu ho kulavila malavo aho heze hande hahakwa kale mavuta.<verse eid="NUM 7:88" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="89" style="v" sid="NUM 7:89" />Aho Musa eze engile mwe Dihema Dikukile akalonge na Zumbe evaga izwi kulawa mlanga mwe ngubiko ikwitangwa hant'hu he zimbazi handaga mnanga mwe Disanduku dye Ndagano na hagati ya viya viumbwa viidi dikalonga naye.<verse eid="NUM 7:89" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="NUM 8" />
  <para style="s">Ukuviika ivimuli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 8:1" />Zumbe amgambaga Musa, <verse eid="NUM 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 8:2" />“Mgambile Haluni kugamba umwo akaika vimuli mfungate mwe vinala, avidongeleke vidahe kuzangaza kulongole ye kinala icho.” <verse eid="NUM 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 8:3" />Haluni adamanyaga enga ivo asigiilagwa, avidongelekaga ivo vinala vileke vizangaze kulongole ye kinala enga ivo Zumbe amsigiilaga Musa. <verse eid="NUM 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 8:4" />Ivi nivo chadamanyagwa kinala icho che vimuli. Kulawa kulanga mpaka hasi chadamanyagwa kwa zahabu isanigwe viligane na ivo Zumbe amsigiilaga Musa.<verse eid="NUM 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Walawi wapagulwa na kuikwa kwa Zumbe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 8:5" />Naho Zumbe amgambaga Musa, <verse eid="NUM 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 8:6" />“Uwapagule Walawi mwa Wazilaili, naho uwakukize. <verse eid="NUM 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 8:7" />Ivi nivo nouwakukize. Uwamyagile mazi yo kukukizila akajika uwagambe wakemoge mwili wose na kufigisa zisuke zawe, ivo nawande wakuka. <verse eid="NUM 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 8:8" />Naho nawaguhe njeku imwenga hamwenga na malavo yakwe yo unga udinyike uhanganywe na mavuta, naho nawaguhe njeku nt'huhu kwajili ya malavo ya kuusila wavu. <verse eid="NUM 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 8:9" />Akajika nouwalete Walawi he Dihema Dikukile naho uwaduganye waizilaeli. <verse eid="NUM 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 8:10" />Umwo Walawi wakanda ha Zumbe, Waizilaeli nawawageleke Walawi mikono mwe mitwi yawe, <verse eid="NUM 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 8:11" />akajika Haluni naawaike awo Walawi ha Zumbe wakenula mikono yawe enga malavo ya kwinulwa vileke wande wandima wangu. <verse eid="NUM 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 8:12" />Ivo Walawi nawageleke mikono yawe mwe mitwi ye zinjeku izo. Njeku imwenga nowiilave kunda malavo yo kuusa wavu, int'huhu nayo neinde malavo yo kokwa pele ayo yakulavigwa kwangu, kwaajili ya kuwakukiza Walawi na kuwatenda waivane na Zumbe.<verse eid="NUM 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 8:13" />“Akajika nouwakimalise Walawi ha Haluni na wanawe, niyo wawaika hangu kunda enga malavo ya kwinulwa kwa Zumbe. <verse eid="NUM 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 8:14" />Ivi nivo nouwapagule Walawi mwa Wazilaili watuhu, naivo Walawi nawande wangu. <verse eid="NUM 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 8:15" />Aho ukabinda kuwakukiza na kuwalava enga malavo ya kwinulwa, nawande wazumilwa mwo kudamanya ndima ze Dihema Dikukile. <verse eid="NUM 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 8:16" />Awo nawapagulwa wandilise wangu hant'hu ha nt'hulasasu wa Wazilaili. <verse eid="NUM 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 8:17" />Kwa viya nt'hulasasu wose mwa Wazilaili wangu, want'hu na makala, kwa viya nawatendaga wande wakukile kwajili yangu umwo nawakomaga nt'hula sasu wose mwe isi ya Misili. <verse eid="NUM 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 8:18" />Haluse hiwaguha Walawi hant'hu ha nt'hulasasu we kigosi mwa Wazilaili, <verse eid="NUM 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 8:19" />naho himwink'ha Haluni na wanawe kunda geleko kulawa mwa Wazilaili, vileke wadamanye ndima ze Dihema Dikukile kwaajili ya Waizilaeli no kuwatenda waivane na Zumbe vileke wanase kukomwa umwo wakahasogeela aho Hant'hu Hakukile.” <verse eid="NUM 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 8:20" />Ivo Musa na Halunii na want'hu wose wa Izilaeli wawaikaga Walawi kwa Zumbe enga ivo Zumbe amsigiilaga Musa. <verse eid="NUM 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 8:21" />Walawi wakekukizaga wavu wawe na kufigisa suke zawe. Haluni awalavaga kunda malavo ha Zumbe, ivo Haluni awenulaga mikono yawe kulanga na kuwaika kwa Zumbe kunda enga malavo ya kwinulwa, na kuwakukiza na kuwavuza kwa Zumbe. <verse eid="NUM 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 8:22" />Yakajika ayo, Walawi wagendaga kudamanya ndima ze Dihema Dikukile wakalongozwa ni Haluni na wanawe viligane na ivo Zumbe amsigiilaga Musa.<verse eid="NUM 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 8:23" />Naho Zumbe amgambaga Musa, <verse eid="NUM 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 8:24" />“Ino niyo isigilizi kwa Walawi wakuungwa kuitimila. Nawaungwe kudamanya ndima ze Dihema Dikukile kukongela wata miaka milongo miidi na mishano, <verse eid="NUM 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 8:25" />naho naahumule undima wakwe akanda na miaka milongo mishano. <verse eid="NUM 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 8:26" />Mna wadaha kuwalangiliza wanduguzawe wakadamanya ndima ze Dihema Dikukile, mna woho wenye wasekudamanya ndima yoyose. Ivi nivo nouwapangile ndima Walawi.”<verse eid="NUM 8:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="NUM 9" />
  <para style="s">Pasaka ya kaidi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 9:1" />Mwo mwezi wa nk'hongo aho Wazilaili weze walawe mwe isi ya Misili. Zumbe alongaga na Musa ukwo kwo mnima wa Sinai. Akamgamba, <verse eid="NUM 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 9:2" />“Waizilaeli waungwa watoze dizuwa dye kinyemi dye Pasaka viligane no lupisi lwiikigwe. <verse eid="NUM 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 9:3" />Neinde mwe dizuwa dya mlongo na kane mwo mwezi uuno. Nawatende ivo umwo mwalagulo viligane ne miko na ivo wasigiilwe.” <verse eid="NUM 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 9:4" />Ivo Musa awagambaga want'hu kugamba waungwa kudikumbukila dizuwa idyo dye kinyemi dye Pasaka, mwalagulo mwe dizuwa dya mlongo na kane. <verse eid="NUM 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 9:5" />Ivo wadyaga Pasaka mwe dizuwa dya mlongo na kane dyo mwezi wa nk'hongo ukwo kwedijangwa dya Sinai. Waizilaili wadamanyaga yose enga ivo Zumbe amsigiilaga Musa.<verse eid="NUM 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 9:6" />Mna want'hu wamwenga wandaga hawadahaga kudya dizuwa dye kinyemi dye Pasaka kwaviya wakegelaga usavu kwa kutoza kimba, awo wawabasaga Musa na Haluni <verse eid="NUM 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 9:7" />niyo wawagamba, “Suwe kiwasavu kwaviya nekitoza kimba, mna nii chalemezwa kunda hamwenga na Waizilaili watuhu mwo kumlavila Zumbe malavo yakwe mwe dizuwa diya diikigwe?”<verse eid="NUM 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 9:8" />Musa niyo awahitula, “Gojeni mpaka aho Zumbe naanigambile cho kudamanya mwa nyuwe.”<verse eid="NUM 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 9:9" />Ivi nivo Zumbe amhitulaga Musa, <verse eid="NUM 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 9:10" />“Wagambe Wazilaili, yumwenga ywenyu hegu mwelekwa ywenyu ana kegela usavu kwajili ya kutoza kimba hegu ananda mwo utafi, mna aunga adye Pasaka ya Zumbe, <verse eid="NUM 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 9:11" />mnt'hu enga uyo aungwa kudamanya ivo uneva unomboka mwezi umwenga, mwalagulo wa mlongo na kane mwo mwezi wa kaidi. Naadye Pasaka iyo ne mikate heigeligwe ugwadu hamwenga na mboga zisungu za mani. <verse eid="NUM 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 9:12" />Wasekusigaza nk'hande yoyose mpaka mtondo, naho wasekutula vuha dyodyose dye ngoto ye Pasaka. Nawadye Pasaka vilagane ne zisigilizi zose ze Pasaka. <verse eid="NUM 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 9:13" />Mna kwa yeyose heedile Pasaka, hamwenga na kugamba kakuka naho handile hale kwo utafi, uyo naapagulwe mwa want'hu wa Wazilaili kwaviya hanilavile malavo yangu kwa lupisi lwiikigwe, uyo naasulumizwe kwajili yo wavu wakwe.<verse eid="NUM 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 9:14" />“Uneva eyuko mgeni akwikala mwenyu mna aunga adye Pasaka, mnt'hu uyo aungwa atende viligane ne zisigilizi zose ze Pasaka. Kila mnt'hu aungwa kutimila zisigilizi iziya ze Pasaka, akanda mgeni hegu mkaya.”<verse eid="NUM 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vunde dya Moto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 9:15" />Mwe dizuwa diya Dihema Dikukile dyakimagwa, vunde dyadigubikaga idyo Dihema. Umwo nekilo vunde idyo nedinda enga moto mpaka mtondo. <verse eid="NUM 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 9:16" />Ivo nivo vandaga mwa mazuwa yose, divunde dyagubikaga Dihema Dikukile msi na kilo, naho dyaonekaga kunda enga moto aho nekilo. <verse eid="NUM 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 9:17" />Kila aho divunde nedikenulwa kulanga ye Dihema, Waizilaeli nawo wazamizaga ink'hambi na kugenda kuika nk'hambi hant'hu hatuhu aho dyakimaga idivunde idyo. <verse eid="NUM 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 9:18" />Kwa sigilizi ya Zumbe Waizilaeli watambaga, naho wakimaga ink'hambi kwa sigilizi ya Zumbe. Lupisi lwose aho divunde dyandaga halanga he Dihema Dikukile, Waizilaeli wekalaga he nk'hambi. <verse eid="NUM 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 9:19" />Uneva divunde dyekalisaga halanga ya Dihema Dikukile, Waizilaeli nawo watimila ivo Zumbe aungaga, hawadahaga kuisamiza ink'hambi. <verse eid="NUM 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 9:20" />Hamwenga aha divunde dyekalaga kwa lupisi lugihi viligane na ivo Zumbe aungaga, ivo want'hu nawo wekalaga kwa mazuwa mageke viligane na ivo Zumbe asiigile. <verse eid="NUM 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 9:21" />Mwo lupisi lutuhu divunde dyekalaga halanga he Dihema Dikukile kilo chose mpaka mtondo iviya dikenulwa mtondo Waizilaeli nawo wenukaga. Inde nomsi hegu nekilo lupisi lwolwose aho divunde nedinukile woho nawo waungwa kwinuka. <verse eid="NUM 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 9:22" />Hata uneva divunde nedigubike Dihema Dikukile kwa mazuwa maidi hegu mwezi umwenga hegu lupisi lutali, Waizilaeli waungagwa kwikala aho he nk'hambi haheina kuhalawa, mna divunde dikeza kwinuka woho nawo waungwa kusama. <verse eid="NUM 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 9:23" />Wakimaga nk'hambi naho watambaga kwa kutimila zisigilizi za Zumbe viligane na ivo amsigiilaga Musa.<verse eid="NUM 9:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="NUM 10" />
  <para style="s">Magunda ya masawa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 10:1" />Zumbe amgambaga Musa, <verse eid="NUM 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 10:2" />“Damanya magunda maidi yasanigwe kwa masawa, magunda ayo nayande ni ya kuwaduganyila want'hu na ya kuwagambila want'hu mwo kusamiza ink'ahmbi. <verse eid="NUM 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 10:3" />Umwo magunda ayo maidi yakatoigwa yose kwa hamwenga want'hu wose nawadugane hako aho he nk'hili ye Dihema Dikukile. <verse eid="NUM 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 10:4" />Mna uneva dinatoigwa gunda dimwenga du, nawadugane hako ni vilongozi du, awo wakulu we zink'holo za Waizilaeli. <verse eid="NUM 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 10:5" />Kilagiso cha kutoa gunda dya kwitusa kinalaila, want'hu wose we nk'hambi za ulailo wa zuwa nawakonge utafi. <verse eid="NUM 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 10:6" />Kilagiso icho che digunda kinatoigwa kaidi kwa izwi dya kwitusa, nk'hambi zose zi nt'hendelo ya Kwa mwenye mzi nawakonge utafi. Digunda idyo neditoigwe umwo wakaungwa kusamiza ink'hambi. <verse eid="NUM 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 10:7" />Mna mwo lupisi lwo kuwetanga want'hu wadugane, magunda nayatoigwe kwa maizwi yazoelwe. <verse eid="NUM 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 10:8" />Vyeleko va Haluni awalavant'hambiko nawo nawatowe magunda ayo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 10:8">“Izi nezinde sigilizi ya mazuwa yose mwe vyeleko venyu vose. <verse eid="NUM 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 10:9" />Naho aho mkagenda kutoa nk'hondo mwe isi yenyu, kutoana na wak'hondo wakuwatowani nyuwe, aho nomtoe magunda maidi ya kilagiso cha nk'hondo. Zumbe Mnungu ywetu naaweveni na kuyokolwa na wank'hondo wenyu. <verse eid="NUM 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 10:10" />Naho mwa mazuwa ye vinyemi venyu enga viya mwandamo wo mwezi na mazuwa matuhu ya kinyemi nomtoe magunda ayo, aho mkalava malavo yenyu yo kokwa pele, na malavo yenyu ya utondowazi. Aho miye Mnungu ywenu neniwakumbukileni. Ni Miye Zumbe Mnungu ywenu.”<verse eid="NUM 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Waizilaeli Wahalawa Sinai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 10:11" />Mwe dizuwa dya milongo miidi dyo mwezi wa kaidi wo mwaka wa kaidi, aho want'hu wa Izilaeli weze walawe Misili, divunde dyandaga halanga he Dihema Dikukile dyenulagwa, <verse eid="NUM 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 10:12" />Waizilaeli nawo wakongaga int'hambo yawe ya kulawa mwe dijangwa dya Sinai. Divunde idyo dyakimalaga mwe dijangwa dya Palani.<verse eid="NUM 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 10:13" />Aho niho Waizilaeli wakongaga int'hambo yawe ye nk'hongo kwa sigilizi ya Zumbe enga ivo amsigiilaga Musa. <verse eid="NUM 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 10:14" />Wadya wandaga we kiwalo cha watowani we dikabila dya Yuda walongolaga fyo kwa fyo. Kilongolozi ywawe andaga Nahashoni mwana Aminadabu. <verse eid="NUM 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 10:15" />Nesaneli mwana Suali andaga kilongozi ywa watowani we dikabila dya Isakali. <verse eid="NUM 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 10:16" />Eliyabu mwana wa Heloni naye andaga kilongozi ywa watowani we dikabila dya Zabuloni.<verse eid="NUM 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 10:17" />Akajika Dihema Dikukile dyaselezwagwa ni want'hu wo lukolo lwa Wagelisoni na Wamelali awo wadinulaga, wakongaga int'hambo.<verse eid="NUM 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 10:18" />Naho wadya wandaga we kiwalo cha watowani we dikabila dya Lubeni watimilaga fyo kwa fyo. Kilongozi ywawe andaga Eliyasuli mwana Shedeuli. <verse eid="NUM 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 10:19" />Shelumieli mwana wa Sulishadai adilongozaga kabila dya Simeoni. <verse eid="NUM 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 10:20" />Niyo Eliyasafu mwana wa Deueli nakadilongoza dikabila dya Gadi.<verse eid="NUM 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 10:21" />Niyo wawatimila want'hu we zink'holo za Kohasi awo wenulaga vyombo vikukile. Weze wabule wadibwilaga Dihema dikimigwa kale.<verse eid="NUM 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 10:22" />Niyo watimila want'hu we kiwalo che difyo dikulongozwa ni kabila dya Ifulaimu. Kilongozi wawe nakanda Elishama mwana wa Emihudi. <verse eid="NUM 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 10:23" />Gamalieli mwana wa Pedasuli nakadilongoza kabila dya Manase, <verse eid="NUM 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 10:24" />Na Abidani mwana Gidioni yehe nakadilongoza kabila dya Benjamini.<verse eid="NUM 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 10:25" />Kwo uheelo wadya wandaga mwe difyo dikulongozwa ni dikabila dya Dani, wandaga wamizi wa mafyo yose wakongaga int'hambo fyo kwa fyo. Awa nawakalongozwa ni Ahiezeli mwana Amishadai. <verse eid="NUM 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 10:26" />Pagieli mwana wa Okilani nakadilongoza dikabila dya Asheli. <verse eid="NUM 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 10:27" />Na Ahila mwana wa Enani nakadilongoza dikabila dya Nafutali. <verse eid="NUM 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 10:28" />Ivo nivo vandaga mwo utafi wawe Waizilaeli viligane na mafyo yawe, umwo wandaga wakakonga utafi.<verse eid="NUM 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 10:29" />Musa amgambaga Hobabu mnamuwe mwana Yesilo Mmidiani mkwewe dya Musa, “Suwe chaita nt'hambo uko Zumbe akigambile, ‘Neniwenk'heni nyuwe hant'hu aho.’ Elo kinde hamwenga, naswe nekidamanye ayedi kwa viya Zumbe nakaika Ndagano na suwe kugamba naakivile.”<verse eid="NUM 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 10:30" />Mna Hobabu niyo ahitula, “Bule, Miye hikuita na nyuwe mna neniuye mwe isi yangu na kwa wandugu zangu.”<verse eid="NUM 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 10:31" />Musa niyo amgamba “Chakulombeza usekukileka,” “Weye kumanya hant'hu kikudaha kutoa nk'hambi mwe dijangwa naho wadaha kukilangiliza. <verse eid="NUM 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 10:32" />Naho unaita hamwenga na suwe nekihokele chose uvikilwa udya Zumbe akuunga akink'he.”<verse eid="NUM 10:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Want'hu wakonga utafi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 10:33" />Ivo want'hu weze wakonge utafi wa kulawa mo mnima Sinai Mnima wa Mnungu, utafi uwo nounda wa mazuwa matatu. Disanduku dye Ndagano dyawalongoelaga vileke wazungule hant'hu ha kuikima ink'hambi. <verse eid="NUM 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 10:34" />Aho weze wakonge utafi wa kulawa mwe nk'hambi imwenga kuita int'huhu vunde dya Zumbe dyandaga mnanga mwawe msi wose.<verse eid="NUM 10:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 10:35" />Aho Disanduku dye Ndagano dikakonga utafi, Musa agambaga, “Zumbe Mnungu inuka wank'hondo wako wachakuke! Na awo wakukuihiya wakunyilike!” <verse eid="NUM 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 10:36" />Aho Disanduku dye Ndagano dize dikimale, agambaga, “Zumbe wauiye awa mafyo na mafyo ya Waizilaeli.”<verse eid="NUM 10:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="NUM 11" />
  <para style="s">Hant'hu hakwitangwa Tabela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 11:1" />Want'hu wakongaga kumlabiila Zumbe mwe makunt'ho yawe. Musa amlombezaga Zumbe Mnungu, naye eze eve awafiilaga maya niyo egala moto wawakomaga wamwenga wawe na koka nt'hendelo imwenga ye nk'hambi yawe. <verse eid="NUM 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 11:2" />Want'hu wamwiilaga Musa, Musa naye amlombezaga Zumbe, moto nawo niyo wazima. <verse eid="NUM 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 11:3" />Ivo hant'hu aho hetangwagwa Tabela kwaviya moto wa Zumbe wawokaga wamwenga wawe.<verse eid="NUM 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Musa awasagula vilongozi milongo mfungate.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 11:4" />Mwa Waizilaeli awo, mwandaga na fyo kulu dya want'hu dyawatimilaga. Want'hu awo waonaga umelo wa kudya nyama. Hata Waizilaeli nawo wakongaga kulabila wakagamba, “Hegu naswe chapatile nyama yo kudya! <verse eid="NUM 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 11:5" />Chakumbukila samaki chandaga kikadya uko Misili hahehina maliho, na matanga na matikiti na mboga za mani na vitunguu na vitunguu swaumu. <verse eid="NUM 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 11:6" />Mna ivi haluse kisokela naho hahana hata nk'hande ya kudya mna ni imana du!”<verse eid="NUM 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 11:7" />Mana iyo yandaga enga mbeyu ndodo ya uhemba naho yandaga injano. <verse eid="NUM 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 11:8" />Want'hu niyo wakonga kuilogota na kuisigint'ha kwa maiwe na kuibunda na kuyambika mwe zinyungu vileke vinde vikate. Navo vandaga vimwiile enga vikate vambikwe na mavuta ya zeituni. <verse eid="NUM 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 11:9" />Aho mnyuzu wize ugwe nekilo mwe nk'hambi mana nayo yagwaga hamwenga no mnyuzu uwo.<verse eid="NUM 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 11:10" />Musa evaga want'hu wakaila na kulabila mwe zimp'huga zawe kila yumwenga he nk'hili ye dihema dyakwe. Ivo Zumbe aonesaga maya, Musa naye niyo aihizwa.<verse eid="NUM 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 11:11" />Musa niyo amgamba Zumbe, “Nii ukamwigaila mndima ywako makunt'ho aya? Nii hwelelwe na miye, Nii ukanitwika nt'wika ya kuwakaulisa want'hu awa wose? <verse eid="NUM 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 11:12" />Ni miye niweleke hegu niwaumbile want'hu awa wose? Nii ukanigamba niwenule mwe mikono yangu enga mvele akwinula katiti kakwe mwe kifuwa? Nenidahe vivihi kuwenula want'hu awa mwe isi wakelisaga kuwenk'ha wakale wawe? <verse eid="NUM 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 11:13" />Nenilavehi nyama ya kuwegusa want'hu awa wose? Kwaviya wanilabiila wakanigamba niwenk'he nyama. <verse eid="NUM 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 11:14" />Miye hikudaha kuwalongoza want'hu awa wose nikedu, ndima ino ndala kwangu! <verse eid="NUM 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 11:15" />Uneva unanitenda ivi nakulombeza unikome, vileke nisekugendeela mwa makunt'ho yangu.”<verse eid="NUM 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 11:16" />Zumbe niyo amgambaga Musa, “Niduganyile want'hu milongo mfungate mwa vilongozi wa Izilaeli, awo uwamanyize kugamba ni vilongozi wa want'hu, uwegale kwe Dihema Dikukile uwagambe wakimale hamwenga na weye. <verse eid="NUM 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 11:17" />Name neniseele uko nize nilonge na weye. Neniguhe ludodo lwo muye wako no kuuika mwawe, ivo nawadahe kukwambiza kuwalongoza want'hu awa, sema unawalongoze wikedu. <verse eid="NUM 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 11:18" />Haluse wagambe wantu, ‘Kekuzeni kwa zuwa dya luvi nompate nyama mdye, kwaviya nommwiila Zumbe naye kamivani mkaila mkagamba, Niani naakink'he nyama kidye? Nevinda vedi chandile Misili. Ivo elo Zumbe naawenk'heni nyama mdye. <verse eid="NUM 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 11:19" />Homdye nyama iyo kwa zuwa dimwenga du, hegu mazuwa maidi du hegu mazuwa mashano du hegu mazuwa mlongo du hegu milongo miidi du, <verse eid="NUM 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 11:20" />mna nomuidye nyama iyo kwa mwezi wose! Nomuidye niyo mwayehukwa naho homuiunge. Aya yalaila kwaviya mumlemela Zumbe andaga hamwenga na nyuwe niyo mwalabila kugamba nevinda vedi mwandile uuko Misili.’ ”<verse eid="NUM 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 11:21" />Musa niyo amgamba Zumbe, “Want'hu awa huwalongoza ni alufu magana mtandatu 600,000 nawe wagamba uwenk'he nyama wadye kwa mwezi wose! <verse eid="NUM 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 11:22" />Haluse chadaha kuchinja ngoto na ng'ombe za kuwakint'hiza? Hata samaki zose mwe bahali neziwakint'he?”<verse eid="NUM 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 11:23" />Zumbe niyo amhitula Musa, “Udahi wangu una uheelo?” “Howikalise kuona yadya nilongile yakalaila hegu bule!”<verse eid="NUM 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 11:24" />Ivo Musa agendaga kuwagambila want'hu mbuli iyo alongile Zumbe, niyo awaguha vilongozi milongo mfungate. Awagambaga wekale kudizunguluka Dihema Dikukile. <verse eid="NUM 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 11:25" />Zumbe aseelaga mwe divunde niyo alonga na Musa. Aguhaga ludodo mwo muye amwink'haga Musa niyo augela mwa wadya vilongozi milongo mfungate. Weze wengilwe na muye niyo wakonga kulonga enga walotezi, mna hawaguhaga lupisi lutali.<verse eid="NUM 11:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 11:26" />Vilongozi waidi mwa wadya mlongo mfungate wasagulwe, Elidadi na Medadi wasigalaga aho he nk'hambi naho hawalawaga. Muye aweziilaga mwawe hadya he nk'hambi, woho nawo wakongaga kulonga ulotezi kulawa kwa Zumbe. <verse eid="NUM 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 11:27" />Mbwanga yumwenga agulukaga kugenda kumgambila Musa, “Eliudadi na Medadi walava ulotezi mwe nk'hambi.”<verse eid="NUM 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 11:28" />Aho Yoshua mwana Nuni uyo andaga mwambizi ywa Musa amgambaga Musa, “Mkulu walemeze!”<verse eid="NUM 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 11:29" />Mna Musa niyo amhitula, “Weye waona finju kwajili yangu? Havandile vedi zumbe awenk'he want'hu wakwe wose muye nawo wande walotezi!” <verse eid="NUM 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 11:30" />Ivo Musa auyaga mwe nk'hambi hamwenga na wadya vilongozi milongo mfungate wa Izilaeli.<verse eid="NUM 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zumbe awegaila want'hu zink'wale</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 11:31" />Ivo Zumbe egalaga heho dyegalaga nk'wale kulawa kwe bahali zandaga zisambala kuzunguluka ink'hambi, kwa uhale mtali kulawa he nk'hambi. Zakeumbikaga kilundo cha mp'hima mbili kuita kulanga. <verse eid="NUM 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 11:32" />Ivo mwe dizuwa diya dyose, kilo chose na zuwa tuhu dikutimila niyo walogota nk'wale. Hahana mnt'hu alogote ngeke kujink'ha kilo milongo gana. Wazanjazaga vileke zinyale he dizuwa. <verse eid="NUM 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 11:33" />Mna umwo nyama zandaga zikei kusila, Mnungu awafiilaga maya awo want'hu niyo awegaila maine yaihile. <verse eid="NUM 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 11:34" />Ivo hant'hu aho hetangagwa zina dya Kibulosi Hataava kwaviya nuko wamoselagwa msanga want'hu waonaga umelo wa nyama.<verse eid="NUM 11:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 11:35" />Kulawa Kibulosi Hataava want'hu watambaga mpaka Haselosi niyo wakima nk'hambi yawe na kwikala uko.<verse eid="NUM 11:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="NUM 12" />
  <para style="s">Miliamu na Haluni wamhiga Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 12:1" />Akajika Miliamu na Haluni wakongaga kumhiga Musa kwaviya amlombaga mvele ywa Kikushi, <verse eid="NUM 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 12:2" />wakagamba, “Zumbe alongaga na Musa ekedu? halongile na suwe naswe?” Zumbe awevaga kiya walongaga. <verse eid="NUM 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 12:3" />Musa mwenye andaga mnt'hu mjalamu kujink'ha want'hu wose wandaga mwe si.<verse eid="NUM 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 12:4" />Aaho niyo Zumbe awagamba Musa na Haluni na Miliamu, “Nawaungani nyuwe wose watatu mwize kwe Dihema Dikukile.” Ivo wose watatu waitaga kwe Dihema. <verse eid="NUM 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 12:5" />Akajika Zumbe niyo aseela mwo mkola we divunde, akimalaga he nk'hili ye Dihema Dikukile niyo awetanga Haluni na Miliamu nawo wose waidi wezaga kulongole. <verse eid="NUM 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 12:6" />Zumbe niyo awagamba, “Tegelezeni iki hulonga, umwo mlotezi akanda mwenyu, Miye mwenye namanyika kwakwe mwa maona na kulonga naye mwe zisozi. <verse eid="NUM 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 12:7" />Mna hivo ivo mwa Musa mndima ywangu, yehe ni mhuilwa ekedu naho himwink'ha ndima ya kuwakaula want'hu wangu Waizilaeli. <verse eid="NUM 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 12:8" />Miye nalonga na yehe mnomo kwa mnomo naho meso yakwe yaniona ivo nili, mwadaha vivihi kumhiga Musa mndima ywangu?”<verse eid="NUM 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 12:9" />Aaho Zumbe awaihiyaga vihile niyo ahalawa, <verse eid="NUM 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 12:10" />divunde dyahalawaga he Dihema, aaho Miliamu aonekaga kunda na maine mwe nk'handa yakwe. Haluni eze ahituke na kumkaula Miliamu niyo eheelwa kuona Miliamu ana maine ya nk'handa naho nk'handa yakwe yang'alaga mbee. <verse eid="NUM 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 12:11" />Niyo Haluni amwiila Musa akamgamba, “Mkulu, usekukisulumiza kwo wavu uno kidamanye kwa uhezi wetu. <verse eid="NUM 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 12:12" />Usekumtenda Miliamu ande enga mwana elekwe akanda kabanika naho nt'hili yo mwili wakwe ububutwa.”<verse eid="NUM 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 12:13" />Musa amwiilaga Zumbe akamgamba, “Zumbe! nakulombeza umhonye!”<verse eid="NUM 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 12:14" />Zumbe niyo amhitula Musa, “Uneva ise amtweelega mate mwo uso kwa kumkanya kwaviya kadamanya wiihi, hegu hengile soni kwa mazuwa mfungate? Haluse mguluseni mwe nk'hambi ekale kuse kwa mazuwa mfungate, akajika naazumilwe kuuya kwe nk'hambi.” <verse eid="NUM 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 12:15" />Ivo wamgulusaga mwe nk'hambi kwa mazuwa mfungate, naho want'hu awo hawagendeelaga ne nt'hambo mpaka aho Miliamu eze avuzigwe kwe nk'hambi. <verse eid="NUM 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 12:16" />Want'hu awo weze wahalawe aho wakonganga utafi kulawa Haselosi, niyo wakukima nk'hambi mwe dijangwa dya Palani.<verse eid="NUM 12:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="NUM 13" />
  <para style="s">Wapelembi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 13:1" />Zumbe amgambaga Musa, <verse eid="NUM 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 13:2" />“Sagula want'hu wakaipelembe isi ya Kanaani, idya huwenk'ha want'hu wa Izilaeli naho usagule mnt'hu mwe kila kabila dya wakale wawe naho kila mnt'hu ande kilongozi ywo lukolo.”<verse eid="NUM 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 13:3" />Musa adamanyaga enga ivo Zumbe amsigiile, awatumaga want'hu awo kulawa kwe dijangwa dya Palani. Want'hu awo wose wandaga ni vilongozi wa Waizilaeli. <verse eid="NUM 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 13:4" />Mazina ya want'hu awo ni aya,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 13:4">Mwe dikabila dya Lubeni andaga ni Shamua mwana Zakuli. <verse eid="NUM 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 13:5" />Mwe dikabila dya Simeoni andaga ni Shafati mwana Holi.<verse eid="NUM 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 13:6" />Mwe dikabila dya Yuda andaga ni Kalebu mwana Yefune.<verse eid="NUM 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 13:7" />Mwe dikabila dya Isakali andaga Igali mwana Yosefu.<verse eid="NUM 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 13:8" />Mwe dikabila dya Efulaimu andaga ni Hoshea mwana Nuni. <verse eid="NUM 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 13:9" />Mwe kabila dya Benjamini andaga ni Paliti mwana Lafu.<verse eid="NUM 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 13:10" />Mwe dikabila dya Zabuloni andaga Gadieli mwana Sodi.<verse eid="NUM 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 13:11" />Mwe dikabila dya Yusufu nuko kugamba kabila dya Manase, andaga ni Gadi mwana Susi. <verse eid="NUM 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 13:12" />Mwe dikabila dya Dani adaga Amieli mwana Gemali.<verse eid="NUM 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 13:13" />Mwe dikabila dya Asheli andaga Sesuli mwana Mikaeli.<verse eid="NUM 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 13:14" />Mwe dikabila dya Nafutali andaga Nahabi mwana Wofisi.<verse eid="NUM 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 13:15" />Mwe dikabila dya Gadi andaga ni Geueli mwana Maki.<verse eid="NUM 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 13:16" />Awa nawo wandaga wapelembi watumagwa ni Musa wakapelembe isi ya Kanaani. Dizina dituhu dya Hoshea mwana Nuni enk'hagwa ni Musa etangagwa Yoshua.<verse eid="NUM 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 13:17" />Umwo Musa awatumaga want'hu awo wakaipelembe isi ya Kanaani, awagambaga, “Kweleni nt'hendelo ya Kwa mwenye mzi ya Kanaani mpaka kwe isi ye vigulu. <verse eid="NUM 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 13:18" />Kaipelembeni mmanye kugamba iyo isi ivivihi, naho mmanye kugamba want'hu wakwe wana ludole hegu wasokezi, naho wengi hegu wageke. <verse eid="NUM 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 13:19" />Pelembeni mmanye kugamba isi iyo yedi hegu iha, mizi yawe izengelwa gomela hegu bule. <verse eid="NUM 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 13:20" />Mkakaule mmanye kugamba sanga yakwe ina uolozo hegu bule, naho mmanye kugamba isi iyo ina mbago hegu bule, naho mdamanye vovose, umo mkauya mkigaile matunda ye isi iyo.” Msimo udya wandaga ni msimo wa nk'hongo wo kuiva zizabibu.<verse eid="NUM 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 13:21" />Ivo wagendaga kupelemba isi iyo kulawa kwe dijangwa dya Sini hagihi ne sila ya kwingila Lebohamasi. <verse eid="NUM 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 13:22" />Wakwelaga nt'hendelo ya Kusini kombokela kwo mzi wa Hebloni uko wandaga wakekala wakale wa Anaki. Uko wawabwiiga Waahimani na Washeshai na Watalimani vyeleko va Anaki. Mzi wa Hebuloni wakongagwa kuzengwa miyaka mfungate aho mzi wa Soani wa Misili wandaga ukei kuzengigwa. <verse eid="NUM 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 13:23" />Wapelembi awo weze wabule kwe dikolongo dya Eshikoli, wasengaga tambi dyandaga na nk'hwasa zamemaga zabibu izo zenulagwa ni want'hu waidi. Want'hu awo iviyaiviya wegalaga makomamanga mageke na tini. <verse eid="NUM 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 13:24" />Aho hetangagwa kolongo dya Eshikoli nuko kugamba ni nk'hwasa zamemaga zabibu izo zakant'hagwa ni Waizilaeli.<verse eid="NUM 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 13:25" />Want'hu awo wauyaga aho weze wajike kuipelemba isi kwa mazuwa milongo mine. <verse eid="NUM 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 13:26" />Wauyaga kwa Musa na Haluni na kwa want'hu wose wa Izilaeli uko Kadeshi kwe dijangwa dya Palani. Wawagambilaga kiya waonaga na kuwalagisa na amatunda wegalaga. <verse eid="NUM 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 13:27" />Aya nayo wamgambilaga Musa. “Nekiita kwe isi idya wakitumile, kiipelemba naho kiiona ni isi ina ulozo ikuwagila kulima na udimi. Aya nayo matunda yakwe. <verse eid="NUM 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 13:28" />Mna want'hu wakwikala mwe isi iyo ni wata ludole, naho mizi yawe mikulu naho izengelwa gomela. Vitendese nekiyaona mazint'hu makulu welekwa wa Anaki. <verse eid="NUM 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 13:29" />Waamaleki wekala mwe isi ya nt'tendelo ya Kusini, Wahiti na Wayebusi na Waamoli awo wekala mwe isi ye vigulu, Wakanaani wekalaga mwe bahali ya Meditelania mk'handa mwo mto wa Yolidani.”<verse eid="NUM 13:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 13:30" />Mna Kalebi awatondowazaga want'hu ha Musa, niyo agamba, “Kiteni hamwenga kikaguhe isi iyo. Kwaviya kina ludole lwa kuwahuma.”<verse eid="NUM 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 13:31" />Mna want'hu waitaga naye kwo kuipelemba isi iyo wagambaga, “Hekidahe kutoana na want'hu awo, kwaviya want'hu awo wana ludole kujink'ha suwe.” <verse eid="NUM 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 13:32" />Wabwelekezaga lulimi kwa Wazilaeli mwe mbuli ye isi wagendaga kuipelemba wakagamba “Isi iyo yakoma want'hu wakwe. Ivo mazint'hu kiyaone uko makulu. <verse eid="NUM 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 13:33" />Kudya nekiona mazint'hu welekwa wa Anaki. Suwe nekioneka kunda enga mp'hasi kwawe.”<verse eid="NUM 13:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="NUM 14" />
  <para style="s">Want'hu wa Izilaeli walabila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 14:1" />Waizilaeli wose wailisaga kwa kuboha mwe kilo chose. <verse eid="NUM 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 14:2" />Waizilaeli wose wawalabiilaga Musa na Haluni wakagamba, “Hegu vandile vedi chabanikile kudya kwe isi ya Misili hegu hata mwe dijangwa idi! <verse eid="NUM 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 14:3" />Zumbe nii akakigala mwe isi ino vilekile kikakomwa kwa kuchinjigwa? Wavele wetu na wana wetu nawatahigwe! Ni vedi kiuye Misili?” <verse eid="NUM 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 14:4" />Wakongaga kukegamba, “Kisagule kilongozi mtuhu kiuye Misili.”<verse eid="NUM 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 14:5" />Aho Musa na Haluni wafikaga madi na kufunamiza mitwi yawe hasi ho mdugano wose wa Waizilaeli. <verse eid="NUM 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 14:6" />Yoshua mwana Nuni na Kalebi mwana Yefune awo wandaga mwa wagendile kuipelemba isi ya Kanaani watatulaga zisuke zawe kwa kinyulu, <verse eid="NUM 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 14:7" />na kuwagamba Waizilaeli wose, “Isi iyo kigendile kuikaula itendesa uwedi kwa kulima na udimi. <verse eid="NUM 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 14:8" />Uneva Zumbe anelelwa na suwe, naakigale uko niyo akink'ha isi iyo ina sanga yedi kwa kulima na udimi. <verse eid="NUM 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 14:9" />Mna mse kusaguka kwa Zumbe naho msekuwogoha wakaya we isi iyo, kwaviya awo hawakudaha kukihuma, wamizi wawe uuswaa kwawe, Zumbe e hamwenga na suwe.” <verse eid="NUM 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 14:10" />Mna mdugano wose kwa hamwenga dyagambaga dyaunga diwatowe maiwe Yoshua na Kalebi. Aho niyo ung'azi wa Zumbe waoneka mwe Dihema Dikukile dya Waizilaeli wose.<verse eid="NUM 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Musa awalombezela want'hu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 14:11" />Niyo Zumbe amgamba Musa, “Want'hu awa hawanive mpaka ini? Naho nawanibele mpaka ini hamwenga na mitu mingi iyo nidamanye mwawe? <verse eid="NUM 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 14:12" />Neniwatoe kwa maine ya kutisa na kuwalemela kunda wangu, naho kulawa mwako nenidamanye want'hu watuhu wata ludole wana udahi kujink'ha awo.”<verse eid="NUM 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 14:13" />Mna Musa niyo amgamba Zumbe, “Kuwalava want'hu awa mwe isi ya Misili kwa udahi mkulu. Mna Wamisili waneva kuwatendela ivo want'hu wako, <verse eid="NUM 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 14:14" />wakuwagambila want'hu we isi ino. Kwaviya want'hu awa weva kugamba Zumbe uhamwenga na want'hu awa, naho kuoneka meso kwa meso, naho divunde dyako dyekala mnanga mwawe, naho kugamba wawalongoela mwo mkola wa vunde aho nomsi na mkola wa moto aho nekilo. <verse eid="NUM 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 14:15" />Haluse unawakoma want'hu wako wose kwa hamwenga, want'hu wa si zose wevaga zimbuli zako naweve niyo wagamba, <verse eid="NUM 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 14:16" />Zumbe kadunduga kuwegala want'hu kwe isi iyo alongile kwa kilapi kugamba naawegale, ivo kawakomela he dijangwa. <verse eid="NUM 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 14:17" />Haluse nakulombeza ukilagise udahi wako kwa kudamanya enga ivo walongaga, <verse eid="NUM 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 14:18" />‘Zumbe hiyo mhufu wa maya, naho ana lukunde vitendese awausila want'hu wavu wawe, na uwihi wawe hamwenga na ayo houleke kuusulumiza wavu. Nouwasulumize wana kwa masa ya welesi wawe kukongela cheleko cha katatu na cha kane.’ <verse eid="NUM 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 14:19" />Nakulombeza uwausile want'hu awa wavu wawe kwa lukunde lwako holwiina uheelo enga ivo wawausile kukongela aho walawaga Misili mpaka ivi haluse.”<verse eid="NUM 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 14:20" />Zumbe niyo ahitula, “Neniwausile wavu wawe viligane na ivo uwalombezele. <verse eid="NUM 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 14:21" />Hamwenga na ayo, kwaviya hikudaha kubanika naho enga ivo isi neyenele uwedi wangu utendese, <verse eid="NUM 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 14:22" />hahali mnt'hu yeyose neengile mwe isi idya. Kwaviya wauonaga ung'azi wo undiilo wangu ne mitu nadamanyaga kudya Misili na mwe dijangwa, mna wanigezaga na kunigeza naho walemelaga kuniva. <verse eid="NUM 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 14:23" />Hahali yeyose naaione isi idya naikile kilapi hawagamba wakale wawe kugamba neniwenk'he. Hahali yeyose anilemele akuunga aione isi iyo. <verse eid="NUM 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 14:24" />Mna mtumwa ywangu Kalebi, kanitegelezesa nenimwigale mwe isi iyo naye neengile hamwenga na welekwa wakwe niyo wekala. <verse eid="NUM 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 14:25" />Kwaviya Waamaleki na Wakanaani wekala mwe dikolongo dya isi iyo, luvi hitukeni muite mwe nyika kwa sila ikuita kwe bahali ya Shamu.”<verse eid="NUM 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 14:26" />Zumbe niyo amuuza Musa na Haluni, <verse eid="NUM 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 14:27" />“Mdugano wa want'hu wata wavu nougendeele kunilabiila mpaka ini? Neva ivo Waizilaeli wakulabila, <verse eid="NUM 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 14:28" />haluse wahitule enga ivi, Zumbe agamba, ‘Nakelisa kugamba, kwaviya hikudaha kubanika, neniwatendeleni enga ivo ulombeze. Ni miye Zumbe. <verse eid="NUM 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 14:29" />Nombanike vimba venyu neviduulwe mwe dijangwa idi. Kwaviya nomkanilabiila, hahali hata yumwenga ywenyu kukongela miyaka milongo miidi na kugendeela neengile mwe isi idya. <verse eid="NUM 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 14:30" />Homwingile na kwikala mwe isi nakelisaga kuwenk'hani. Nawengile mwe isi iyo ni Kalebi mwana Yefune na Yoshua mwana Nuni du. <verse eid="NUM 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 14:31" />Mna wana wenyu awo mwagambile nawatahigwe awo nawo neniwegale mwe isi iyo nawo nawaimanye isi iyo nyuwe muilemele, <verse eid="NUM 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 14:32" />mna nyuwe nombanike mwe dijangwa! <verse eid="NUM 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 14:33" />Naho wana wenyu nawande wadimi mwe dijangwa kwa lupisi lwa miyaka milongo mine kwa viya nyuwe nomswesa mhuwi mpaka aho nomsile pele. <verse eid="NUM 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 14:34" />Nomkunt'he kwa miaka milongo mine viligane na masa yenyu, enga ivo mpelembe isi idya kwa mazuwa milongo mine, mwaka mwenga kwa kila zuwa dimwenga. Aho nommanye kugamba miye hiihizwa. <verse eid="NUM 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 14:35" />Miye Zumbe higamba, ikindedi neniwatende wose wadugane aha wanihige. Nawakomigwe wose aha he dijangwa naho nawabanikile aaha.’ ”<verse eid="NUM 14:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 14:36" />Wadya want'hu watumagwa ni Musa wakaipelembe isi wauyaga na kwigala ulosi wa lulimi walekaga want'hu wakamlabiila Zumbe, <verse eid="NUM 14:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 14:37" />want'hu awo wegalaga ulosi wa lulimi mwe isi, watowagwa maine yaihile niyo wabanika ha Zumbe. <verse eid="NUM 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 14:38" />Mna Yoshua mwana Nuni na Kalebi mwana Yefune wekedu nawo wasigalaga kunda wagima mwa wadya want'hu wagendaga kuipelemba isi.<verse eid="NUM 14:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Waizilaeli wakonga kugeza kuikump'ukila isi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 14:39" />Musa eze alonge ayo kwa Waizilaeli wose, wahongezaga kwa usungu utendese. <verse eid="NUM 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 14:40" />Mtootondo zuwa ditimile wakwelaga kuhinga kwe vigulu niyo wagamba, “Haluse kikeika lumwe kuita kudya Zumbe akigambilaga. Kizumila kugamba kidamanya wavu.”<verse eid="NUM 14:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 14:41" />Mna Musa niyo agamba, “Nii mwahitula sigilizi ya Zumbe dyo kuuya kwe dijangwa? Nyuwe homdahe! <verse eid="NUM 14:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 14:42" />Msekuita uko kwe isi iyo, nomheele kutoigwa ni wank'hondo wenyu kwaviya Zumbe he hamwenga na nyuwe. <verse eid="NUM 14:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 14:43" />Mnagenda kutowana na Waamaleki na Wakanaani nombanike kwe nk'hondo. Kwaviya mleka kumtimila Zumbe yehe haande hamwenga na nyuwe.”<verse eid="NUM 14:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 14:44" />Hata ivo wakombatizaga na kuita kwo lugulu, mna Musa hahalawaga, Disanduku dye Ndagano nadyo hadyalavagwa he nk'hanbi. <verse eid="NUM 14:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 14:45" />Naho Waamaleki na Wakanaani wandaga wekekala mwe isi ye vigulu waselaga niyo wawatowa na kuwahiga. Niyo wawagulusa mpaka kwo mzi wa Holima.<verse eid="NUM 14:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="NUM 15" />
  <para style="s">Sigilizi mwo kulava Nt'hambiko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 15:1" />Zumbe amgambaga Musa, <verse eid="NUM 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 15:2" />“Wagambile Waizilaeli, wanabula mwe isi iyo niwenk'hile nawekale uumwo, <verse eid="NUM 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 15:3" />naho mkanilavile miye Zumbe malavo kulawa mwe mifugwa yenyu, malavo yo kokwa hegu malavo yo kukukint'hiza kilapi hegu kulava malavo ukuunga mwenye hegu malavo ya zuwa dya kinyemi ayo yaikigwe, kunda mhemp'he wedi wa kumwelela Zumbe, <verse eid="NUM 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 15:4" />ivo yudya akuunga alave malavo yakwe, naamwigaile Zumbe malavo ya nk'hande ya kilo imwenga ya unga uumbigwe na kuhanganywa na lita imwenga ya mavuta, <verse eid="NUM 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 15:5" />hamwenga na divai ya malavo ya kunywa neinde ni hamwenga na mwana ngoto ywa malavo yo kokwa pele. <verse eid="NUM 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 15:6" />Mwo lupisi lwa kulava malavo ya ndolome, kilo mbili za unga na mavuta lita imwenga na nusu nevilavigwe kunda malavo ya nk'hande, <verse eid="NUM 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 15:7" />hamwenga na malavo yo kunywa lita imwenga na nusu ya divai. Ni mhemp'he ukumwelela Zumbe. <verse eid="NUM 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 15:8" />Mwo lupisi lwa kumlavila Zumbe njeku kwa malavo yo kokwa pele, hegu malavo kwa kukint'hiza kilapi, hegu malavo ya utondowazi, <verse eid="NUM 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 15:9" />mnt'hu naalave kilo nt'hatu za malavo yo unga uhanganywe na lita mbili za mavuta ya zeituni, <verse eid="NUM 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 15:10" />hamwenga na malavo yo kunywa ya lita mbili za divai ni mhemp'he wedi ukumwelela Zumbe.<verse eid="NUM 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 15:11" />“Ivi nivo vint'hu vikuungwa vilavigwe hamwenga na njeku na ndolome na mwana ngoto na vulata. <verse eid="NUM 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 15:12" />Vint'hu ivo nevinde vingi viligane ne mifugwa iyo ikuunga ilavigwe. <verse eid="NUM 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 15:13" />Kila mnt'hu Muizilaeli naatimile sigilizi izi umo akanda alava malavo yo kokwa pele kunda mhemp'he ukumwelela Zumbe. <verse eid="NUM 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 15:14" />Uneva mna mgeni akwikala hamwenga na nyuwe kwa lupisi hegu mazuwa yose anaunga alave malavo yakwe yo kokwa ya kumwelela Zumbe, mnt'hu uyo aungwa adamanye enga ivo mkudamanya nyuwe. <verse eid="NUM 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 15:15" />Mwe vyeleko vose vikwiza, miko iidya mkunga muitimile nyuwe niyo akuunga aitimile mgeni yeyose akwikala hamwenga na nyuwe ha Zumbe. <verse eid="NUM 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 15:16" />Nyuwe hamwenga na yehe nomnde mwo mwiko uudya umwenga na sigilizi izo.”<verse eid="NUM 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 15:17" />Zumbe amgambaga Musa, <verse eid="NUM 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 15:18" />Wagambe Waizilaeli kugamba mkeza kwingila mwe isi huwegalani, <verse eid="NUM 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 15:19" />kila icho nomdye kulawa mwo ulozo ya mwe isi iyo mwiike hank'handa hant'hu ho ulozo uwo na kunink'ha miye Zumbe. <verse eid="NUM 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 15:20" />Mna mkoka mikate, mkate wa nk'hongo wa ulozo wa nk'hongo wa ngano yenyu naulavigwe kunda malavo kulawa aho ikuhetigwa ingano. <verse eid="NUM 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 15:21" />Mwe vyeleko venyu vose vikwiza nomnilavile miye Zumbe malavo ya nk'hongo yakulawa mwo unga wenyu uumbigwe wa nk'hongo.<verse eid="NUM 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 15:22" />“Mna mnaswesa kutimila sigilizi zose izo niwenk'hile kwa sila ya Musa, <verse eid="NUM 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 15:23" />yose ayo Zumbe amgambile Musa, kukongela mwe dizuwa diya Zumbe asigiilaga na kugendeela mwe vyeleko venyu vose, <verse eid="NUM 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 15:24" />ivo uneva ni masa yadamanywe haheina kumanya na Waizilaeli wose kumanya nawalave jeku dimwenga kunda malavo yo kokwa, kunda mhep'he wa kumwelela Zumbe hamwenga na malavo yakwe ye zink'hande na yo kunywa viligane ne sigilizi yakwe. Iviya iviya want'hu nawalave fulata imwenga kunda malavo ya kuusa uwavu. <verse eid="NUM 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 15:25" />Mlavant'hambiko naawavuze kwa Zumbe Waizilaeli wose, nawo nawausilwe wavu wawe kwaviya waho hawadamanye wavu haheiina kumanya, naho wegala malavo yawe ya nk'hande enga malavo ya kuusa wavu. <verse eid="NUM 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 15:26" />Mdugano wose wa Waizilaeli hamwenga na watakwiza wakwikala nawo nawausilwe wavu kwaviya wose wadamanyaga wavu uwo.<verse eid="NUM 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 15:27" />“Mnt'hu yumwenga anadamanya wavu haheina kumanya naalave nt'hogota kunda malavo ya kuusa wavu. <verse eid="NUM 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 15:28" />Mlavant'hambiko naalave malavo ya kumkukiza mta masa kwa Zumbe kwajili yo mnt'hu uyo, naye nausilwe wavu. <verse eid="NUM 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 15:29" />Nomtimile mwiko umwenga kwa kila mnt'hu akudamanya wavu haheina kumanya, ande mwelekwa ywa Izilaeli hegu mgeni akwikala hamwenga na nyuwe.<verse eid="NUM 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 15:30" />“Mna mnt'hu yeyose anadamanya wavu kwa kumanya ande mwelekwa hegu mgeni naande kamuhomola Zumbe, na ivo aungwa aikwe hale na want'hu wakwe. <verse eid="NUM 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 15:31" />Kwaviya kalemela yadya yalongigwe ni Zumbe na kuibananga idya sigilizi yakwe. Mnt'hu uyo haande naho hamwenga na want'hu wakwe, masa yakwe nayande mwakwe mwenye.”<verse eid="NUM 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mnt'hu heekukumbukila dizuwa dyo kuhumula</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 15:32" />Zuwa dimwenga umo Waizilaeli wandaga mwe dijangwa, waonaga mnt'hu yumwenga akulogota nk'huni mwe Zuwa dya Kuhumula. <verse eid="NUM 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 15:33" />Mnt'hu uyo niyo egalwa kwa Musa na Haluni na kwa Waizilaeli wose watuhu. <verse eid="NUM 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 15:34" />Niyo wamtozeleza kwaviya neinda haikumanyika ivo akuunga atendelwe. <verse eid="NUM 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 15:35" />Zumbe niyo amgamba Musa, “Mnt'hu uyo akomwe, Waizilaeli wose nawamtoe maiwe kuse ye nk'hambi.” <verse eid="NUM 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 15:36" />Ivo want'hu niyo wamlava kuse ye nk'hambi, niyo wamkoma kwa kumtoa maiwe enga ivo Zumbe amsigiilaga Musa.<verse eid="NUM 15:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vilepe va mwe zisuke za Waizilaili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 15:37" />Zumbe amgambaga Musa, <verse eid="NUM 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 15:38" />“Wagambile want'hu wa Izilaeli, uwagambe wakedamanyile vilepe mwe zimp'hindilo ze zisuke zawe naho waike luzi lwa langi ya buluu mnanga mwe kila kilepe. Wagambe wadamanye ivo mwe vyeleko vawe vose vikwiza. <verse eid="NUM 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 15:39" />Umwo mkavikaula vilepe ivo nomkumbukile na kutimila sigilizi zose za Zumbe vileke msekutimila fanyanyi zenyu na yadya mkuyaona na meso yenyu. <verse eid="NUM 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 15:40" />Vilepe ivo neviwambizeni kukumbukila sigilizi zangu zose na kunda want'hu wangu wakukile. <verse eid="NUM 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 15:41" />Ni miye Zumbe Mnungu ywenyu nawalavaga mwe isi ya Misili ninde Mnungu ywenyu. Ni miye Zumbe Mnungu ywenyu.”<verse eid="NUM 15:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="NUM 16" />
  <para style="s">Kafyo ka Waizilaili wasaguke mwa Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 16:1" />Zuwa dimwenga Kola mwana Ishali, wo lukolo lwa Kohasi alawile mwe dikabila dya Walawi wakelungaga na want'hu watuhu watatu wo dikabila dya Lubeni na Dasani na Abilamu, wana Eliyabu na Oni mwana Pelesi, <verse eid="NUM 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 16:2" />wose awo waivanaga na vilongozi wamanyikise magana maidi na milongo mishano wasagulwe ni Waizilaeli, niyo wamlemela Musa. <verse eid="NUM 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 16:3" />Wakelungaga wawahige Musa na Haluni na kuwagamba, “Nyuwe mtendesa, Waizilaeli wose wakuka kwa Zumbe naho ehamwenga na suwe chose. Mna uwagilwa wani vikuleka mwaketenda mazumbe mwa want'hu wose wa Zumbe?”<verse eid="NUM 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 16:4" />Musa eze eve mbuli iyo niyo afika madi na kufunamiza mtwi hasi. <verse eid="NUM 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 16:5" />Niyo amgamba Kola na want'hu wakwe, “Luvi mtondo Zumbe naakilagise ni ani akuunga ande ywakwe naho ni ani andile kakuka. Uyo akuunga amsagule niye akudaha kunda ho undiilo wakwe. <verse eid="NUM 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 16:6" />Elo damanyeni ivi, luvi mtondo weye hamwenga na want'hu wako guheni vihungu, <verse eid="NUM 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 16:7" />mgele nk'hala za moto na ubani mnanga mwakwe niyo mwavigala ha Zumbe. Akajika namuone niani akuunga asagulwe ni Zumbe. Watendesei nyuwe Walawi!”<verse eid="NUM 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 16:8" />Musa amgambaga Kola, “Tegelezani nyuwe Walawi! <verse eid="NUM 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 16:9" />Haluse mwaona ni mbuli ndodo kwenyu kugamba Mnungu ywa Izilaeli awasagulaga nyuwe mwa Waizilaeli wose vileke mdahe kuita hagihi ne Dihema dya Zumbe na kunda wandima kwaajili ya Waizilaeli wose? <verse eid="NUM 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 16:10" />Kawegalani nyuwe na weenyu Walawi kunda hagihi na yehe, mna haluse mwauunga undima wo ulavant'hambiko nawo! <verse eid="NUM 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 16:11" />Hiyo Haluni du akulabiilwa, weye hamwenga na weyao ni kindedi mwamlabiila Zumbe.”<verse eid="NUM 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 16:12" />Musa niyo egala ulosi kwa Datani na Abilamu wana Eliyabu vileke wetangwe mna woho wagambaga, “Suwe hekize! <verse eid="NUM 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 16:13" />Elo, mbuli ndodo kugamba kakilava mwe isi ya Misili iyo ina sanga yedi iwagilwe kulima na udimi vileke eze akikome mwe nyika? Naho aketenda niye mkulu ywetu! <verse eid="NUM 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 16:14" />Hamwenga na ayo yose hukigale mwe isi iyo ina sanga yedi ikuwagilwa kulima na udimi naho hukink'hile ukipe we nk'honde ya mizabibu. Wafanyanya kugamba nouwatende want'hu awa kunda mant'hunt'hu? Hekize!”<verse eid="NUM 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 16:15" />Musa afiilisaga maya niyo amgamba Zumbe, “Usekuzumila malavo ya want'hu awo. Miye higuile mp'hunda ya mnt'hu yeyose naho hahana yeyose nimtendele vihile!”<verse eid="NUM 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 16:16" />Musa niyo amgamba Kola, “Luvi wize hamwenga na want'hu wako ha Zumbe. Haluni naye naande aaho. <verse eid="NUM 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 16:17" />Kila yumwenga ywenyu naguhe chetezo chakwe na kugela ubani akajika neegale ha Zumbe, vose ivo nevinde vyetezo magana maidi na milongo mishano hata Haluni naye neegale chetezo chakwe.”<verse eid="NUM 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 16:18" />Ivo kila yumwenga niyo aguha chetezo chakwe, niyo wagela nk'hala za moto na ubani niyo wagenda kukimala he nk'hili ye Dihema Dikukile, enga ivo watendile Musa na Haluni. <verse eid="NUM 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 16:19" />Kola niyo aduganya mdugano wose wakimalaga ha Musa na Haluni aho he nk'hili ye Dihema Dikukile. Niyo ung'azi wa Zumbe wawalaila want'hu wose! <verse eid="NUM 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 16:20" />Aho Zumbe niyo awagamba Musa na Haluni, <verse eid="NUM 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 16:21" />“Kepaguleni mwa want'hu awo vileke niwakome haluse ivi.”<verse eid="NUM 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 16:22" />Mna Musa na Haluni wafikaga madi na kufunamiza mitwi yawe hasi niyo wagamba, “Weye Mnungu ywa viumbwa vose, uneva mnt'hu yumwenga kakutendela wavu nouwafiile maya want'hu wose?”<verse eid="NUM 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 16:23" />Zumbe niyo amgamba Musa, <verse eid="NUM 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 16:24" />“Wagambe want'hu wahalawe hagihi na mahema ya Kola, Dasani na Abilamu.”<verse eid="NUM 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 16:25" />Ivo Musa akatimilwa na vilongozi wa Izilaeli aitaga kwa Dasani na Abilamu. <verse eid="NUM 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 16:26" />Eze abule niyo awagamba want'hu, “Halaweni mwa mahema ya want'hu waihiile naho msekutoza kint'hu chochose cheivo nomkomwe hamwenga nawo kwajili yo wavu wawe.” <verse eid="NUM 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 16:27" />Ivo niyo want'hu awo wahalawa aho hagihi ne zikaya za Kola na Dasani na Abilamu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 16:27">Dasani na Abilamu wafosaga kuse niyo wakimala kwe zink'hili za mahema yawe wakanda na wavele wawe na wana wawe na wana wadodo. <verse eid="NUM 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 16:28" />Musa awagambaga want'hu, “Ivi nivo nommanye kugamba Zumbe kanisigiila nidamanye ndima zose, kwaviya miye hikudamanya kwa kuunga kwangu mwenye. <verse eid="NUM 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 16:29" />Uneva want'hu awa wanabanika enga ivo wakubanika want'hu watuhu, nommanye kugamba Zumbe Mnungu hanitumile. <verse eid="NUM 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 16:30" />Mna uneva Zumbe Mnungu anadamanya mbuli heinati ilaile, uneva sanga inagubuka na kuwamela want'hu kwa hamwenga na kila kint'hu, niyo waita kwe isi ya want'hu wabanike iivo wakanda wagima, niho nommanye kugamba want'hu awa wamlemela Zumbe.”<verse eid="NUM 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 16:31" />Ivo aaho eze ibinde kulonga mbuli zose, sanga hadya wakimale Dasani na Abilamu yagubukaga, <verse eid="NUM 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 16:32" />sanga yagubukaga niyo wahubugila pele want'hu ne zinyumba zawe na wose wandaga hamwenga na Kola na vose wandaga navo. <verse eid="NUM 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 16:33" />Ivo woho hamwenga na vose ivo vandaga vawe waseelaga uko wakwikala want'hu wabanike wakanda ne vint'hu vawe vose. sanga yawagubikaga, hawaonekaga naho mwo mdugano wa Waizilaeli. <verse eid="NUM 16:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 16:34" />Want'hu wose wandaga hagihi nawo weze weve ndilo zawe wanyilikaga wakagamba, “Kinyilikeni! seka sanga ina kimele naswe!” <verse eid="NUM 16:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 16:35" />Akajika Zumbe Mnungu egalaga moto niyo woka wadya want'hu magana maidi na milongo mishano wadya wagendaga koka ubani kwe Dihema Dikukile.<verse eid="NUM 16:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vihungu va kokela ubani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 16:36" />Ivo Zumbe alongaga na Musa niyo amgamba, <verse eid="NUM 16:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 16:37" />“Mgambe Eliyazali mwana Haluni mlavant'hambiko, avilave viya vihungu va kokela uabani hale na wadya want'hu wokigwe wasigale aho, uzipakuile hant'hu hatuhu izink'hala zimwe vihungu va kokela ubani kwaviya ivo vihungu vikuka. <verse eid="NUM 16:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 16:38" />Vihungu ivo vikuka kwaviya want'hu awa wavigalaga hant'hu ho kulavila nt'hambiko ha Zumbe. Elo guheni vihungu vo kokela ubani va want'hu awo wakomigwe kwajili ya wavu wawe, visanigwe vileke vinde ngubiko ya hant'hu ho kulavila nt'hambiko. Nedinde kanyo kwa Waizilaeli wose.” <verse eid="NUM 16:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 16:39" />Ivo Eliyazali mlavant'hambiko aguhaga viya vihungu vo kokela ubani va shaba ivo vigalwe ha Zumbe na wadya want'hu wokigwe, niyo wavisunt'ha kunda ngubiko ye kilingo cho kutambikila. <verse eid="NUM 16:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 16:40" />Iki chandaga kilagiso kwa waizilaeli kugamba mnt'hu yeyose hiyo mlava nt'hambiko uyo hi mlukolo ywa Haluni asekuita he kilingo cho kutambikila kwa Zumbe. Anadamanya ivo nasengeelwe enga Kola na weyawe. Yose aya yadamanywagwa enga Zumbe Mnungu ivo amsigiilaga Musa amgambile Eleazali.<verse eid="NUM 16:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Haluni akindila makunt'ho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 16:41" />Zuwa ditimile, Waizilaeli wose wakonga kumlabiila Musa na Haluni wakagamba, “Muwakoma want'hu wamwenga wa Zumbe.” <verse eid="NUM 16:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 16:42" />Aho want'hu weze wadugane vileke wawahige Musa na Haluni, wahitukilaga kwe Dihema Dikukile niyo waona kugamba vunde dyadigubikaga naho ung'azi wa Zumbe walailaga. <verse eid="NUM 16:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 16:43" />Musa na Haluni wagendaga kukimala halongole ye Dihema Dikukile, <verse eid="NUM 16:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 16:44" />Zumbe naye niyo amgamba Musa, <verse eid="NUM 16:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 16:45" />“Kenege na want'hu awa vileke niwakome haluse ivi!” Mna woho wafikaga madi na kufunamiza mitwi yawe hasi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 16:45">Mna woho wafunamizaga mitwi yawe hasi. <verse eid="NUM 16:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 16:46" />Musa niyo amgamba Haluni, “Guha kihungu chako ukigele moto na kukiika mnk'handa mwe kilingo cho kutambikila, niyo wagela ubani naho usunguze kuita nacho kwa want'hu na kuwavuza kwa Zumbe. Maya ya Zumbe yase kukimp'huka kwajili yawe, maine ayo yakutisa yakonga.” <verse eid="NUM 16:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 16:47" />Ivo, Haluni niyo adamanya enga ivo agambilwe ni Musa. Nakaguha kihungu chakwe cho kokela ubani na kugulukila mgati mwa want'hu awo wadugane hamwenga. Eze aone kugamba kunt'ho dikonga, agelaga ubani mwe kihungu na kuwavuza kwa Zumbe want'hu awo, <verse eid="NUM 16:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 16:48" />Eze adamanye ivo, dikunt'ho niyo dyakimala, naye akimalaga mgati mwa wabanike na wagima. <verse eid="NUM 16:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 16:49" />want'hu wabanikaga wandaga alufu mlongo na kane magana mfungate, haheina kuwaza wadya wabanike mwo uwavu wa Kola. <verse eid="NUM 16:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 16:50" />Kunt'ho dize dyajike, Haluni auyaga kwa Musa kwe nk'hili ye Dihema Dikukile.<verse eid="NUM 16:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="NUM 17" />
  <para style="s">Nk'home ya Haluni yasuka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 17:1" />Niyo Zumbe alonga na Musa, <verse eid="NUM 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 17:2" />“Wagambe Waizilaeli wakwigaile nk'home mlongo na mbili, kila kabila dimwenga nk'home imwenga. Diwandike kila zina dya yumwenga ywawe mwe nk'home yakwe, <verse eid="NUM 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 17:3" />zina dya Haluni nadyo diwandikwe mwe nkh'ome ikulagisa kabila dya Lawi. Naho nokunde na nk'home imwenga kwa kila kilongozi ywe dikabila. <verse eid="NUM 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 17:4" />Zigale zink'home izo kwe Dihema Dikukile na kuziika halongole hee Disanduku dye Ndagano hant'hu hudugana na weye. <verse eid="NUM 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 17:5" />Nk'home ya mnt'hu neniisagule neisukile. Kwa sila ino nenibinde kulabila kwa waizilaeli wakukutendelani.”<verse eid="NUM 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 17:6" />Musa niyo alonga na Waizilaeli. Vilongozi wawe wose waweenk'he kila yumwenga nk'home yakwe viligane ne dikabila dyakwe na kunda na nkh'ome mlongo na mbili. Nk'home ya Haluni neiikwa hamwenga ni zink'home izo. <verse eid="NUM 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 17:7" />Musa niyo aika zink'home izo ha Zumbe mwe Dihema Dikukile, <verse eid="NUM 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 17:8" />zuwa ditimile, Musa aitaga mwe Dihema Dikukile. Umwo mndani aibwiilaga nk'home ya Haluni ywe dikabila dya Lawi, isukila na kuhota vitambi vilavile mabwali na kweleka matunda ya ziti dikwitangwa mlozi yaivile. <verse eid="NUM 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 17:9" />Niyo Musa azilava zink'home zose ha Zumbe, akawalagisa Waizilaeli wose, naho kila kilongozi aguhaga ink'home yakwe. <verse eid="NUM 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 17:10" />Zumbe amgambaga Musa, “Ivuze ink'home ya Haluni he Disanduku dye Ndagano. Ivo neinde kanyo kwa Waizilaeli wakulabila vileke waleke kunilabiila sema wanabanike.” <verse eid="NUM 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 17:11" />Musa adamanyaga enga ivo asigiilwe ni Zumbe. <verse eid="NUM 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 17:12" />Waizilaeli niyo wamgamba Musa, “Kaula haluse! Chabanika! Chasila chose. <verse eid="NUM 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 17:13" />Kila mnt'hu naasogele he Dihema Dikukile dya Zumbe naabanike. Togola, hekibanike chose?”<verse eid="NUM 17:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="NUM 18" />
  <para style="s">Undima wa walava nt'hambiko na Walawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 18:1" />Zumbe amgambaga Haluni, “Weye na wanao na Walawi, nomnde na masa nayalaile mwo undima ze Dihema Dikukile ho undiilo wangu, mna weye na wanao nomnde na masa kwa dyodyose dikuunga dilaie mwo undima wo ulavant'hambiko. <verse eid="NUM 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 18:2" />Wegale wanduguzo we dikabila dya Lawi wadamanye ndima na weye, wakwambize umwo weye na wanao mkadamanya ndima ze Dihema Dikukile. <verse eid="NUM 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 18:3" />Woho nawadamanye ndima izo ukuunga uwenk'he na kukint'hiza ivo vikuungwa ze Dihema Dikukile. Mna wasekuvitoza vyombo ve Dihema Dikukile, naho kunda hagihi na hant'hu hakulavila malavo, sema wanabanike niyo nawe wabanika. <verse eid="NUM 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 18:4" />Awo nomndanye mwe zindima na kukint'hiza zindima zikuungwa ze Dihema Dikukile no kudikaulisa, mna naho mt'hu yeyose heewagilwe asekuwambizani. <verse eid="NUM 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 18:5" />Nyuwe nomdamanye ndima he Dihema Dikukile, sema maya yangu yanalaile naho mwa Waizilaeli. <verse eid="NUM 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 18:6" />Ni miye niwasagule wandugu zenyu Walawi mwa Waizilaeli kunda geleko kwenyu walavant'hambiko. Woho waikwa kwaajili yangu miye Zumbe vileke wadamanye zindima ze Dihema Dikukile. <verse eid="NUM 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 18:7" />Mna weye wikedu na wanawo nomdamanye ndima zose zo ulava nt'hambiko kwaajili ye kilingo cho kutambikila na vose vi hant'hu hakukise. Uno nuwo undima wenyu kwaviya hiwenk'hani geleko dyo ulavant'hambiko. Mnt'hu yeyose hi mlava nt'hambiko anasogeela aho hant'hu hakukise naakomwe.”<verse eid="NUM 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Upasi wa walavant'hambiko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 18:8" />Zumbe niyo amgamba Haluni, nakwink'ha malavo wanink'hile Waizilaeli, malavo yose yakukile ayo wanink'hile. Malavo yose yaikigwe ukuki ni Waizilaeli. Nohwink'he vint'hu vose weye na welekwa wako kunda upasi wenyu, na idyo ni uwagilwa wenyu na wanao mazuwa yose. <verse eid="NUM 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 18:9" />Vint'hu ivi nevinde vako mwa viya vikukise, visekokwa, malavo yawe yo unga na malavo yose yo wavu, malavo yawe yose ya masa ayo wakuunga wanilavile, nayande yakukise kwaajili yako weye na wanao. <verse eid="NUM 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 18:10" />Nomvidye vint'hu ivo kunda vint'hu vikukise aho hant'hu hakukile, kila wagosi naavidye vint'hu ivo, naho nevinde vikuka kwenyu.<verse eid="NUM 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 18:11" />“Naho vint'hu vituhu wakuunga wanilavile Waizilaeli kunda malavo ya kwinulwa, nevinde vako. Nakwink'ha weye na wanao na wanao we kike kunda ukipe kwenyu mazuwa yose. Mnt'hu yeyose mwa want'hu azumilwe ha Zumbe adaha kudya vint'hu ivo.<verse eid="NUM 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 18:12" />“Nakwink'ha vint'hu vose vedi vikulawa mwa ulozo wa nk'hongo wakunilavila Waizilaeli, mavuta yedi na divai yedi na unga wedi, <verse eid="NUM 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 18:13" />no ulozo wose wa nk'hongo wa matunda yakuiva ya mwe nk'honde yawe ayo wakunigaila nayande yako. Kila mnt'hu azumilwe ha Zumbe.<verse eid="NUM 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 18:14" />“Kila kint'hu mwa waizilaeli kiikigwe kwa Zumbe nekinde chenyu.<verse eid="NUM 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 18:15" />“Kila mwelekwa ywa nk'hongo awo Waizilaeli wakunilavila, akanda mwelekwa ywa nk'hongo mwa want'hu hegu mfugwa, naande ywako. Mna waungwa uwakombole welekwa wa nk'hongo wose wa mnt'hu, na kila mwelekwa ywa nk'hongo ywa mfugwa heezimilwe ha Zumbe aungwa kukombolwa. <verse eid="NUM 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 18:16" />Welekwa awo wa nk'hongo nawakombolwe wakanda wana mwezi umwenga kwa kulihilwa vipande vishano va masawa, viligane ne vihimo va mwe Dihema Dikukile. <verse eid="NUM 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 18:17" />Mna welekwa wa nk'hongo wa ng'ombe, hegu ngoto hegu mbuzi wasekukombolwa, awo wakuka. Sakame yawe nomyagile kilingo cho kutambikila naho mavuta yawe nouyoke kunda malavo ya kokwa, ni mhemp'he ukumwelela Zumbe. <verse eid="NUM 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 18:18" />Nyama yawe mwadaha kuidya, enga viya kidali na kiga cha kulume vikulavilwa kunda malavo ya kwinulwa.<verse eid="NUM 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 18:19" />“Nakwink'ha weye na wanawo wa kilume na wanao wa kike vint'hu vose ivo Waizilaeli wakunilavila, ivo ni uwagilwa wenyu mazuwa yose. Ino ni Ndagano niikile mwa weye na welekwa wako.”<verse eid="NUM 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 18:20" />Zumbe Mnungu niyo amgamba Haluni, “Nyuwe homnde na ukipe wowose mwe isi yawe, hegu kunda na sangilo mwa woho, sangilo dyenyu no ukipe wenyu mwa Waizilaeli ni miye.”<verse eid="NUM 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Upasi wa Walawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 18:21" />Mwa Walawi, awo hiwenk'ha imwenga ya mlongo mwa vose wakunilavila Waizilaeli kunda ukipe wawe. “Ayo nayande maliho yawe kwo undima wakunilavila mwo kudikaula Dihema Dikukile. <verse eid="NUM 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 18:22" />Kukongela ivi haluse, want'hu watuhu wa Izilaeli wasekudisogeela Dihema Dikukile sema wanakole masa yo wavu niyo wakomwa. <verse eid="NUM 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 18:23" />Mna ni Walawi du nawade no undima we Dihema Dikukile naho nawaguhe uwihi wawe kwa dyodyose nedilaile mwo undima wawe. Ino ni sigilizi ikugendeela hata kwe vyeleko venyu vikwiza. Walawi hawande na ukipe mwa Waizilaeli, <verse eid="NUM 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 18:24" />kwaviya imwenga ya mlongo wakunilavila Waizilaeli hiwenk'ha kunda ukipe wawe. Nivo vikuleka higamba woho hawande na ukipe mwa Waizilaeli.”<verse eid="NUM 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sangilo dya imwenga ya mlongo kwa Walawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 18:25" />Niyo Zumbe amgamba Musa, <verse eid="NUM 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 18:26" />Naho nouwasigiile Walawi sigilizi izi, “Mwo lupisi nomhokele imwenga ya mlongo Zumbe awenk'hileni kulawa kwa Waizilaeli inde ukipe wenyu, nomnilavile miye Zumbe imwenga ya mlongo ya malavo ayo. <verse eid="NUM 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 18:27" />Malavo aya nayande ni enga yadya yakulavigwa nu mlimi kwa ulozo mhya wa nk'hande na divai. <verse eid="NUM 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 18:28" />Ivo, nivo nomnilavile miye Zumbe malavo ya imwenga ya mlongo nomyahokele kulawa kwa Waizilaeli. Imwenga ya mlongo nomnilavile miye Zumbe nommwink'he mlava nt'hambiko Haluni. <verse eid="NUM 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 18:29" />Mwa malavo yose nomuyahokele, nomumlavile Zumbe hant'hu ha mlongo ya hant'hu hedi kujink'ha zose naho zikukile. <verse eid="NUM 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 18:30" />Kwa ivo nouwagambe Walawi. Mnanilavila hant'hu hedi kujink'ha zose, hant'hu nahasigale nahande henyu, enga ivo vili mlimi akuguha kisigale umwo akajika kulava malavo yakwe ya ulozo wa nk'hongo wa unga na zabibu. <verse eid="NUM 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 18:31" />Naho nyuwe Walawi nomdye kilavigwe mkanda hant'hu hohose nyuwe ne zimp'huga zenyu kwaviya nuwo uwagilwa wenyu mwo undima we Dihema Dikukile. <verse eid="NUM 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 18:32" />Homnde na masa yeyose mkadya vint'hu ivo, ikanda mwamlavila Zumbe vint'hu vedi, homvigele usavu vint'hu vikukile va Izilaeli naho homkomwe.”<verse eid="NUM 18:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="NUM 19" />
  <para style="s">Maivu ye ng'ombe ink'hundu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 19:1" />Zumbe awagambaga Musa na Haluni, <verse eid="NUM 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 19:2" />awenk'he Wazilaili zisigilizi izi. Wawegaile Musa na Haluni ng'ombe ink'hundu heiina lema naho heiinati kudamanya ndima ya kulima, <verse eid="NUM 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 19:3" />nawo nawamwigaile Eleazali mlavant'hambiko yehe naaite nayo kuse ye nk'hambi niyo aichinja. <verse eid="NUM 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 19:4" />Uyo mlava nt'hambiko Eliyazali naaguhe sakame iyo nakuimyaga kwa kadole nk'hanana mfungate, akaonyekeza kulongole kwe Dihema Dikukile. <verse eid="NUM 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 19:5" />Ng'ombe iyo ingima neyokwe ho mlava nt'hambiko. Kila kint'hu chakwe nechokwe, nk'hingo na nyama na sakame no utumbo wakwe. <verse eid="NUM 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 19:6" />Niyo mlava nt'hambiko aguha kaziti ka mwelezi, na hisopo na nyuzi ink'hundu na kuvigela mwo moto uwo ukoka ing'ombe iyo. <verse eid="NUM 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 19:7" />Akajika, mlava nt'hambiko naafigise zisuke zakwe na kuhaka mazi mwo mwili, ivo naadahe kwingila mwe nk'hambi, naande hakuzumilwa mwo kumvika Zumbe mpaka kisingi. <verse eid="NUM 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 19:8" />Mnt'hu naayoke ing'ombe iyo yehe naye naafigise zisuke zakwe na kuhaka mazi mwo mwili, mna yehe naye naande hakuzumilwa mwo kumvika Zumbe mpaka kisingi.<verse eid="NUM 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 19:9" />Niho mnt'hu azumilwe naaduganye maivu ye njeku na kuyaika hant'hu hakukile kuse ye nk'hambi. Maivu ayo yaikigwe aho vileke Wazilaili wose weze wayahanganye na mazi yakumtenda mnt'hu azumilwe mwo kumvika Zumbe. <verse eid="NUM 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 19:10" />Uyo mnt'hu akuduganya maivu ayo ye njeku aungwa afigise zisuke zakwe mna yehe naye haazumilwe kudamanya ndima nt'huhu ikukile mpaka kisingi. Uno ni mwiko howiikuhitulwa. Uno nomuutimile nyuwe Wazilaili na watakwiza wakwikala mwenyu<verse eid="NUM 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Imiko mwe mbuli ye vimba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 19:11" />Mnt'hu yeyose naakwafe kimba, naande msavu kwa mazuwa mfungate. <verse eid="NUM 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 19:12" />Nevimuunge akaekukize mwa mazi yo kukukizila mwe dizuwa dya katatu na dya mfungate, aho naande kakuka. Mna uneva hakekukize mwa mazi ayo mwe dizuwa dya katatu na dya mfungate naasigale msavu. <verse eid="NUM 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 19:13" />Yeyose akukwafa kimba, hanakekukize, naagendeele kunda msavu kwaviya hamyagilwe mazi yo kukekukizila. Uyo naadigele usavu Dihema Dikukile dya Zumbe. Haafanyanywe kunda mnt'hu ywa Zumbe.<verse eid="NUM 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 19:14" />Ino niyo isigilizi ya kutimilwa uneva mnt'hu anabanika mwe dihema dyakwe. “Kila akwingila mndani mwe dihema idyo hegu emndani mwe dihema idyo, naande msavu kwa mazuwa mfungate, <verse eid="NUM 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 19:15" />kila chombo hekiigubikwe hekiina ngubiko nekinde kisavu. <verse eid="NUM 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 19:16" />Mnt'hu yeyose uko kuse naakwafe kimba cha mnt'hu akomigwe kwa mabamba hegu abanike du kuse ye nk'hambi, hegu anakwafa mavuha ya mnt'hu hegu anakwafa kikuta, naande msavu kwa mazuwa mfungate.<verse eid="NUM 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 19:17" />“Nomwiike maivu ya malavo ya kuusa wavu yokigwe kwajili ya mnt'hu msavu, maivu ayo nomyahanganye mwe nyungu na mazi ya kuseela. <verse eid="NUM 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 19:18" />Mnt'hu hi msavu naaguhe hisopo, naho naachank'hize kadole mwa mazi ayo, niyo naamyagile Idihema na vint'hu vimndani mwakwe na want'hu we mndani. Naho naammyagile mnt'hu akwafile mavuha ya mnt'hu, hegu kimba cha mnt'hu akomigwe hegu aabanike du hegu akwafile kikuta. <verse eid="NUM 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 19:19" />Mwe dizuwa dya katatu na dya mfungate, mnt'hu akukile naawamyagile want'hu wasavu mazi ayo. Mwe dizuwa dya mfungate, awo wakukizwe waungwa kufigisa zisuke zawe niyo wahaka mwili wose. Kisingi nawande wakuka usavu wawe.<verse eid="NUM 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 19:20" />“Mna mnt'hu ananda msavu hanakekukize, mnt'hu uyo naalemelwe ni want'hu wakwe, kwaviya adigela usavu Dihema Dikukile dya Zumbe Mnungu. kwaviya hamyagilwe mazi ya ukuki, mnt'hu uyo naande msavu. <verse eid="NUM 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 19:21" />Mwaungwa kutimila zisigilizi izi lupisi lwose lukwiza. Mnt'hu naamyage mazi ayo yo kukukizila naafigise zuke zakwe, naho yeyose naakwafe mazi ayo naande msavu mpaka kisingi. <verse eid="NUM 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 19:22" />Chochose nekikwafe kint'hu kisavu icho nekinde kisavu, naho yeyose naakwafe kint'hu icho naande msasvu mpaka kisingi.”<verse eid="NUM 19:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="NUM 20" />
  <para style="s">Ayo yalailaga uko Kadeshi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 20:1" />Want'hu wa Izilaeli walawaga kwe dijangwa dya Sini mwo mwezi wa nk'hongo, na kuika nk'hambi uko Kadeshi. Wakanda uko, Miliamu abanikaga no kumoselwa msanga uuko.<verse eid="NUM 20:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 20:2" />Hant'hu aho waikaga nk'hambi hahandaga na mazi. Ivo want'hu awo wose, wawalabiilaga Musa na Haluni, <verse eid="NUM 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 20:3" />wakagamba, “Hegu nevinda vedi chabanikile aho wandugu zetu wabanikaga ha Zumbe! <verse eid="NUM 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 20:4" />Nii mkawegala uku kwe dijangwa want'hu wa Zumbe? Togola, nomkiigala uku vileke kibanikile aha hedijangwa suwe hamwenga na mifugwa yetu? <verse eid="NUM 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 20:5" />Naho nii mkilava Misili na kukileta hant'hu aha haihile? Hant'hu aha hahaha nk'hande, tini, zabibu hegu makomamanga. Hata mazi yo kunywa hayahali!” <verse eid="NUM 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 20:6" />Aho Musa na Haluni wahalawaga ho mdugano wa want'hu, niyo wagenda kukimala kwe nk'hili ye Dihema Dikukile, niyo wafika madi na kufanamila mitwi yawe. Ivo ung'azi wa Zumbe niyo walaila.<verse eid="NUM 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 20:7" />Zumbe amgambaga Musa, <verse eid="NUM 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 20:8" />“Guha idya nk'home yako iikigwe kulongole kwe Diasanduku dye Ndagano, weye na Haluni nduguyo, muwaduganye want'hu wose aaho wakakaula weye na Haluni longeni no luwe ludya nalo nolulave mazi vileke want'hu ne mifugwa wanywe.” <verse eid="NUM 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 20:9" />Ivo Musa agendaga kuguha ink'home idya enga ivo asigiilwe ni Zumbe.<verse eid="NUM 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 20:10" />Niyo Musa na Haluni wawaduganyaga want'hu wose hadya ho luwe, niyo Musa awagamba, “Haluse tegelezeni nyuwe msaguke, togoleni, mwaunga kiwalavileni mazi mwo luwe ulu?” <verse eid="NUM 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 20:11" />Niyo Musa enula mkono wakwe, na kuutoa uluwe nk'home mbili. Mazi niyo yatumbukisa, want'hu ne mifugwa yawe niyo wanywa.<verse eid="NUM 20:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 20:12" />Mna Zumbe niyo amgamba Musa na Haluni, “Kwaviya nyuwe hamnihuwile naho hamlekile nilagise udahi wangu mwa Waizilaeli, kwaivo homuwegale want'hu awa mwe isi nigambile neniwenk'he.”<verse eid="NUM 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 20:13" />Aya yandaga mazi ya Meliba. Hant'hgu aho naho Wazilaili wamlabiilaga Zumbe naho niho yehe mwenye Zumbe akelavilizaga kugamba kakuka.<verse eid="NUM 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Seuta ywa Edom awalemela Waizilaili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 20:14" />Musa atumaga wegala ulosi kulawa Kadeshi aho waikaga nk'hambi, kuita kwa seuta ywa Edomu niyo wamgamba, “Nduguyo Izilaeli agamba, weye kuyamanya makunt'ho yose kikupata, <verse eid="NUM 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 20:15" />na ivo tati zenyu waitaga uko Misili, uko chekale kwa lupisi lutali na ivo Wamisili wawasulumizaga wakale wetu na kukisulumiza naswe. <verse eid="NUM 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 20:16" />Chamwiilaga Zumbe, yehe naye niyo eva ndilo yetu na kukiletela mtumigwa ywakwe ywa kwe mbingu akilave Misili. Naho haluse kiyaha Kadeshi, mzi ukuhakana na isi yako. <verse eid="NUM 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 20:17" />Chakulombeza ukilekele chomboke mwe isi yako, suwe hekipaguke kuse ye sila ink'hulu hegu kwingila mwe nk'honde yenyu hegu kwe zink'honde ze mizabibu naho hekinywese mwa masima yenyu. Suwe nekitimile du isila ya seuta mpaka kimlawe mwe isi yako.”<verse eid="NUM 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 20:18" />Mna seuta ywa Edomu niyo amhitula, “Suwe hakikuunga mwomboke mwe isi yetu, uneva unomboka nenifose nize niwatoweni.”<verse eid="NUM 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 20:19" />Waizilaeli niyo wamgamba, “Suwe nekitimile sila nk'hulu, uneva suwe na mifugwa yetu kinanywa mazi yenyu, nekilihe. Icho kikuunga kilekele du, chomboke kwa viga naho hakikuunga mbuli yeyose nt'huhu.”<verse eid="NUM 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 20:20" />Mna seuta ywa Edomu niyo avuzagiza. “Hekiwalekele.” Aho, seuta ywa Edomu afosaga na watowani wata udahi no kuwakindila. <verse eid="NUM 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 20:21" />Ivo, Waedomu walemelaga kuwalekela Waizilaeli komboka mwe mihaka yawe. Waizilaeli niyo wahituka no kutoza sila nt'huhu.<verse eid="NUM 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kubanika kwa Haluni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 20:22" />Waizilaeli wose nawatambaga kulawa Kadeshi no mpaka kwo mnima wa Holi kwo mhaka wa Edomu. <verse eid="NUM 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 20:23" />Ivo, Zumbe niyo amgamba Musa na Haluni uko kwo mnima wa Holi, mwo mhaka wa Edomu, <verse eid="NUM 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 20:24" />“Haluni naabanike, heengile mwe isi iyo niweink'hile Waizilaeli kwaviya nyuwe waidi nomleka sigilizi zangu uko kwa mazi ya Meliba. <verse eid="NUM 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 20:25" />Mguhe Haluni na Eliyazeli mwanawe, uwegale kwo mnima wa Holi. <verse eid="NUM 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 20:26" />Uko nouyahambule mavalo yo ulavant'hambiko ya Haluni no kumvika mwanawe Eliyazali. Haluni naabanikile uuko kwo mnima.” <verse eid="NUM 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 20:27" />Ivo Musa nakadamanya enga ivo asigiilwe ni Zumbe. Wose watatu wakwelaga kwo mnima wa Holi want'hu wose wakawakaula. <verse eid="NUM 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 20:28" />Ivo Musa niyo amhambula Haluni mavalo yakwe yo undima, no kumvala Eliyazali mwana Haluni. Haluni naye niyo abanika ahadya ho lunenengwa lwo mnima. Niyo Musa na Eliyazali waseela hasi. <verse eid="NUM 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 20:29" />Want'hu wose weze weve kugamba Haluni kabanika, wahongezaga kwa mazuwa milongo mitatu.<verse eid="NUM 20:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="NUM 21" />
  <para style="s">Waizilaeli wawahuma Wakanaani uko Holima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 21:1" />Seuta yumwenga ywa Kanaani ywe isi ya Aladi naakekala Kusini ya Kanaani, eze eve kugamba Waizilaeli weza kwa sila ya Atalimu, agendaga kuwatowa na kuwataha wamwenga wawe. <verse eid="NUM 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 21:2" />Aaho Waizilaeli niyo wamwikila kilapi Zumbe wakagamba, “Uneva noukitende kiwahume want'hu awa, ivo nekiibanange pele mizi yawe kwajili yako.” <verse eid="NUM 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 21:3" />Zumbe evaga kulombeza kwawe, niyo wawahuma Wakaanani na kuibananga pele mizi yawe. Kwa ivo hant'hu aho nahetangwa Holimahi, nuko kugamba kubanangwa pele.<verse eid="NUM 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nyoka idamanywe kwa Shaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 21:4" />Waizilaeli niyo watamba kulawa mnima Holi na kombokela sila ikuita bahali ya Shamu vileke waizunguluke isi ya Edomu. Mna mwe sila want'hu nawafa chevu kwaviya ya idya sila. <verse eid="NUM 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 21:5" />Ivo niyo wakonga kumlabila Mnungu hamwenga na Musa wakagamba, “Nii mkilava Misili kize kibanikile uku kwe dijangwa? Umu hamna nk'hande na mazi, suwe naswe kisokezwa ni nk'hande ino iihile.” <verse eid="NUM 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 21:6" />Aho Zumbe Mnungu niyo egala nyoka zina sumu mwa want'hu, na kuwakoma hata Waizilaeli wengi niyo wabanika. <verse eid="NUM 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 21:7" />Ivo want'hu wamwitilaga Musa, wakamgamba, “Kidamanya wavu kwa kumlabila Zumbe Mnungu hamwenga na weye. Mlombeze Mnungu akiusile nyoka izi.” Ivo Musa niyo awalombezelaga want'hu. <verse eid="NUM 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 21:8" />Ivo Zumbe Mnungu niyo amgamba Musa, “Damanya nyoka ya shaba uitungike mwe mp'handa, ivo mnt'hu yeyose naalumwe ni nyoka anaisinya inyoka iyo ye shaba naahone.” <verse eid="NUM 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 21:9" />Ivo, Musa niyo adamanya nyoka ya shaba, na kuitungika mnanga mwe mp'handa. Kila mnt'hu alumigwe ni nyoka eze aikaule nyoka iyo ye shaba, ahonaga.<verse eid="NUM 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulawa kwo Mnima wa Holi kuita Moabu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 21:10" />Waizilaeli nawagendeela na nt'hambo yawe, na kuika nk'hambi uko Obosi. <verse eid="NUM 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 21:11" />Kulawa uko watambaga mpaka Iyebalimu, mwe dijangwa nt'hendelo ya ulailo wa zuwa mwa Moabu. <verse eid="NUM 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 21:12" />Kulawa uko nawaita na kutoa nk'hambi yawe mwe kolongo dya Zeladi. <verse eid="NUM 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 21:13" />Kulawa uko waitaga na kutoa nk'hambi kaskazini ya mto Alononi, kwe dijangwa ukubula mwe isi ya Waamoli. Mto Aloni nounda mhaka wa Wamoabu na Waamoli. <verse eid="NUM 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 21:14" />Kwa ivo, iwandikwa mwe vitabu va nk'hondo za Zumbe. “Mzi wa Wahebu mwe isi ya Sufa na kolongo dya Anon, <verse eid="NUM 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 21:15" />na seleza za mwe kolongo zikubula kwo mzi ukwitangwa Ali, na kuhinga kwe mihaka ya Moabu.”<verse eid="NUM 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 21:16" />Kulawa uko Waizilaeli waitaga mpaka Beeli ni sima idyo Zumbe amgambaga Musa, “Waduganyeni want'hu hamwenga, miye name neniwenk'he mazi.” <verse eid="NUM 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 21:17" />Aaho Waizilaeli nawakema wila uno.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:17">“Wee sima tumbuka mazi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:17">Dikemeleni wila<verse eid="NUM 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 21:18" />Sima disimbigwe ni wakulu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:18">Difukulwe ni vilogozi wa want'hu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:18">Kwa nk'home zawe zo ukulu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:18">Na kwa ngoda zawe.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 21:18">Watambaga kulawa Matana. <verse eid="NUM 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 21:19" />Naho wakalawe aho wagendaga mpaka Nahalieli. Weze walawe Nahalieli wagendaga mpaka Bamosi, <verse eid="NUM 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 21:20" />naho kulawa Bamosi wagendaga mpaka mwe dikolongo dikwingila mwe isi ya Moabu, kwo lunenengwa lwo Mnima Pisiga, kuhinga kwe dijangwa.<verse eid="NUM 21:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuwahuma maseuta Sihoni na seuta Ogu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 21:21" />Waizilaeli wawatumaga wegala ulosi kwa seuta Sihoni ywa Waamoli wakamgamba, <verse eid="NUM 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 21:22" />“Kilekele chomboke mwe isi yako, hekipaguke na kwingila mwe migunda hegu mwe migunda ya mizabibu, hegu hekinywe mazi ye visima venyu, nechomboke du mwe sila nk'hulu ya seuta mpaka aho nechomboke mwe isi yako.” <verse eid="NUM 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 21:23" />Mna seuta Sihoni hawalekele want'hu wa Izilaeli womboke mwe isi yakwe. Aduganyaga watowani we isi yakwe wata ludole, niyo akutowana na waizilaeli kwe dijangwa. <verse eid="NUM 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 21:24" />Mna Waizilaeli wawakomaga wank'hondo wawe wengi kwe nk'hondo, na kuitaha isi yawe kukongela mto Alunoni mpaka mto Yaboki, uwo wandagaa mhaka wa Wamoni nawo wandaga uzengelwa gomelwa. <verse eid="NUM 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 21:25" />Waizilaeli waitahaga mizi yose woho nawo niyo waitozeleza mizi ya Waamoli hamwenga no mzi wa Heshiboni na kaya zakwe. <verse eid="NUM 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 21:26" />Heshiboni nounda mzi wa Sihoni seuta ywa Waamoli, uyo aho nk'hongo atowanaga na seuta ywa Moabu na kuitaha isi yakwe yose mpaka mto Aloni. <verse eid="NUM 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 21:27" />Nivo vikuleka umwo wakanda hawanati kwiza Waizilaeli wakale wakemaga .</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:27">“Soni Heshiboni na kuuzenga vituhu umzi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:27">Mzi wa Sihoni uzengwe naho.<verse eid="NUM 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 21:28" />Kwaviya umoto noulawa Heshiboni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:28">Watoani wa Sihoni wagulukizaga enga moto</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:28">Waubanangaga mzi wa Ali wa Moabu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:28">Na kuvoka pele vigulu va Alimoni ya kukenya, no kuibananga milima ya Aloni.<verse eid="NUM 21:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 21:29" />Hangi nyuwe wenye want'hu wa Moabu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:29">Nyuwe mkumvika Kemoshi mbanangwa pele</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:29">Kemoshi kawatenda wanakilume wande wakimbizi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:29">Wana kike nawo watahigwa ni seuta ywa Waamoli.<verse eid="NUM 21:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 21:30" />Mna haluse welekwa wawe wabanangwa pele</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:30">Kukongela Heshiboni mpaka Diboni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:30">Kulawa Nasimi mpaka Nofa hagihi na Medeba.”<verse eid="NUM 21:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 21:31" />Ivo, Waizilaeli niyo wekala mwe isi iyo ya Waamoli. <verse eid="NUM 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 21:32" />Musa eze awatume wapelembi kwo mzi wa Yazeli, Waizilaeli wautahaga na kuzunguluka zikaya zawe na kuwagulusa Waamoli aho wekalaga. <verse eid="NUM 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 21:33" />Waizilaeli niyo wahituka na kuhinga nt'hendelo ya mkoma mahanya na kutimila sila ikuita Bashani. Mna Seuta Ogu ywa Bashani na watowani wakwe wose wawabasaga Waizilaeli vileke wakatowane uko Edulei. <verse eid="NUM 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 21:34" />Mna Zumbe niyo amgamba Musa, “Usekumogoha, kwaviya hikwink'ha uhumi mwawe hamwenga na watoani wakwe wose na isi yakwe yose. Noumtende enga ivo umtendile Sihoni seuta ywa Waamoli, uyo alongozaga Heshiboni.” <verse eid="NUM 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 21:35" />Ivo, Waizilaeli wamkomaga Ogu na wanawe na want'hu wakwe wose haheina kumleka mnt'hu yeyose akanda mgima na kuiguha isi yawe.<verse eid="NUM 21:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="NUM 22" />
  <para style="s">Balaam etangwa ni seuta ywa Moabu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 22:1" />Akajika Waizilaeli nawakonga utafi naho na kukima nk'hambi kwe zint'hindiga za Moabu, ulailo wa zuwa wa Yolodani nt'hendelo ya kaidi ya Yeliko.<verse eid="NUM 22:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 22:2" />Seuta Balaki ywa Moabu uyo mwana Sipoli, amanyaga zimbuli zose za Waizilaeli ivo wawatendelaga Waamoli. <verse eid="NUM 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 22:3" />Yehe hamwenga na wamoabu niyo wawogohesa Waizilaeli. Nawawogohesa kwaviya waizilaeli wandilisaga wengi. <verse eid="NUM 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 22:4" />Ivo, Wamoabu niyo wawagamba vilongozi wa Midiani, “Fyo idi nedibanange kila kint'hu mnk'handa yetu enga jeku ivo dikudya mani.” Mwo lupisi ulo Balaki seuta ywa Moabu, <verse eid="NUM 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 22:5" />egalaga ulosi kwa Balaamu, mwana Beoli, uko Petoli, hagihi na mto Efulate mwe isi ya Amawi. Nakamgamba Balaamu, “Kuna want'hu walaile Misili, wamema mwe isi yetu yose, naho wakima nk'hambi hagihi na suwe. <verse eid="NUM 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 22:6" />Haluse wize uniligitile want'hu awa kwaviya wana ludole kujink'ha miye. Mafani nenidahe kuwahuma na kuwagulusa wasekwingila mwe isi yangu. Kwaviya himanya kugamba weye una mvikila mnt'hu avikilwa, naho unamligita mnt'hu aligitwa.”<verse eid="NUM 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 22:7" />Ivo, vilongozi wa Moabu na Midiani wahalawaga wakanda waguha maliho ya kumliha Balaam vileke awaligite Waizilaeli. Wahalawaga no kuita kwa Baalam niyo wamwink'ha Baalaam ulosi ulaile kwa Balaaki. <verse eid="NUM 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 22:8" />Balaamu niyo awagamba, “Goneni uku kilo iki, miye name neniwalagiseni ayo akuunga anigambile Zumbe Mnungu.” Ivo vilongozi awo wa Moabu wagonaga kwa Balaamu.<verse eid="NUM 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 22:9" />Zumbe amwiziilaga Balaam, na kamuuza, “Awa unanawo ni wahi?”<verse eid="NUM 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 22:10" />Balaamu niyo amhitula Mnungu, “Seuta ywa Moabu Balaki mwana Sipoli kaniigaila sigilizi kugamba, <verse eid="NUM 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 22:11" />kuna want'hu walaile Misili, naho wamema kila hant'hu. Kanilombeza niite hawaligite want'hu awo vileke adahe kutoana nawo na kuwagulusa.”<verse eid="NUM 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 22:12" />Mnungu niyo amgamba Balaamu, “Usekuita hamwenga na want'hu awa wezile, naho usekuwaligita want'hu awo wa Izilaeli kwaviya wavikilwa.” <verse eid="NUM 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 22:13" />Ivo, luvi yakwe Balamu nakenuka na kuwagamba wadya wegala ulosi wa Balaki, “Uyeni kwe isi yenyu, kwaviya Zumbe hakuunga kunilekela niite hamwenga na nyuwe.” <verse eid="NUM 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 22:14" />Kwaivo wadya wakulu wa Moabu waitaga na kuuya kwa Balaki, niyo wamgamba, “Balaamu kalemela kwiza hamwenga na suwe.”<verse eid="NUM 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 22:15" />Niyo Balaki asigiila wakulu watuhu wengi na wata udahi mkulu kujink'ha wadya wa nk'hongo. <verse eid="NUM 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 22:16" />Awo nawabula kwa Balaamu, wakamgamba, “Balaki mwana wa Sipoli agamba ivi. Usekukindilwa na chochose vileke usekwiza kwangu. <verse eid="NUM 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 22:17" />Nohwink'he geleko kulu na kukudamanyila chochose noulonge. Soo uwaligite want'hu awa.”<verse eid="NUM 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 22:18" />Mna Balaamu niyo awahitula wadya wasigiilwe ni Balaki, “Hata uneva Balaki ananink'ha nyumba yakwe imemile masawa na zahabu, miye henidamanye mbuli yeyose ndodo hegu nk'hulu ikumhiga Zumbe Mnungu ywangu. <verse eid="NUM 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 22:19" />Mna goneni aha kilo iki enga wadya weenyu, miye name nidahe kumanya kiya Zumbe akuunga anigambile naho.”<verse eid="NUM 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 22:20" />Ivo, Mnungu niyo amhitula Balaamu kilo icho, akamgamba, “Kwaviya want'hu awa weza kukwitanga, ita hamwenga nawo, mna udamanye du kiya nohugambile.” <verse eid="NUM 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 22:21" />Balamu niyo enuka mtondo, na kuika kint'hu cha kwikaila na kwikala mwe mp'hunda yakwe, niyo aita hamwenga nao awo wakulu wa Moabu.<verse eid="NUM 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mp'hunda ilongile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 22:22" />Mungu afaga maya vitendese kwaviya Balaamu andaga akaita, ivo mtumigwa ywa kwe mbingu ekalaga mwe sila amhige Balaam uyo andaga akalongoza imphunda yakwe akanda na wandima wakwe waidi. <verse eid="NUM 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 22:23" />Imp'hunda iyo yamuonaga mtumigwa ywa kwe mbingu kakimala mwe sila, katoza bamba disomolwe mwe yala yakwe, ivo imp'hunda iyo yapagukaga mwe sila niyo yaita kunk'handa. Balamu niyo aitoa imp'hunda, na kuivuza mwe sila. <verse eid="NUM 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 22:24" />Yudya mtumigwa ywa kwe mbingu ywa Zumbe alongolaga na kukimala hant'hu hana sila finyu, mwe migunda ya mizabibu na viwambaza viidi nt'hendelo zose mbili. <verse eid="NUM 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 22:25" />Mp'hunda ize amuone mtumigwa ywa kwe mbingu ywa Zumbe, ikesukumiza mwe kiwambaza ikiga cha Balaamu. Kwaivo Balaamu niyo aitoa imp'hunda naho. <verse eid="NUM 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 22:26" />Mtumigwa ywa kwe mbingu wa Zumbe niyo alongola naho na kukimala hant'hu hafinyu kwa kombokela kulume hegu kumoso. <verse eid="NUM 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 22:27" />Imp'hunda ize imuone uyo mtumigwa ywa kwe mbingu ywa Zumbe, yagonaga hasi. Balaamu niyo afa maya na kuitoa imp'hunda ne ngoda yakwe. <verse eid="NUM 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 22:28" />Aho Zumbe aitendaga mp'hunda idahe kulonga, niyo yamgamba Balaamu, “Hikubanangai vilekile ukanitoa nk'hanana izi nt'hatu?”<verse eid="NUM 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 22:29" />Balaamu niyo aigamba imp'hunda, “Weye kunibela! naho nandile na bamba hegu nehikukoma haluse ivi!”<verse eid="NUM 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 22:30" />Mp'hunda niyo yagamba Balamu, “Togola, miye hi idya mp'hunda yako ikwinule wikazi wako wose mpaka zuwa idi dya dyelo? Togola, miye hizoela kukudamanyila enga ivi?” Balaamu niyo ahitula “Bule.”<verse eid="NUM 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 22:31" />Aho, Zumbe Mnungu niyo amtenda Balaamu amuone mtumigwa ywa kwe mbingu kakimala mwe sila katoza bamba disomolwe mwe yala yakwe. Balaamu niyo afika madi na kufunamiza mtwi wakwe hasi. <verse eid="NUM 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 22:32" />Mtumigwa ywa kwe mbingu ywa Zumbe amgambaga Balamu, “Togola kuitoelai mp'hunda yako nk'hanana nt'hatu? Hiza hukindile, kwaviya icho ukuunga udamanye kiha. <verse eid="NUM 22:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 22:33" />Mp'hunda yako iniona nk'hanana nt'hatu niyo yapaguka. Yandile hayahituke hale na miye ikindedi hegu nehikukoma weye na kuileka mp'hunda ikanda ngima.”<verse eid="NUM 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 22:34" />Balamu niyo amgamba mtumigwa ywa kwe mbingu ywa Zumbe, “Hidamanya wavu kwaviya himanyize kugamba kukimala mwe sila kunikindila. Haluse, uneva hukuunga nigendele na nt'hambo ino, ivo neniuye kaya.”<verse eid="NUM 22:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 22:35" />Mna mtumigwa ywa kwe mbingu ywa Zumbe kamgamba Balaamu, “Ita na want'hu awa, mna noulonge du kiya nohugambile.” Ivo Balaamu niyo agendeela na nt'hambo yakwe hamwenga na vilongozi wakulu wa Balaki.<verse eid="NUM 22:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Balaki amsingila Balaam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 22:36" />Balaki eze eve kugamba Balaamu eza, afosaga akamsingile kwo mzi ukwitangwa Ali, mzi wi mnk'handa yo mto Alinoni mwo uheelo wo mhaka wa Moabu. <verse eid="NUM 22:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 22:37" />Balaki niyo amgamba Balaamu, “Nii hwizile kwangu aho nize hwitange nk'hongo? Togola, nokufanyanya kugamba hehadaha kukwink'ha nt'hunyo ikukint'ha?”<verse eid="NUM 22:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 22:38" />Balaamu niyo amhitula Balaki, “Haluse hiza! Mna, togola nna udahi wa kulonga chochose? Mbuli naanigambile Mnungu niyo huungwa kulonga.” <verse eid="NUM 22:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 22:39" />Ivo, Balaamu niyo aita hamwenga na Balaki niyo wabula kwo mzi wa Kiliati Hosoti. <verse eid="NUM 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 22:40" />Balaki atambikaga ya ng'ombe na ngoto, na kuwapangila nyama Balaamu na vilongozi wakulu awo wandile hamwenga naye.<verse eid="NUM 22:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Balaamu awavikila Waizilaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 22:41" />Zuwa ditimile, Balaki amguhaga Balaamu, niyo wakwelanya mpaka hant'hu wakumvika Bamosi Baali, kulawa uko Balaamu adahaga kuwaona Waizilaeli wamwenga.<verse eid="NUM 22:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="NUM 23" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 23:1" />Balamu amgambaga Balaki, “Nizengele hant'hu mfungate ha kulavila nt'hambiko naho uniigaile majeku mfungate na ndolome mfungate.”<verse eid="NUM 23:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 23:2" />Balaki adamanyaga enga ivo Balaamu alongile. Ivo nawalava mnanga ha kila kilingo cho kutambikila, jeku dimwenga na ndolome imwenga. <verse eid="NUM 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 23:3" />Niyo Balaamu amgamba Balaki, ikala aaha hagihi na malavo yako ya kokwa, miye name niite. Vadahika Zumbe Mnungu naambwilane na miye. Chochose naanilagise nenize hugambile. Ivo, Balaamu niyo aita ekedu kwo lunenengwa lwo lugulu. <verse eid="NUM 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 23:4" />Mnungu niyo adugana naye. Balaamu naye niyo amgamba Mnungu, “Hiika lumwe hant'hu mfungate ha kulavila nt'hambiko na kulava nt'hambiko ya njeku imwenga na ndolome imwenga mnanga mwe kilingo cho kutambikila.” <verse eid="NUM 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 23:5" />Zumbe niyo amwink'ha Balaamu mbuli za kulonga na kumgamba auye kwa Balaki. <verse eid="NUM 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 23:6" />Balaamu auyaga na kumbwiila Balaki kakimala ahadya hagihi na malavo yakwe ya kokwa, hamwenga na vilongozi wakulu wose wa Moabu.<verse eid="NUM 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 23:7" />Uno nuwo ulosi Balaamu awagambile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:7">“Balaki seuta ywa Moabu kanigala aha</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:7">Kulawa Asilia naho kulawa kwe milima ya Ulailo wa zuwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:7">‘So uniligitile want'hu wa Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:7">So uwakalalize want'hu wa Izilaeli.’<verse eid="NUM 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 23:8" />Nenimligite vivihi mnt'hu uyo avikilwe ni Mnungu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:8">Nenimkalalize vivihi uneva Zumbe hamkalalize mnt'hu uyo?<verse eid="NUM 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 23:9" />Kulawa mwo lunenengwa lwe zinyuwe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:9">Nadaha kukaula kulawa kwe vigulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:9">Iyo ni si ikwikala ikedukedu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:9">Wamanya kugamba wavikiliswa kujink'ha si nt'huhu.<verse eid="NUM 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 23:10" />Niani akudaha kuuwaza wingi wa want'hu wa Yakobo awo awengi enga luvumbi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:10">Niani akudaha kuufanyanya uwingi wa Waizilaeli.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:10">Miye goja nibanike file ya want'hu wedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:10">Goja miye nibanike kwa utondowazi kunda muwagilwa wikazi wangu unde enga uwawe.”<verse eid="NUM 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 23:11" />Niyo Balaki amgamba Balaamu, “Kunitendelai? Hikwigala aha uwaligite wank'hondo wangu, mna weye kuwavikila.”<verse eid="NUM 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 23:12" />Balamu niyo amhitula Balaki, “Miye nenilonge mbuli anink'hile Zumbe.”<verse eid="NUM 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulosi wa kaidi wa Balaam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 23:13" />Niyo, Balaki amgamba Balaamu, “Kite hant'hu hatuhu. Aho nouwaone Waizilaeli wamwenga du naho hiyo wose. Naho kulawa aha niligitile want'hu awo.” <verse eid="NUM 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 23:14" />Ivo, Balaki niyo amguha Balamu mwe nt'hindiga kwo mnima wa Sifimu, mwo lunenengwa lwo mnima wa Pisiga. Aho niyo azenga hant'hu mfungate ha kulavila nt'hambiko na kulava nt'hambiko ya njeku imwenga na ndolome imwenga mwe kila kilingo cho kutambikila.<verse eid="NUM 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 23:15" />Balaamu niyo amgamba Balaki, “Ikala aha hagihi na malavo yako ya kokwa umo miye haita kudya nga'mbu habwiilane na Zumbe.”<verse eid="NUM 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 23:16" />Zumbe niyo adugana na Balamu niyo amgambila icho naalonge, niyo amgamba auye kwa Balaki. <verse eid="NUM 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 23:17" />Ivo Balaamu niyo auya, na kumbwila Balaki kakimala hagihi na malavo ya kokwa hamwenga na wandima wose wa Moabu. Balaki niyo amuuza, “Zumbe kakugambilai?” <verse eid="NUM 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 23:18" />Ivi nivo Balaamu akemaga akagamba.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:18">“Balaki mwana Zipola so</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:18">Unitegeleze weye mwana Zipola<verse eid="NUM 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 23:19" />Mnungu hiyo enga mnt'hu, vikuleka alonge lulimi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:19">Naho hiyo enga mnt'hu, ahitule zifanyanyi zakwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:19">Uneva analonga mbuli yakwe haidamanye</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:19">Uneva kaditambula naaidamanye<verse eid="NUM 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 23:20" />Kaula miye hisigiilwa nivikile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:20">Kavikila name hikudaha kuhitula.<verse eid="NUM 23:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 23:21" />Zumbe haone uwihi kwa wana Yakobo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:21">Naho haone wavu kwa awo Wazilaili</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:21">Zumbe ehamwenga nawo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:21">Naho nawalonge kugamba yehe Seuta ywawe.<verse eid="NUM 23:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 23:22" />Mnungu niye awalavile Misili.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:22">Naho awatowanila enga jeku dya mbogo.<verse eid="NUM 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 23:23" />Ikindedi hauhali usai nompate Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:23">hegu uganga ukuunga uwapate Waizilaili.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:23">Haluse nawalonge zimbuli za Yakobo na Izilaeli.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:23">‘Kaula zimbuli adamanye Mnungu!’<verse eid="NUM 23:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 23:24" />Kaula! Want'hu wakump'huka enga simba vele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:24">naho wakump'huka enga simba.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:24">Heigone hasi mpaka idye ukala wakwe no kunywa sakame yawe awo iwakomile.”<verse eid="NUM 23:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 23:25" />Niho Balaki akamgamba Balaamu, “Ivo usekuwaligita naho usekuwavikila!”<verse eid="NUM 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 23:26" />Mna Balaam niyo amhitula Balaki, “Togola, hikugambile kugamba icho naalonge Zumbe nicho nenidamanye?”<verse eid="NUM 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulosi wa katatu wa Balaam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 23:27" />Balaki niyo amgamba Balaamu, “So, nohwigale hant'hu hatuhu. Vadahika Mnungu naazumile uniligitile want'hu awo.” <verse eid="NUM 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 23:28" />Ivo, Balaki amguhaga Balaam niyo waitanya mpaka kwo lunenengwa lwo lugulu lwa Peoli, aho mnt'hu akudaha kuona kwe jangwa. <verse eid="NUM 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 23:29" />Balamu niyo amgamba Balaki, “Nizengele hant'hu mfungate ha kulavila nt'hambiko aha, uniikile njeku mfungate na ndolome mfungate.” <verse eid="NUM 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 23:30" />Balaki niyo adamanya enga ivo asigiilwe ni Balamu, niyo alava mwa kila kilingo chokutambikila, njeku imwenga na ndolome imwenga.<verse eid="NUM 23:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="NUM 24" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 24:1" />Haluse Balaam aonaga kugamba vimwelela Zumbe kuwavikila Waizilaeli, kwaivo hagendile kutoa mnamulo naho enga ivo atendile aho nk'hongo, vituhu vakwe ahitukilaga akakaula kwe dijangwa. <verse eid="NUM 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 24:2" />Balaam eze enule meso yakwe awaonaga Waizilaeli watoa nk'hambi kila kabila hant'hu hakwe, Niyo Muye ywa Mnungu amwiizilaga, <verse eid="NUM 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 24:3" />yehe nae niyo alonga uwona uno.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:3">Ulosi wangu miye Balamu mwana Beoli</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:3">Ulosi wa mnt'hu akuona vedi.<verse eid="NUM 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 24:4" />Uyo akuwiva ulosi wa Mnungu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:4">akuona uwona wa Mnungu mta Udahi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:4">Kafika madi na kafunamiza mtwi hasi uku akakaula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:4">maona kulawa kwa Mnungu mta Udahi.<verse eid="NUM 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 24:5" />Weye Yakobo mahema yako yatendesa uwedi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:5">Weye Izilaeli aho ukwikala hedi!<verse eid="NUM 24:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 24:6" />Amahema ayo ni enga makolongo yakuseela mazi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:6">Enga kiunga mnk'handa mwo mto.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:6">Enga maziti yakwitangwa shubili yahandigwe ni Zumbe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:6">Enga maziti yakwitangwa mielezi mnk'handa mwa mazi.<verse eid="NUM 24:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 24:7" />Mazi nayamwaguke mwa mabiga yawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:7">mbeyu zawe nezipate mazi mengi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:7">Seuta ywawe naande mkulu kujink'ha Agagi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:7">Naho useuta wawe noukulise.<verse eid="NUM 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 24:8" />Mnungu nakawaguha kulawa Misili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:8">yehe awatoanila kwa ludole enga mbogo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:8">Naabanange si za wank'hondo wenyu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:8">naatuletule mavuha yawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:8">na kuwajunga na misale yawe.<verse eid="NUM 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 24:9" />Naabandagale na kunyata enga simba.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:9">Niani naageze kumwinula?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:9">Naavikilwe yeyose naawavikile Waizilaeli</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:9">naho naaligitwe akuunga awaligite Waizilaeli.<verse eid="NUM 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 24:10" />Balaki niyo amfiila maya Balaamu, na kukunja mikono kwa maya akamgamba, “Nehikwitanga uwaligite wank'hondo wangu, mna nk'hanana izi nt'hatu kuwavikila! <verse eid="NUM 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 24:11" />Haluse! Keitile. Nekilagana hwink'he nt'hunyo nyingi, mna Zumbe haungile upate zint'hunyo izo.”<verse eid="NUM 24:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 24:12" />Balamu niyo amhitula Balaki, “Togola! Wakumbukila ivo niwagambile wegala ulosi awo wawasigile kwangu, <verse eid="NUM 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 24:13" />hata uneva unanink'ha nyumba yakwe imemile masawa na zahabu, miye henidahe kudamanya wavu kwa Zumbe, kwa kudamanya mbuli yeyose yedi hegu iihile kwa kuunga miye mwenye? Nehigamba, icho naalonge Zumbe nicho nenilonge.”<verse eid="NUM 24:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulosi wo uheelo wa Balaam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 24:14" />“Haluse nauya kwa want'hu wangu, goja hugambile mbuli izo want'hu awo nawawadamanyile want'hu wako mazuwa yakwiza.” <verse eid="NUM 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 24:15" />Ivo, Balaamu niyo alonga ulosi uno.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:15">“Ulosi wangu miye Balaamu mwana Beoli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:15">Ulosi wa mnt'hu agubulwe meso.<verse eid="NUM 24:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 24:16" />Ulosi wa mnt'hu evile ulosi wa Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:16">na mnt'hu amanyize umanyi wa Mnungu mta udahi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:16">mnt'hu akuona uwona wa Mnungu mta Udahi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:16">Akutambala hasi kifulifuli na kufunamiza mtwi wakwe hasi na meso yakwe yagubulwe.<verse eid="NUM 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 24:17" />Namuona mna hiyo ivi haluse,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:17">namkaula mna hiyo aha hagihi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:17">Nt'hondo neilaile kwa welekwa wa Yakobo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:17">Useuta noulaile kwa Waizilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:17">kwa nk'home yakwe nouwatowe vilongozi wa Moabu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:17">neiwabanange pele welekwa wose wa Seti.<verse eid="NUM 24:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 24:18" />Edomu neitahigwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:18">Seili wandaga wank'hondo wakwe nawande ugoli wakwe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:18">Izilaeli neigendeele kunda mdahi mkulu.<verse eid="NUM 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 24:19" />Kilongozi naalawe kwa Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:19">naye naawabanange wasigale kwo mzi.”<verse eid="NUM 24:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 24:20" />Niyo Balaamu awakaula Wamaleki, nakulava ulosi uno.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:20">“Waamaleki ni isi ina udahi kujink'ha isi zose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:20">Mna kwo uheelo wakwe neibanangwe pele.”<verse eid="NUM 24:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 24:21" />Balaamu awaonaga Wakeni niyo akema ivi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:21">“Aho mkwikala hana utondowazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:21">Hatondowala enga sasa mnanga mwo luwe.<verse eid="NUM 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 24:22" />Mna nyuwe Wakeni nombanangwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:22">Aho nomtahigwe ni Waashulu”<verse eid="NUM 24:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 24:23" />Naho Balaamu alongaga ulosi uno,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:23">“Togola! Niani naahone uneva Zumbe anadamanya ayo?<verse eid="NUM 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 24:24" />Mna meli nezibule kulawa Kitimu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:24">Nawaitowe Asilia na Ebeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:24">mna woho nawo nawabanike pele.”<verse eid="NUM 24:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 24:25" />Ivo, Balaamu enukaga, no kukeuiya kaya, Balaki naye niyo akeitila.<verse eid="NUM 24:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="NUM 25" />
  <para style="s">Waizilaeli uko Peoli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 25:1" />Waizilaeli weze wande uko Shitimu, wagosi nawakonga kugenda na wavele wa Moabu. <verse eid="NUM 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 25:2" />Wavele awo nawawalalika Waizilaeli wande hamwenga mwo kudamanya mviko kwe milungu yawe, waizilaeli nawo wadyaga nk'hande na kuivikila milungu yawe. <verse eid="NUM 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 25:3" />Ivi nivo Waizilaeli wakongaga kumvika mnungu Baali ywa Peoli, naho maya ya Mnungu niyo yatendesa mwawe. <verse eid="NUM 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 25:4" />Ivo, Zumbe niyo amgamba Musa, “Waguhe vilongozi wose wa Izilaeli wazaganye awant'hu, uwanyogotole mwe dizuwa vileke maya yangu kwenyu yasile.” <verse eid="NUM 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 25:5" />Musa niyo awagamba vilongozi wa Izilaeli, “Kila yumwenga ywenyu amkome mnt'hu yeyose mwe dikabila dyakwe akelungile na mnungu Baali ywa Peoli.”<verse eid="NUM 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 25:6" />Mwo lupisi ulo Mwiizlaeli yumwenga aguhaga mvele ywa Kimidianina kuita naye kwe dihema dyakwe ivi Musa no mdugano wose wa Waizilaeli wakamkaula,umwo Wazilaeli wandaga wakahongeza he nk'hili ye Dihema Dikukile. <verse eid="NUM 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 25:7" />Ivo, Fenehasi mwana Eliyazali mwana ywa mlava nt'hambiko, Haluni eze aone ayo, nakenuka na kufosa mwa want'hu awo na kuguha mjungo, <verse eid="NUM 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 25:8" />na kumtongela yudya Mwizilaeli mpaka mwe dihema dyo mnt'hu uyo na kuwajunga mjungo mwe zinda wose waidi. Na kwa kudamanya ivo unyonge wiihile noukawabananga Waizilaeli niyo wasila. <verse eid="NUM 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 25:9" />Want'hu wakomigwe nu unyonge uwo wiihile nawanda alufu milongo miidi na mine.<verse eid="NUM 25:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 25:10" />Zumbe niyo amgamba Musa, <verse eid="NUM 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 25:11" />“Kwaviya Fenehasi mwana Eliyazali, mwana mlava nt'hambiko Haluni, kakindila maya yangu mwa Waizilaeli, kwaviya mwa nyuwe ni yehe du heungile kuona mnungu mtuhu akavikwa mna miye du. Naho nivo vilekile hiwabanange Waizilaeli wose kwa maya yangu. <verse eid="NUM 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 25:12" />Kwaivo mgambile kugamba naikanaye Ndagano ya utondowazi. <verse eid="NUM 25:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 25:13" />Nalagana naye yehe na welekwa wakwe kugamba nawande walava nt'hambiko mazuwa yose, kwaviya haungile kuona mnungu mtuhu akavikwa mna miye du, na kuwavuza Waizilaeli kwangu.”<verse eid="NUM 25:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 25:14" />Uyo Mwizilaeli akomigwe hamwenga na mvele ywe Kimidiani naketangwa Zimli mwana Salu, kilongozi yumwenga mwe mp'huga imwenga ye dikabila dya Simeoni. <verse eid="NUM 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 25:15" />Uyo mvele Mmidiani akomigwe naaketangwa Kozibi mwana Suli andaga kilongozi ywa lukolo lumwenga lwa Wamidiani.<verse eid="NUM 25:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 25:16" />Zumbe niyo amgamba Musa, <verse eid="NUM 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 25:17" />“Ita kawatowe Wamidiani niyo wawakoma, <verse eid="NUM 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 25:18" />kwaviya wawadant'hilizaga niyo wawatendani mumvike mnungu ywa Baali uko Peoli, naho kwajili ya uyo Kozibi uyo akomagwa mwo lupisi lwo unyonge udya wiihile uko Peoli.”<verse eid="NUM 25:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="NUM 26" />
  <para style="s">Uwazilo wa kaidi wa Waizilaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 26:1" />Kunt'ho dize dyomboke, Zumbe niyo amgamba Musa na Eliyazali mwana Haluni mlavant'hambiko, <verse eid="NUM 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 26:2" />“Waza want'hu wose wa Izilaeli, viligane ne zimp'huga zawe. Wawazeni want'hu wose wata miyaka milongo miidi na kugendeela wakudaha kuita kwe nk'hondo.” <verse eid="NUM 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 26:3" />Musa na mlava nt'hambiko Eliyazali walongaga na want'hu mwe isi ye nt'hindiga uko Moabu, mwe nt'hendelo int'huhu ya mto Yolodani, uko Yeliko, wakamgamba,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 26:3">Awa wandaga waizilaeli walawaga Misili. <verse eid="NUM 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 26:4" />“Wawazeni want'hu wose wata miyaka milongo miidi na kugendeela, enga ivo Zumbe Mnungu amsigiile Musa.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 26:4">Awa nawo Waizilaeli walaile Misili.<verse eid="NUM 26:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 26:5" />Nk'hongo ni kabila dya Lubeni, nt'hulasasu ywa Yakobo. Henoki na Palu, <verse eid="NUM 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 26:6" />no lukolo lwa Waheziloni na lukolo lwa Wakalimi. <verse eid="NUM 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 26:7" />Izi nizo zink'holo ze dikabila dya Lubeni. Wagosi wawazigwe wandaga alufu milongo mine na mitatu na magana mfungate na milongo mitatu. <verse eid="NUM 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 26:8" />Welekwa wa Palu ni Eliebu, <verse eid="NUM 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 26:9" />na wanawe Nemueli na Datihani na Abilamu. Awa waidi Datihani na Abilamu nawo wandaga wasagulwe ni want'hu, mna nawo wamhigile Musa na Haluni, na kukelunga na want'hu wa Kola umwo wandile wakahigana na Zumbe. <verse eid="NUM 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 26:10" />Lupisi ulo sanga neigubuka niyo wahubugia pele, wabanikaga hamwenga na Kola na weyawe umwo moto wize ubanange want'hu magana maidi na milongo mishano, woho niyo wanda kanyo kwa want'hu wa Izilaeli. <verse eid="NUM 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 26:11" />Hamwenga na ayo wana wa Kola hawabanikaga.<verse eid="NUM 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 26:12" />Awa nawo welekwa wa Simioni viligane ne zink'holo zawe. Nimueli, nu lukolo lwa Wanumueli na Yamini nu lukolo lwa Wayamini na lukolo lwa Yakini nu lukolo lwa Wayakini. <verse eid="NUM 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 26:13" />Zela nu lukolo lwa Wazela na Sauli naye nu lukolo lwa Washauli. <verse eid="NUM 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 26:14" />Izo nizo zink'holo ze dikabila dya Simeoni umwo wawazagwa, wagosi wandaga alufu milongo miidi na mbili na magana maidi. 22,200 <verse eid="NUM 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 26:15" />Kabila dya Gadi dyandaga na lukolo lwa Sefoni nulo lukolo lwa Wasefoni, na Hagi kwa nk'holo za Wahagi, na Shuni nulo lukolo lwa Washuni. <verse eid="NUM 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 26:16" />Ozini nulo lukolo lwa Wazini na Eli nulo lukolo lwa Waeli, <verse eid="NUM 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 26:17" />Alodi nulo lukolo lwa Waalodi na Aleli nulo lukolo lwa Waaleli. <verse eid="NUM 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 26:18" />Idyo nidyo dikabila dya Gadi wagosi wandaga alufu milongo mine na magana mashano 40,500. <verse eid="NUM 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 26:19" />Kabila dya Yuda dyandaga na wana wa Yuda Eli na Onani. Awa nawabanikila mwe isi ya Kanaani. <verse eid="NUM 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 26:20" />Kabila dya Yuda dyandaga na nk'holo za Shela nulo lukolo lwa Washela, Pelesi nulo lukolo lwa Wapelesi, Zela naye nulo lukolo lwa Wazela. <verse eid="NUM 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 26:21" />Kulawa kwa Pelesi nulo lukolo lwa Wapelesi, kwandaga na welekwa wa Heziloni na Hamuli . <verse eid="NUM 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 26:22" />Idyo nidyo kabila dya Yuda na wagosi nawanda alufu milongo mfungate na mtandatu na magana mashano 76,500. <verse eid="NUM 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 26:23" />Izi nizo zink'holo zandaga welekwa wa Isakali. Tola nulo lukolo lwa Watola, Puva nulo lukolo lwa Wapuva. <verse eid="NUM 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 26:24" />Yashubu nulo lukolo lwa Wayashubu, Shimloni nulo lukolo lwa Washimloni. <verse eid="NUM 26:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 26:25" />Izi nizo zink'holo za Isakali awo wawazagwa, wandaga wagosi alufu milongo mtandatu na magana matatu. 64,300 <verse eid="NUM 26:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 26:26" />Izi nizo zink'holo za welekwa wa Zubuloni. Zeledi nulo lukolo lwa Wazeledi, Eloni nulo lukolo lwa Waeloni, Yaleeli nulo lukolo lwa Wayaheeli. <verse eid="NUM 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 26:27" />Izo nizo nk'holo za Zebuloni na wagosi wandaga alufu milongo mtandatu na magana mashano. 60,500 <verse eid="NUM 26:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 26:28" />Yusufu andaga na wana waidi wandaga makabila, Manase na Efulaimu. <verse eid="NUM 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 26:29" />Izi nizo zink'holo zilaile kwe dikabila dya Manase, Wamakilete ni lukolo luguhile dizina dyo mkale ywawe Makili. Makili naye niye amweleke Geleadi uyo mkale ywo lukolo lwa Wagileadi. <verse eid="NUM 26:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 26:30" />Nk'holo zilaile kwa Gileadi zandaga, Yezeli uyo mkale ywo lukolo lwa Wayezeli, Heleki uyo mkale ywo lukolo lwa Waheleki. <verse eid="NUM 26:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 26:31" />Asilieli niye mkale ywa Waasilieli, Shekemu niye mkale ywa Washekemu, <verse eid="NUM 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 26:32" />Shemida niye mkalwe ywo lukolo lwa Washemida na Hefeli niye mkale ywo lukolo lwa Wahefeli. <verse eid="NUM 26:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 26:33" />Selofehadi mwana ywa Hefeli hapataga wana kilume, andaga na wanakike du, awo ni Mala na Noa na Hogila na Milika na Tizila. <verse eid="NUM 26:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 26:34" />Izo nizo zink'holo za Manase, wagosi wawazagwa wandaga alufu milongo mishano na miidi na magana mfungate 52,700. <verse eid="NUM 26:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 26:35" />Kabila dya Efulaimu nedinda na zink'holo za Shutela nulo lukolo lwa Washutela. Beledi niye mkale ywo lukolo lwa Wabeledi na Tahani niye mkale ywo lukolo lwa Watahani. <verse eid="NUM 26:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 26:36" />Lukolo lwa Elani nolunda na welekwa wa Shutela mkale ywo lukolo lwa Washutela. <verse eid="NUM 26:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 26:37" />Izo nizo zink'holo za Efulaimu, wagosi nawanda alufu milongo mitatu na miidi na magana mashano 32,500. Nk'holo izo zose za makabila aya maidi zilawa mwa Yusufu. <verse eid="NUM 26:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 26:38" />Kabila dya Benjamini nedinda na nk'holo za Bela uyo mkale ywo lukolo lwa Wabela, Asheli niye mkale ywa Waasheli, Ahilamu naye niyo mkale ywa Waahilamu, <verse eid="NUM 26:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 26:39" />Shufamu niye ywa Washafamu, Hufamu naye andaga ywo lukolo lwa Wahufamu. <verse eid="NUM 26:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 26:40" />kulawa kwa Bela wandaga welekwa wa Alidi na Naamani. <verse eid="NUM 26:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 26:41" />Izo nizo nk'holo za Benjamini awo wawazagwa, wagosi wandaga alufu milongo mine na mishano na magana mtandatu. 45,600 <verse eid="NUM 26:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 26:42" />Kulawa kwa Dani ni Shuhamu. <verse eid="NUM 26:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 26:43" />Nk'holo za Washuhamu wawazagwa wagosi wandaga alufu milongo mtandatu na kane na magana mane. 64,400 <verse eid="NUM 26:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 26:44" />kulawa kwa Asheli ni Imaha na Ishivi na Beliahi. <verse eid="NUM 26:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 26:45" />Kulawa kwa Hebelia na Malikieli. <verse eid="NUM 26:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 26:46" />Asheli andanga na mwanakike etangagwa Sela. <verse eid="NUM 26:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 26:47" />Izo nizo zink'holo ze dikabila dya Asheli, wagosi wawazagwa wandaga alufu milongo mishano na magana mane. 53,400 <verse eid="NUM 26:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 26:48" />Kabila dya Nafutali nedinda na nk'holo za Yaseeli na Guni, <verse eid="NUM 26:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 26:49" />Yaseli ywo lukolo lwa Wayaseli, na Shilemu uyo ywo lukolo lwa Washilemu. <verse eid="NUM 26:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 26:50" />Izo nizo nk'holo ze dikabila dya Nafutali, wagosi wandaga alufu milongo mine na mishano na magana mane. 45,400 <verse eid="NUM 26:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 26:51" />Wagosi awo wa Izilaeli wawazagwa wandaga alufu magana mtandatu na imwenga na magana mfungate na milongo mitatu 601,730. <verse eid="NUM 26:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="NUM 26:52" />Niyo Zumbe Mnungu amgamba Musa, <verse eid="NUM 26:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="NUM 26:53" />“Uwapangile isi want'hu wa makabila aya kunda ukipe wawe, viligane no uwazilo wa mazina yawe. <verse eid="NUM 26:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="NUM 26:54" />Kabila kulu nediink'higwe hant'hu hakulu didodo nadyo nedink'higwe hant'hu ha dodo. Kila kabila nediink'higwe ukipe wakwe viligane no uwazilo wa want'hu wakwe. <verse eid="NUM 26:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="NUM 26:55" />Mna isi neipangigwe kwa kutoa kula. Kila kabila nedinde na ukipe viligane na mazina yo lukolo lwakwe. <verse eid="NUM 26:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="NUM 26:56" />Ukipe wa kila kabila noupangigwe kwa kutoa kula, kila kabila nedipate viligane no ukulu hegu na udodo wakwe.”<verse eid="NUM 26:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="NUM 26:57" />Awo nawo Walawi wawazigwe viligane ne zink'holo zawe. Geshoni na Kohasi na Melali. <verse eid="NUM 26:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="NUM 26:58" />Zink'holo za Lawi zandaga ni Libini na Kola na Kohasi. Kola andaga niye ise dya Amlam. <verse eid="NUM 26:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="NUM 26:59" />Mkaza Amlamu etangagwa Yokebedi elekelwe Misili naye andaga ywa kabila dya Lawi. Uyu nuyo amwelekele Amlamu wana waidi wa kilume, Haluni na Musa na Miliamu lumbudyawe. <verse eid="NUM 26:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="NUM 26:60" />Haluni awelekaga wana kilume wane awo, Nadabu, Abihu, Eliyazali na Itamali. <verse eid="NUM 26:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="NUM 26:61" />Nadabu na Abihu nawabanika weze walave malavo ya moto houmwelele Zumbe. <verse eid="NUM 26:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="NUM 26:62" />Wagosi we zink'holo za Walawi awo wandaga wa mwezi umwenga na gugendeela awo wawazagwa wandaga alufu milongo miidi na nt'hamtu. 23,000 Mna Walawi hawahanganyagwa mwo uwazilo wa Waizilaeli watuhu kwaviya woho hawenk'hagwa ukipe we isi mwa Waizilaeli.<verse eid="NUM 26:62" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="NUM 26:63" />Awo nawo wagosi wa Izilaeli wawazigwe ni Musa no Eliyazali Mlava nt'hambiko mwe isi ya mwe zint'hidiga za Moabu, ng'ambu yo mto Yolodani hagihi na Yeliko. <verse eid="NUM 26:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="NUM 26:64" />Mwa woho hakwandile hata na mnt'hu yumwenga asigale mwa wadya wawazigwe ni Musa na Haluni mlava nt'hambiko, awo wadamanyaga uwazilo aho nk'hongo uko kwe dijangwa Sinai. <verse eid="NUM 26:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="NUM 26:65" />Kwaviya Zumbe awagambaga, wose nawabanikile mwe dijangwa, naho hehali hata yumwenga naasigale mgima, mna ni Kalebu mwana ywa Yefune na Yushua mwana ywa Nuni.<verse eid="NUM 26:65" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="NUM 27" />
  <para style="s">Wana kike wa Zelofehadi watigiza ukipe wawe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 27:1" />Zuwa dimwenga wanakike wa Zelofehadi wakwitangwa Mala na Noa na Milika na Tiliza wambasaga Musa. Mwana Hefeli andaga mwa Zelofehadi andaga mwana Gileadi andaga mwana ywa Makili andaga mwana Manase uyo mwana Yusufu. <verse eid="NUM 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 27:2" />Wavele awo wakimalaga ha Musa na mlotezi Eliyazali na ha vilongozi na ha want'hu wose he nk'hili ye Dihema Dikukile niyo wagamba, <verse eid="NUM 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 27:3" />“Tati yetu abanikilaga kwe dijangwa naho hakelungaga na wadya wamtimilaga Kola awo wamhigaga Zumbe. Yehe abanikaga kwajili yo wavu wakwe mwenye, mna handaga na mwana yeyose ywa kilume. <verse eid="NUM 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 27:4" />Nii dizina dya tati yetu dikauswa mwo lukolo lwakwe, kwaviya du hana wana kilume? Kink'heni naswe usangilo wetu hamwenga na watati zetu na wanduguze dya tate.”<verse eid="NUM 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 27:5" />Ivo Musa egala kwa Zumbe ukulabila kwawe. <verse eid="NUM 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 27:6" />Zumbe niyo amgamba Musa, <verse eid="NUM 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 27:7" />“Icho wakulonga wanakike awo wa Selofehadi ni kindedi, wenk'heni usangilo wawe kunda ukipe hamwenga na watati zawe wanduguze dya tati yawe. <verse eid="NUM 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 27:8" />Niyo uwagamba Waizilaeli kugamba mnt'hu yeyose anabanika haheina kweleka mwana kilume, ukipe wakwe neenk'higwe mwana kike ywakwe. <verse eid="NUM 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 27:9" />Uneva hana mwana kike, ukipe uwo uwenk'hwe wanduguze wa kilume. <verse eid="NUM 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 27:10" />Naho uneva hana wanduguze wa kilume, ukipe wakwe uwenk'he waise wakulu na waise wadodo. <verse eid="NUM 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 27:11" />Naho uneva ise naye hana wanduguze, ukipe wakwe wenk'higwe wanduguze wa hagihi mwo lukolo ulo. Ino neinde sigilizi mwa want'hu wa Izilaeli enga ivo Zumbe asigiile.”<verse eid="NUM 27:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Joshuwa asagulwa aguhe undima wa Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 27:12" />Zumbe amgambaga Musa, “Kwela kwo mnima wa Ibalimu uikaule isi iyo niwenk'hile Waizilaeli. <verse eid="NUM 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 27:13" />Unajika kukiona isi, weye nawe noubanike enga nduguyo Haluni ivo abanike. <verse eid="NUM 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 27:14" />Weye noubanike kwaviya nyose hamzumile sigilizi zangu kudya kwe dijangwa dya Sini umwo want'hu wose weze wanilabiile kudya Meliba, hamlekile udahi wangu ukukile ulaile hawe aho weze waunge mazi.” Meliba ni nc'hoko ya mazi ya kadeshi mwe dijangwa dya Sini.<verse eid="NUM 27:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 27:15" />Musa naye niyo amgamba Zumbe, <verse eid="NUM 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 27:16" />“Zumbe Mnungu, weye Mnungu ywe viumbwa vose, nakulombeza umsagule mnt'hu mtuhu ywo kuwalongoza want'hu awa, <verse eid="NUM 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 27:17" />uyo naawalongoele na kuwalongoza mwe zindima zawe zose vileke Waizilaeli wasekunda enga ngoto heziina mdimi.”<verse eid="NUM 27:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 27:18" />Zumbe niyo amgamba Musa, “Mguhe Yoshua mwana Nuni, mnt'hu mta Muye wedi, niyo wamgeleka mikono mwo mtwi wakwe, <verse eid="NUM 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 27:19" />na kumkimalisa ha mlava nt'hambiko Eliyazali na want'hu wose, umwink'he undima uwo want'hu wose wakaona. <verse eid="NUM 27:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 27:20" />Mwink'he ludodo lwo udahi wako vileke want'hu wose wa Izilaeli wamwive. <verse eid="NUM 27:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 27:21" />Yehe naamtegeleze Eliyazali malavant'hambiko, uyo naayamanye yadya yakunelela kwa kukaula Ulimu na Thumimu. Kwa sila ino Eliyazali naamlongoze Yoshua no mdugano wose wa Waizilaeli mwe zimbuli zawe zose.” <verse eid="NUM 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 27:22" />Musa atendaga enga ivo Zumbe amsigiile. Amguhaga Yoshua na kumkimalisa ha mlava nt'hambiko Eliyazali no mdugano wose wa Izilaeli. <verse eid="NUM 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 27:23" />Niyo amgeleka mikono mwo mtwi na kumwink'ha udahi wa kwikaila want'hu enga ivo asigiilwe ni Zumbe.<verse eid="NUM 27:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="NUM 28" />
  <para style="s">Malavo ya kila zuwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 28:1" />Zumbe Mnungu niyo amsigilaga Musa, <verse eid="NUM 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 28:2" />asigiile Waizilaeli ivo vikuungwa mwo kumlavila Zumbe malavo kwa lupisi lwakwe. Nk'hande za kokwa pele, kunda mhemp'he wedi wa kumwelela.<verse eid="NUM 28:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 28:3" />“Wagambile want'hu mwa malavo ya kokwa pele wakuungwa wamlavile Zumbe kila zuwa. Ndolome mbili zo mwaka umwenga heziina lema. <verse eid="NUM 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 28:4" />Ndolome imwenga neilavigwe mtondo nt'huhu nayo neilavigwe kisingi, <verse eid="NUM 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 28:5" />kila yumwenga akanda na malavo ya nk'hande ya unga kilo imwenga uhanganywe na lita imwenga ya mavuta yedi ya zeituni. <verse eid="NUM 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 28:6" />Aya ni malavo ya kokwa pele ya kila zuwa yalavigwe nk'hongo kwo mnima Sinai kunda malavo ya nk'hande enga ivo visigiilwe, kunda mhemp'he wedi wa kumwelela Zumbe, malavo yakulavigwa kwa Zumbe kwa kokwa pele. <verse eid="NUM 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 28:7" />Kwa malavo yo kunywa hamwenga ne ndolome ya nk'hongo ugide lita imwenga ya divai nk'hali. Nougidile malavo ayo yo kunywa he kilingo cho kutambikila. <verse eid="NUM 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 28:8" />Mwana ngoto ywa kaidi noumlave kisingi enga ivo vandile mwa malavo ye nk'hande na malavo yo kunywa. Ayo nayo ni malavo yedi, mhemp'he wedi ukumwelela Zumbe.<verse eid="NUM 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malavo ye dizuwa dyo Kuhumula</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 28:9" />“Zuwa dyo Kuhumula nomlave malavo ya ndolome mbili za mwaka umwenga heziina lema, malavo ya unga ya kilo mbili za unga wedi uhanganywe na mavuta, na malavo yakwe yo kunywa. <verse eid="NUM 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 28:10" />Malavo aya yo kokwa pele nayalavigwe kila zuwa dyo Kuhumula haheina kuleka, ukaleka malavo ya kila zuwa hamwenga na malavo yakwe yo kunywa.<verse eid="NUM 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malavo ya zuwa dya nk'hongo dya kila mwezi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 28:11" />“Nk'hongo ya kila mwezi, nomumlavile Zumbe Malavo yo kokwa. Njeku mbili na ndolome imwenga na wanangoto mfungate ya mwaka umwenga heiina lema. <verse eid="NUM 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 28:12" />Nomlave malavo ya unga kilo nt'hatu, uhanganywe na mavuta kwa kila njeku imwenga naho nomlave kilo mbili za unga kwa kila ndolome imwenga, <verse eid="NUM 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 28:13" />na kilo imwenga ya unga kwa kila ndolome. Malavo aya yo kokwa ni malavo ya nk'hande yana mhemp'he wedi wa kumwelela Zumbe. <verse eid="NUM 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 28:14" />Kihimo cha malavo yo kunywa yakuungwa ni lita mbili za divai kwa kila njeku, lita imwenga na nusu kwa kila ndolome, na lita imwenga kwa kila mwana ngoto. Aya ni malavo yo kokwa ya kila zuwa dya nk'hongo dyo mwezi mwo mwaka mgima. <verse eid="NUM 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 28:15" />Naho nomumlavile Zumbe malavo ya kuusa wavu, fulata imwenga, haheina kuleka malavo yadya yo kokwa ya kila zuwa na malavo yakwe yo kunywa.<verse eid="NUM 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malavo ya dizuwa dye kinyemi dye Pasaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 28:16" />“Zuwa dyo mlongo na kane dyo mwezi wa nk'hongo damanyeni Pasaka ya Zumbe Mnungu. <verse eid="NUM 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 28:17" />Zuwa dyo mlongo na shano dyo mwezi uuwo ni zuwa dya kinyemi. Nomdye mikate heeigeligwe ugwadu kwa mazuwa mfungate. <verse eid="NUM 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 28:18" />Mwe dizuwa dya nk'hongo dye kinyemi duganeni mnivike. Zuwa idyo homdamanye ndima yeyose. <verse eid="NUM 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 28:19" />Nomlave malavo ya kokwa kunda malavo ya nk'hande kwa Zumbe. Njeku mbili na ndolome imwenga, na ndolome mfungate za mwaka umwenga, zose zinde heziina malema. <verse eid="NUM 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 28:20" />Lava lavo dikwelela dya nk'hande, dya unga uhanganywe na mavuta, kilo vnt'hatu kwa kila njeku, na kilo mbili kwa kila ndolome, <verse eid="NUM 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 28:21" />na kilo imwenga kwa ziya ndolome mfungate. <verse eid="NUM 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 28:22" />Naho nomlave fulata imwenga kunda malavo ya kuusa wavu vileke muwavuze kwa Zumbe. <verse eid="NUM 28:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 28:23" />Nomlave vint'hu ivi haheina kuleka malavo ya kokwa pele yazoelwe yakulavigwa mtondo. <verse eid="NUM 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 28:24" />Iviya iviya noulave nk'hande kwa malavo ya moto kila zuwa kwa mazuwa mfungate kunda malavo yakumwelela Zumbe. Neilavigwe haheina kuleka malavo yo kokwa ya kila zuwa na malavo yakwe yo kunywa. <verse eid="NUM 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 28:25" />Mwe dizuwa dyo mfungate nomdugane mnivike, msekudamanya ndima.<verse eid="NUM 28:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zuwa dya kinyemi dyo uvuni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 28:26" />“Mwe dizuwa dya nk'hongo kinyemi dyo uvuni nomnigaile ulozo mhya, nomdugane mnivike, msekudamanya ndima. <verse eid="NUM 28:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 28:27" />Nomlave malavo ya kokwa yana mhemp'he wedi ukumwelela Zumbe Mnungu. Njeku mbili na ndolome imwenga na myate mfungate ya mwaka umwenga, <verse eid="NUM 28:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 28:28" />mlave nk'hande ikwelela, malavo ya unga uhanganywe na mavuta ya zeituni, kilo nt'hatu za unga kwa kila njeku na kilo mbili kwa kila ndolome, <verse eid="NUM 28:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 28:29" />na kilo imwenga kwa kila mwana ngoto. <verse eid="NUM 28:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 28:30" />Nomlave fulata imwenga kunda malavo ya kuusa wavu vileke muwavuze want'hu kwa Zumbe. <verse eid="NUM 28:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 28:31" />Nomlave vint'hu ivi haheina kuleka divai kwa malavo ya kila zuwa na malavo ya nk'hande. Malavo ayo yasekunda na malema yoyose.”<verse eid="NUM 28:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="NUM 29" />
  <para style="s">Kinyemi cho mwaka mhya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 29:1" />Zuwa dya nk'hongo dyo mwezi wa mfungate, nomdugane mnivike. Msekudamanya ndima. Mwe dizuwa idyo magunda nayatoigwe. <verse eid="NUM 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 29:2" />Nomlave malavo ya kokwa, mhemp'he wedi wa kumwelela Zumbe. Njeku imwenga, na ndolome imwenga, na wanangoto mfungate wa mwaka umwenga heweiina lema. <verse eid="NUM 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 29:3" />Nomlave naho malavo yakwe ya unga wedi uhanganywe na mavuta. Kilo nt'hantu kwa kila njeku, na kilo mbili kwa kila ndolome, <verse eid="NUM 29:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 29:4" />na kilo imwenga kwa kila mwana ngoto. <verse eid="NUM 29:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 29:5" />Naho nomlave fulata imwenga kunda malavo ya kuusa wavu vileke muwavuze want'hu kwa Zumbe. <verse eid="NUM 29:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 29:6" />Nomlave vint'hu ivi, haheina kuleka malavo yo kokwa kwe dizuwa dya nk'hongo dyo mwezi na malavo ya nk'hande ya mazuwa yose na malavo ya divai. Malavo aya ye nk'hande ni mhemp'he ukumwelela Zumbe.<verse eid="NUM 29:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zuwa dya kumuuiya Zumbe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 29:7" />Mwe dizuwa dya mlongo dyo mwezi wa mfungate nomdugane mnivike. Zuwa idyo mwaungwa mfunge naho msekudamanya ndima. <verse eid="NUM 29:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 29:8" />Nomumlavile Zumbe Mnungu malavo ya kokwa yana mhemp'he wedi ukumwelela Zumbe, na njeku imwenga na ndolome imwenga, na wana ngoto mfungate wa mwaka umwenga heweina lema. <verse eid="NUM 29:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 29:9" />Mlave malavo ya unga udinyigwe uhanganywe na mavuta na kilo nt'hatu za unga hamwenga kwa njeku na kilo mbili hamwenga ne ndolome iyo, <verse eid="NUM 29:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 29:10" />na kilo imwenga kwa kila mwate. <verse eid="NUM 29:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 29:11" />Nomlave fulata imwenga kunda malavo ya kuusa wavu haheina kuleka malavo yo kuwavuza want'hu kwa Zumbe na malavo ya kokwa pele ya mazuwa yose na malavo ya nk'hande hamwenga na malavo ya kunywa.<verse eid="NUM 29:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zuwa dya kinyemi dye viheha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 29:12" />Mwe dizuwa dya mlongo na shano wo mwezi wa mfungate, nomdugane mniuvike. Homdamanye ndima zuwa idyo. Nomdamanye wila kwaajili ya Mungu kwa mazuwa mfungate. <verse eid="NUM 29:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 29:13" />Nomlave malavo ya kokwa yana mhemp'he wedi ukumwelela Zumbe, njeku mlongo na nt'hatu na ndolome mbili, na ndolome mlongo na wane wo mwaka umwenga. Zose heziina lema. <verse eid="NUM 29:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 29:14" />Malavo ya nk'hande nayahanganywe na unga wedi uhanganywe na mavuta. Kilo nt'hatu kwa kila njeku, na kilo mbili kwa kila ndolome, <verse eid="NUM 29:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 29:15" />na kilo imwenga kwa kila ndolome. <verse eid="NUM 29:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 29:16" />Naho nomlave fulata imwenga kunda malavo ya kuusa wavu, haheina kuleka malavo ya kokwa hamwenga na malavo yakwe ya unga na malavo yo kunywa.<verse eid="NUM 29:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 29:17" />Zuwa dya kaidi nomlave njeku mlongo na mbili na ndolome mbili na wana ngoto mlongo na wane wo mwaka umwenga heweiina lema. <verse eid="NUM 29:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 29:18" />Nomlave naho malavo ya unga na malavo yo kunywa hamwenga na njeku na ndolome na wadya wanangoto wa mwaka umwenga viligane no uwazilo wawe enga ivo visigiilwe. <verse eid="NUM 29:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 29:19" />Naho nomlave fulata imwenga kunda malavo ya kuusa wavu, haheina kuleka malavo ya kokwa ya mazuwa yose hamwenga na malavo yakwe yo unga na malavo yo kunywa. <verse eid="NUM 29:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 29:20" />Zuwa dya katatu nomlave njeku mlongo na imwenga, ndolome mbili na mwana ngoto mlongo na kane wo mwaka umwenga heziina lema. <verse eid="NUM 29:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 29:21" />Nomzilave hamwenga na malavo yakwe ya unga na malavo yo kunywa kwa ng'ombe izo ne zindolome izo na wana ngoto viligane no uwazilo wawe enga ivo visigiilwe. <verse eid="NUM 29:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 29:22" />Naho nomlave fulata imwenga kunda malavo ya kuusa wavu, mkongezela na malavo ya kokwa ya mazuwa yose hamwenga na malavo yakwe ya unga na malavo ya kunywa. <verse eid="NUM 29:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 29:23" />Zuwa dya kane nomlave njeku mlongo na ndolome mbili, na wana ngoto mlongo na kane wa mwaka umwenga heeina lema viligane no uwazilo wawe enga ivo visigiilwe. <verse eid="NUM 29:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 29:24" />Nomlave naho malavo ya unga na malavo yo kunywa hamwenga na njeku na ndolome na wana ngoto wa mwaka umwenga viligane na uwazilo wawe enga ivo visigiilwe. <verse eid="NUM 29:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 29:25" />Naho nomlave fulata imwenga kunda malavo ya kuusa wavu, haheina kuleka malavo ya kokwa ya mazuwa yose hamwenga na malavo yakwe ya unga na malavo ya kunywa. <verse eid="NUM 29:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 29:26" />Zuwa dya shano, nomlave njeku kenda na ngoto mbili na ndolome mlongo na nne za mwaka umwenga heziina lema. <verse eid="NUM 29:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 29:27" />Naho nomlave malavo ya unga na malavo yo kunywa hamwenga na njeku na ndolome na wana ngoto viligane no uwazilo wawe enga ivo visigiilwe. <verse eid="NUM 29:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 29:28" />Naho nomlave fulata imwenga kunda malavo ya kuusa wavu, haheinan kuleka na malavo ya kokwa ya mazuwa yose hamwenga na malavo yakwe ya unga na malavo ya kunywa. <verse eid="NUM 29:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 29:29" />Zuwa dya mtandatu nomlave njeku mnane na ndolome mbili na wanangoto wa mwaka umwenga heweina lema. <verse eid="NUM 29:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 29:30" />Nomlave naho malavo ya unga na malavo yo kunywa hamwenga na njeku na ndolome na wanangoto wa mwaka umwenga viligane no uwazilo wawe enga ivo visigiilwe. <verse eid="NUM 29:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 29:31" />Naho nomlave fulata imwenga kunda malavo ya kuusa wavu, haheina kuleka malavo ya kokwa ya mazuwa yose hamwenga na malavo yakwe ya unga na malavo ya kunywa. <verse eid="NUM 29:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 29:32" />Zuwa dya mfungate nomlave njeku mfungate na ndolome mbili na wanangoto mlongo na wane wa mwaka umwenga heweina lema. <verse eid="NUM 29:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 29:33" />Nomlave malavo ya unga na malavo yo kunywa hamwenga na jeku na ndolome na wana ngoto viligane no uwazilo wawe, enga ivo visigiilwe, <verse eid="NUM 29:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 29:34" />naho nomlave fulata imwenga kunda malavo ya kuusa wavu, haheina kuleka malavo yenyu yo kokwa ya kila zuwa vikanda ni hamwenga na malavo ya nk'hande na malavo yo kunywa. <verse eid="NUM 29:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 29:35" />Mwe dizuwa dya mnane mdugane mnivike miye Zumbe. Msekudamanya ndima yoyose. <verse eid="NUM 29:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 29:36" />Nomlave malavo ya kokwa yana mhemp'he wedi ukunelela miye, njeku imwenga na ndolome imwenga, na wana ngoto mfungate wo mwaka umwenga. Wose heweena lema. <verse eid="NUM 29:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 29:37" />Nomlave naho malavo ya nk'hande na malavo yo kunywa hamwenga ne njeku ne zindolome viligane na uwazilo wawe enga ivo visigiilwe. <verse eid="NUM 29:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 29:38" />Naho nomlave fulata imwenga kunda malavo ya kuusa wavu, haheina kuleka malavo yenyu yo kokwa ya kila zuwa vikanda ni hamwenga na malavo ya nk'hande na malavo yo kunywa. <verse eid="NUM 29:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 29:39" />Izi nizo zisigilizi za malavo ya kila mazuwa ya kinyemi enga ivo msigiilwe. nomlave malavo yo kokwa na malavo ye nk'hande na malavo ya kuvuza want'hu kwa Zumbe. Nomumlavile Zumbe mwo lupisi lwa kinyemi chenyu lwiikigwe. Haheina kuleka malavo matuhu, na malavo yo kunywa ayo mkumlavila Zumbe malavo ya kukint'hiza vilapi na malavo kwa kuunga wenye.<verse eid="NUM 29:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 29:40" />Ivo, Musa niyo awagambila Waizilaeli kila kint'hu enga ivo asigiilwe ni Zumbe.<verse eid="NUM 29:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="NUM 30" />
  <para style="s">Sigilizi mwo kuika Kilapi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 30:1" />Niyo Musa awagamba vilongozi wa makabila ya Izilaeli, “Aya nayo asigiile Zumbe. <verse eid="NUM 30:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 30:2" />Mnt'hu yeyose anaika kilapi cha kumwink'ha Zumbe kint'hu na kuika Ndagano kwa kwelisa asekukiusa kilapi chakwe, vaungwa adamanye viligane na ivo alongile.<verse eid="NUM 30:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 30:3" />“Mwanakike anaika kilapi kwa Zumbe na kukeika mwenye mwe kilapi akanda ekala mwe nyumba ya ise, <verse eid="NUM 30:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 30:4" />ise naye aneva icho kilapi chakwe ne Ndagano iyo niyo anyamala, aho vilapi vakwe vose nevikimale naho kila kilapi chakwe nekimtoze mwenye. <verse eid="NUM 30:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 30:5" />Mna uneva ise aneva kilapi icho ne Ndagano iyo mwe dizuwa mwe kilapi icho niyo amhiga, ivo vilapi vakwe vose ne Zindagano zakwe hevimtoze. Zumbe Mnungu naamlekele kwaviya ise nakahiga ikilapi icho.<verse eid="NUM 30:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 30:6" />“Uneva mndele anaika kilapi na Ndagano akanda akei kulombigwa haheina wengele nande kaketozeleza mwenye, <verse eid="NUM 30:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 30:7" />niyo mgosiwe eva mna naye hamhigile mwe dizuwa idyo akiviilaga kilapi icho, kilapi chakwe nekimtozeleze. <verse eid="NUM 30:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 30:8" />Mna uneva mgosiwe aneva mbuli iyo na kumhiga, ivo uyo mgosi naakiuse kilapi cha mkaziwe na Ndagano yakwe aikile haheina kufanyanya, Zumbe naye naamlekele.<verse eid="NUM 30:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 30:9" />“Mna uneva mndele abanikilwe ni mgosi hegu asigwe anaika kilapi na Ndagano hegu anakeika mwenye mwe kilapi na Ndagano haadahe kuleka kukikint'hiza.<verse eid="NUM 30:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 30:10" />“Uneva mvele alombigwe anaika kilapi hegu anaika Ndagano mwenye, <verse eid="NUM 30:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 30:11" />niyo mgosiwe aiva mbuli iyo naho, niyo hamgambile kint'hu hegu kulemeza, ivo kilapi chakwe hekiuswe. <verse eid="NUM 30:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 30:12" />Mna uneva mgosiwe anaziva zimbuli zakwe, niyo azilemela mwe dizuwa azivile, niho kila kiya alongile mwa mazuwa ayo aikile kilapi nayauswe kwaviya mgosiwe kazilemela naho Zumbe namlekele. <verse eid="NUM 30:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 30:13" />Mgosiwe adaha kuzumila hegu kuhiga kilapi hegu Ndagano yoyose aikaga mkaziwe. <verse eid="NUM 30:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 30:14" />Mna uneva mgosiwe halemele kilapi icho ne Ndagano mwe dizuwa evaga niyo halemele vilapi vakwe vose vikumtozeleza, mvele uyo nevimuunge adamanye vose ivo alongile.<verse eid="NUM 30:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 30:15" />“Mna uneva uyo mgosiwe kaviva vilapi ivo niyo avilemela, niho mgosi uyo naaguhe masa ya mkaziwe.<verse eid="NUM 30:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 30:16" />“Izi nizo zisigilizi ne Zindagano Zumbe amsigiilaga Musa mwe mbuli ya mgosi na mkaziwe, na mwe mbuli ya mwana kike na ise umwo akanda akei ekala kwa ise.”<verse eid="NUM 30:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="NUM 31" />
  <para style="s">Waizilaeli wawalihiza kikoda Wamidiani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 31:1" />Zumbe amgambaga Musa, <verse eid="NUM 31:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 31:2" />“Lihizeni kikoda kwa Wamidiani kwa mbuli wawatendele Waizilaeli, ukajika aho weye noubanike.” <verse eid="NUM 31:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 31:3" />Ivo Musa niyo awagamba want'hu, “Waikeni lumwe want'hu kwa nk'hondo waite wakawatowe Wamidiani wakalihize kikoda kwa yadya wawatendeleni. <verse eid="NUM 31:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 31:4" />Naho nomwigale kwe nk'hondo want'hu alufu kulawa mwe kila kabila dya Izilaeli.” <verse eid="NUM 31:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 31:5" />Ivo, want'hu magana mlongo na waidi wakekakaga vitowanilo awo walavagwa mwe kila kabila dya Waizilaeli. <verse eid="NUM 31:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 31:6" />Musa nakawegala kwe nk'hondo mwo useuta wa Finehasi mwana mlava nt'hambiko Eliyazali, akanda ne vyombo va hant'hu hakukile na magunda ya kulavila vilagiso. <verse eid="NUM 31:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 31:7" />Wawatowaga want'hu wa Midiani, enga ivo Zumbe Mnungu amsigiile Musa, wawakomaga wagosi wose. <verse eid="NUM 31:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 31:8" />Mwa want'hu awo wakomigwe, nokunda na maseuta washano wa Midiani. Evi na Lekemu na Suli na Huli na Leba. Iviaivia nawamkoma Balaamu mwana Beoli. <verse eid="NUM 31:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 31:9" />Waizilaeli wawatahaga wavele na wana na mafyo yose ye mifugwa na ugoli wawe wose. <verse eid="NUM 31:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 31:10" />Watimp'haga moto mizi yawe yose, kaya zawe na nk'hambi zawe zose. <verse eid="NUM 31:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 31:11" />Nawaguha watahigwa wose ne mifugwa, <verse eid="NUM 31:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 31:12" />vint'hu vitahigwe kwe nk'hondo wavigalaga kwa Musa na Eliyazali na want'hu wose wa Izilaeli wekwe nk'hambi mwe isi ya mwe nt'hindiga ya Moabu, nt'hendelo ya Yolodani hagihi na Yeliko.<verse eid="NUM 31:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Watowani wauya kulawa kwe nk'hondo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 31:13" />Musa na mlava nt'hambiko Eliyazali na vilongozi wose wa want'hu wa Izilaeli wafosaga kuse ye nk'hambi niyo wagenda kuwasingila watowani. <verse eid="NUM 31:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 31:14" />Musa nakaihizwa ni wakulu wa watowani na wakulu maalufu na wakulu wa watowani magana wauiye kulawa kwe nk'hondo. <verse eid="NUM 31:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 31:15" />Musa niyo awauza, “Nii hamuwakomile wavele awa? <verse eid="NUM 31:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 31:16" />Kumbukileni kugamba wavele nawo wawatendile Waizilaeli wamleke Zumbe kwa kumtimila Balaam kudya Peoli, kint'hu chegalaga manyonge yakutisa mwa want'hu wa Zumbe na kuwakoma. <verse eid="NUM 31:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 31:17" />Kwa ivo, wakomeni wana wose wa kilume na kila mvele agendile na mgosi. <verse eid="NUM 31:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 31:18" />Mna msekuwakoma wali na mazanga wose, walekeni wagima kwaajili yenyu nyuwe wenye. <verse eid="NUM 31:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 31:19" />Na wose mwa nyuwe wakomile mnt'hu hegu kukwafa kimba vaungwa wekale kuse ye nk'hambi kwa mazuwa mfungate, kekukizeni hamwenga na wadya watahigwe mwe dizuwa dya katatu na dya mfungate. <verse eid="NUM 31:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 31:20" />Kukizeni suke zenyu na kila kint'hu cha nk'hingo, na cha mazoya ya ngoto na kidamanywe cha ziti disongolwe.”<verse eid="NUM 31:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 31:21" />Mlava nt'hambiko Eliyazali kawagamba wagosi wauiye kwe nk'hondo, “Ino ni sigilizi Zumbe amwink'hile Musa. <verse eid="NUM 31:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 31:22" />Zahabu na masawa na shaba, kilama na bati na madini ya chumbu, <verse eid="NUM 31:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 31:23" />vint'hu vose hevikusha enga viya zahabu, masawa, shaba, chuma, bati na madini ya chumbu, nevikukizwe kwa komboswa mwo moto mna iviyaiviya nekikukizwe mwa mazi, mna chochose kikudaha kusha nekikukizwe na mazi. <verse eid="NUM 31:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 31:24" />Zuwa dya mfungate mfigise zisuke zenyu, nomnde mkuka niho nomuuye kwe nk'hambi.”<verse eid="NUM 31:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Upasi we vint'hu na want'hu vitahigwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 31:25" />Naho Zumbe amgambaga Musa, <verse eid="NUM 31:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 31:26" />“Weye na mlava nt'hambiko Eliyazali, hamwenga vilongozi wa want'hu wose, Muwawaze awant'hu ne mifugwa mtahile. <verse eid="NUM 31:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 31:27" />Sangileni haidi ivo mvitahile kwe nk'hondo. Nusu ye disangilo wenk'heni watowani waitile kwe nk'hondo, nusu int'huhu wenk'heni want'hu wose wasigale. <verse eid="NUM 31:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 31:28" />Naho uguhe disangilo kulawa mwa watowani waitile kwe nk'hondo dinde kodi kwajili ya Zumbe. Imwenga mwa kila magana mashano yakanda ni kulawa mwa want'hu, ng'ombe, mp'hunda, ngoto hegu mbuzi. <verse eid="NUM 31:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 31:29" />Noumwink'he mlava nt'hambiko Eliyazali kunda malavo kwa Zumbe. <verse eid="NUM 31:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 31:30" />Mna nouguhe mwa Waizilaeli imwenga mwe kila milongo mishano ikanda ni mwa want'hu hegu ng'ombe hegu mp'hunda hegu ngoto, mbuzi, hegu mifugwa mituhu, uwenk'he Walawi awo wandima we Dihema Dikukile.” <verse eid="NUM 31:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 31:31" />Musa na mlava nt'hambiko Eliyazali nawadamanya enga ivo Zumbe asigiile.<verse eid="NUM 31:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 31:32" />Ngoto ne zimbuzi izo zitahagwe na watowani zandaga alufu magana mtandatu na milongo mfungate na shano 675,000, <verse eid="NUM 31:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 31:33" />ng'ombe zandaga magana milongo mfungate na miidi 72,000, <verse eid="NUM 31:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 31:34" />mp'unda zandaga alufu milongo mtandatu na imwenga 61,000, <verse eid="NUM 31:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 31:35" />na wandeele awo wandaga wali na mazanga wandaga alufu milongo mitatu na mbili. <verse eid="NUM 31:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 31:36" />Watowani waitaga kwe nk'hondo wenk'hagwa mbuzi na ngoto alufu magana matatu na milongo mitati na mfungate na magana mashano 337,500. <verse eid="NUM 31:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 31:37" />Mwa izo magana mtandatu na milongo mfungate na shano, 675 zandaga za Zumbe. <verse eid="NUM 31:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 31:38" />Ng'ombe alufu magana milongo mitatu na mtandatu, naho mwa izo milongo mfungate na mbili zandaga geleko kwa Zumbe. <verse eid="NUM 31:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 31:39" />Mp'hunda zandaga alufu milongo mitatu na magana mashano, mwa geleko kwa Zumbe yandaga milongo mtandatu na imwenga. <verse eid="NUM 31:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 31:40" />Wali na mazanga wandaga alufu mlongo na mtandatu 16,000. Mwa awo, geleko kwa Zumbe wandaga milongo mitatu na miidi. <verse eid="NUM 31:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 31:41" />Ivo Musa niyo amwink'ha Eliyazali imwenga ya mlongo yandaga geleko kwa Zumbe enga ivo amsigiile Musa. <verse eid="NUM 31:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 31:42" />Idya inusu wenk'higwe Waizilaeli, yaliganaga na iyo Musa awaikile watowani, <verse eid="NUM 31:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 31:43" />inusu iyo ya want'hu yandaga ngoto na mbuzi alufu magana matatu na milongo mitatu na mafungate na magana mashano, 337,500, <verse eid="NUM 31:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 31:44" />ng'ombe zandaga alufu milongo mitatu na mtandatu. 36,000, <verse eid="NUM 31:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 31:45" />mp'hunda zandaga alufu milongo mitatu na magana mashano 30,500, <verse eid="NUM 31:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 31:46" />want'hu wandaga alufu mlongo na mtandatu, 16,000. <verse eid="NUM 31:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 31:47" />Musa aguhaga yumwenga kulawa mwa disangilo wenki'higwe Waizilaeli mwa kila want'hu milongo mishano na mifugwa milongo mishano na kuwenk'ha Walawi awo wandaga wandima we Dihema Dikukile enga ivo asiigiilwe ni Zumbe.<verse eid="NUM 31:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 31:48" />Ivo wakulu wa mafyo ya watowani wose kwa hamwenga wamwitilaga Musa, <verse eid="NUM 31:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 31:49" />wakamgamba, “Suwe wandima wako kiwawaza watowani wose we hasi yetu naho kiona kugamba wose weaha. <verse eid="NUM 31:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 31:50" />Naswe kigala malavo kwa Zumbe, ayo kila mnt'hu apatile hamwenga na vint'hu va zahabu. Bangili na mp'hete na heleni na usalu vileke kivilava ivi kumwink'ha nt'hogola Zumbe kwajili yo wikazi wetu.” <verse eid="NUM 31:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 31:51" />Musa na mlava nt'hambiko Eliyazali nawo wahokela zahabu iyo. Zahabu iyo yandaga ni vint'hu visanigwe kulawa mwe zahabu. <verse eid="NUM 31:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="NUM 31:52" />Zahabu yose kulawa kwa wakulu wa watowani wose, yandaga enga kilo magana maidi. <verse eid="NUM 31:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="NUM 31:53" />Mwe vint'hu ivo watahaga, kila mtowani akeguhilaga vint'hu vakwe mwenye. <verse eid="NUM 31:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="NUM 31:54" />Ivo, Musa na mlava nt'hambiko Eliyazali waigalaga izahabu iyo kwe Dihema Dikukile kwaviya Zumbe kawamila want'hu wa Izilaeli.<verse eid="NUM 31:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="NUM 32" />
  <para style="s">Makabila ya Ulailo wa zuwa wo mto Yolodani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 32:1" />Makabila ya Lubeni na Gadi yandilisaga na mifugwa mingi. Ivo weze waone kugamba isi ya Yazeli na Gileadi yandaga yedi kwa udimi, <verse eid="NUM 32:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 32:2" />wawabasaga Musa na mlava nt'hambiko Eliyazali na vilongozi wa want'hu niyo wawagamba, <verse eid="NUM 32:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 32:3" />“Mizi ya Ataloti na Diboni na Yazeli na Nimla na Heshiboni na Eleale na Sebamu na Nebo na Beoni, <verse eid="NUM 32:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 32:4" />iyo isi Zumbe aitowaga kwaajili ya Waizilaeli. Isi iyo yedi kwa udimi naho suwe wandima wako kinanayo mifugwa mingi. <verse eid="NUM 32:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 32:5" />Ivo, uneva noukizumile chakulombeza ukink'he isi ino inde ukipe wetu, usekukigala kikekale ng'ambu yo mto Yolodani.”<verse eid="NUM 32:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 32:6" />Mna Musa niyo awahitula want'hu wa makabila ya Gadi na Leubeni, “Togoleni mwaunga msigale aha umwo wandugu zenyu wakaita kwe nk'hondo? <verse eid="NUM 32:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 32:7" />Nii mwawagela chevu Waizilaeli wasekuita mwe isi wenk'higwe ni Zumbe? <verse eid="NUM 32:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 32:8" />Ivo nivo watendile wadya watati zenyu nize niwasigiile kulawa Kadeshi Banea mwo kuipelemba isi. <verse eid="NUM 32:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 32:9" />Wapelembi awo nawaita mpaka mwe dikolongo dya Eshekoli, na kuiona isi, mna weze wauye, nawawagela chevu Waizilaeli wasekwingila mwe isi wenk'higwe ni Zumbe. <verse eid="NUM 32:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 32:10" />Zumbe afaga maya mwe dizuwa idyo niyo aika kilapi akagamba, <verse eid="NUM 32:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 32:11" />‘Kwaviya hawanizumile kwa moyo wose, ikindedi hahali yeyose mwa want'hu walaile Misili, wata miyaka milongo miidi na kugendeela naaiyone isi niwenk'hile Ibulahimu na Isaka na Yakobo.’ <verse eid="NUM 32:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 32:12" />Wose hawengile mwe isi iyo, mna ni Kalebu mwana Yefune mlukolo ywa Mkenizi na Yoshua mwana Nuni du, kwaviya woho wanizumila kwa moyo wose. <verse eid="NUM 32:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 32:13" />Zumbe awafiilaga maya Waizilaeli, na kuwatenda wangadike mwe dijangwa kwa miyaka milongo mine, mpaka cheleko kidamanye wavu ha Zumbe kisile pele, <verse eid="NUM 32:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 32:14" />haluse naho, nyuwe cheleko kina wavu mwinuka hant'hu ha watati zenyu, mwongezele naho maya ya Zumbe mwa Waizilaeli! <verse eid="NUM 32:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 32:15" />Uneva nyuwe mnalemela kumtimila, yehe naawalekeni mwe dijangwa, nyuwe nomuwatende want'hu awa wose wabanike.”<verse eid="NUM 32:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 32:16" />Ivo want'hu we dikabila dya Lubeni na Gadi niyo wambasa Musa, wakamgamba, “Suwe nekizenge madewa ye mifugwa yetu na kuwazengela gomela mizi ya wana wetu. <verse eid="NUM 32:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 32:17" />Mna suwe wenye nekinde kikeika lumwe kuita kwe nk'hondo hamwenga na wandugu zetu Waizilaeli, naho nekiwalongoele kwe nk'hondo mpaka kiwabuze hant'hu hawe. Mwo lupisi ulwo wana wetu nawekale mwe mizi ina gomela, vileke wakeamile na wakaya we isi ino. <verse eid="NUM 32:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 32:18" />Hekiuye kaya mpaka aho kila Mwizilaeli akeza kupata ukipe wakwe we isi. <verse eid="NUM 32:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 32:19" />Mna hekiguhe ukipe we kint'hu chochose hamwenga na woho mwe ng'ambu ya mto Yolodani na kugendeela, kwaviya suwe kipata ukipe wetu kwe nt'hendelo nt'huhu yo mto Yolodani.”<verse eid="NUM 32:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 32:20" />Ivo Musa niyo awagamba, “Uneva kindedi nomdamanye enga ivo mlongile, niyo mwakeika lumwe kuita kwe nk'hondo kwajili ya Zumbe, <verse eid="NUM 32:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 32:21" />naho uneva watowani wenyu nawomboke mto wa Yolodani na kugendeela kutowana mpaka aho Zumbe akeza kuwahuma wank'hondo wakwe hakwe, <verse eid="NUM 32:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 32:22" />niyo is ina humwa kwa Zumbe niho nomuuye, nanywe homnde na masa kwa Zumbe hegu kwa Izilaeli, isi ino neinde yenyu ha Zumbe. <verse eid="NUM 32:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 32:23" />Mna hamdahile kukint'hiza mbuli ino nomnde mdamanya wavu ha Zumbe, noho mmanye kugamba ikindedi nomsulumizwe. <verse eid="NUM 32:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 32:24" />Wazengeleni wavele wenyu na wana wenyu mizi, na madewa kwajili ye mifugwa yenyu, mna damanyeni enga ivo mlongile!”<verse eid="NUM 32:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 32:25" />Niyo want'hu wa Gadi na wa Leubeni wamgamba Musa, “Suwe wandima wako nekidamanye enga ivo ukisigiile. <verse eid="NUM 32:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 32:26" />Wavele wetu na wana wetu na mifugwa yetu nawasigale aaha mwe mizi ya Gileadi, <verse eid="NUM 32:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 32:27" />mna suwe wandima wako nekiite kwe nk'hondo kikalongozwa ni Zumbe. Nekijink'he mto Yolodani na kutoana nawo, enga ivo ulongile.”<verse eid="NUM 32:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 32:28" />Ivo, Musa niyo amsigiila mlava nt'hambiko Eliyazali, Yoshua mwana Nuni, na kwa vilongozi wa mbuya ya makabila ya Waizilaeli mwa makabila ayo. <verse eid="NUM 32:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 32:29" />Ivo niyo Musa awagamba “Uneva welekwa wa Gadi na wa Leubeni nawomboke mto wa Yolodani hamwenga na nyuwe wakeika lumwe kuita kwe nk'hondo wakalongozwa ni Zumbe, wawahuma na kuguha isi iyo, niho nomuwenk'he isi ya Gileadi inde yawe, <verse eid="NUM 32:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 32:30" />mna uneva hawomboke mto Yolodani hamwenga na nyuwe hamwenga ne vitowanilo vawe kuita kwe nk'hondo, ivo nawande wakipe mwe isi ya Kanaani hamwenga na nyuwe iyo ukwo usweelo wa zuwa wo mto Yolodani.”<verse eid="NUM 32:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 32:31" />Welekwa wa Gadi na wa Lubeni niyo wahitula, “Suwe wandima wako nekidamanye enga ivo Zumbe akisigiile. <verse eid="NUM 32:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 32:32" />Kikalongozwa ni Zumbe kikeike lumwe kutowana kwe nk'hondo mpaka mwe isi ya Kanaani, ukipe wetu nounde nt'hendelo ya ulailo wa zuwa wo mto Yolodani.”<verse eid="NUM 32:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 32:33" />Ivo, Musa niyo awenk'ha welekwa makabila ya Gadi na Leubeni na nusu ya makabila ya Manase mwana Yosefu, isi yose ya seuta Sihoni ywa Waamoli na isi ya seuta Ogu ywa Bashani hamwenga na mizi ikuzunguluka isi iyo. <verse eid="NUM 32:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 32:34" />Kabila dya Lubeni niyo waizenga naho mizi ya Diboni na Ataloiti na Aloeli, <verse eid="NUM 32:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 32:35" />na Ataloiti Shofani na Yazeli na Yogebeha, <verse eid="NUM 32:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 32:36" />Beti Nimla na Beti Halani. Mizi iyo yandaga na magomela na madewa. <verse eid="NUM 32:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 32:37" />Kabila dya Lubeni niyo waizenga naho mizi ya Heshiboni na Eleale na Kiliataimu, <verse eid="NUM 32:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 32:38" />na Nebo na Baa Meoni na Sibima. Mizi waizengaga uhya waink'haga mazina matuhu. <verse eid="NUM 32:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 32:39" />Welekwa wa Makini, mwana Manase, nawaitoa isi ya Geleadi niyo waitaha na kuwagulusa Waamoli awo wandile wakekala umwo. <verse eid="NUM 32:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 32:40" />Kwaivo, Musa niyo awenk'ha want'hu wo lukolo lwa Makili mwana Manase, isi ya Geleadi, woho nawo niyo wekala umwo. <verse eid="NUM 32:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 32:41" />Lukolo lwa Yaili, mwana ywa kabila dya Manase, wazitoaga zikaya ya Geleadi na kuitaha, na kuiink'ha zina Hawoti Yaili. Kugamba kaya za Yaili. <verse eid="NUM 32:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 32:42" />Lukolo lwa Noba nalo lwaitowaga na kuitaha Kenati na mizi yakwe, na kuink'ha zina dya Noba, dizina dyakwe mwenye.<verse eid="NUM 32:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="NUM 33" />
  <para style="s">Utafi wa Waizilaeli kulawa Misili kuita Moabu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 33:1" />Izi nizo zint'hulwe za Waizilaeli izo wagendaga umwo wandaga wakalawa Misili, wakanda mwa mafyo ya makabila yawe wakalongozwa ni Musa na Haluni. <verse eid="NUM 33:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 33:2" />Musa awandikaga zina dya kila hant'hu waikile nk'hambi, nt'hulwe na nt'hulwe, kwa sigilizi ya Zumbe. Ino niyo int'hambo yawe nt'hulwe kwa nt'hulwe. <verse eid="NUM 33:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 33:3" />Waizilaili wahalawaga ho mzi wa Lamasesi mwe dizuwa dya mlongo na shano dyo mwezi wa nk'hongo, zuwa dimwenga Pasaka ize yomboke. Wahalawaga kwa udahi mkulu ha Wamisili wose wakawakaula. <verse eid="NUM 33:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 33:4" />Uku Wamisili awo wakanda wakawamosa msanga nt'hulasasu wawe we kilume wakomigwe ni Zumbe, kwaviya Zumbe Mnungu aisengelaga milungu yawe. <verse eid="NUM 33:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 33:5" />Ivo, Waizilaeli wahalawaga Lamasesi, na kutoa nk'hambi yawe uko Sukoti. <verse eid="NUM 33:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 33:6" />Kulawa Sukoti waikaga nk'hambi yawe uko Etamu, mnk'handa mwe dijangwa. <verse eid="NUM 33:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 33:7" />Kulawa Etamu, nawahituka na kuuya mpaka Pihahiloti, ulailo wa zuwa wa Baale Sefoni, na kutoa nk'hambi yawe hagihi na Migidoli. <verse eid="NUM 33:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 33:8" />Wahalawaga Pihahiloti, na komboka bahali ya Shamu mpaka mwe dijangwa dya Etamu, watambaga mwe dijangwa kwa mazuwa matatu, na kutoa nk'hambi yawe Mala. <verse eid="NUM 33:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 33:9" />Kulawa Mala, nawaita mpaka Elimu, uko Elimu nokunda na nch'hoko mlongo na mbili za mazi na mitende milongo mfungate, na kutoa nk'hambi hant'hu aho.<verse eid="NUM 33:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 33:10" />Wagendaga kulawa Elimu na kutoa nk'hambi yawe mnk'handa mwe Bahali Shamu. <verse eid="NUM 33:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 33:11" />Kulawa Bahali ya Shamu nawatoa nk'hambi yawe mwe dijangwa dya Sini. <verse eid="NUM 33:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 33:12" />Kulawa kwe dijangwa dya Sini, waikaga nk'hambi yawe Dofika. <verse eid="NUM 33:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 33:13" />Kulawa Dofika nawatowa nk'hambi yawe uko Alushi. <verse eid="NUM 33:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 33:14" />Kulawa Alushi nawatowa nk'hambi yawe uko Lefidimu, uko hakwandile na mazi yo kunywa kwaajili ya want'hu.<verse eid="NUM 33:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 33:15" />Wahalawaga Lefidimu na kutowa nk'hambi yawe mwe dijangwa dya Sinai. <verse eid="NUM 33:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 33:16" />Kulawa Sinai nawatowa nk'hambi yawe uko Kibloth Hataava. <verse eid="NUM 33:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 33:17" />kulawa kibulot Kataava, nawatowa nk'hambi yawe uko Hazeloti. <verse eid="NUM 33:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 33:18" />Kulawa Hazeloti, nawatowa nk'hambi yawe uko Litima. <verse eid="NUM 33:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 33:19" />Kulawa Litima, nawatowa nk'hambi uko Limon Pelezi. <verse eid="NUM 33:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 33:20" />Kulawa Limon Pelezi nawatowa nk'hambi uko Libina. <verse eid="NUM 33:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 33:21" />Kulawa Libina nawatowa nk'hambi uko Lisa. <verse eid="NUM 33:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 33:22" />Wahalawaga Lisa, na kutowa nk'hambi uko Kehelata. <verse eid="NUM 33:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 33:23" />Kulawa Kehelata, nawatowa nk'hambi yawe uko kwo mnima Shefeli. <verse eid="NUM 33:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 33:24" />Kulawa mnima Shefeli nawatowa nk'hambi yawe uko Halada. <verse eid="NUM 33:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 33:25" />Kulawa Halada, nawatowa nk'hambi yawe uko Makeloti. <verse eid="NUM 33:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 33:26" />Kulawa Makeloti, nawatowa nk'hambi yawe uko Tahati. <verse eid="NUM 33:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 33:27" />Kulawa Tahati nawatowa nk'hambi yawe uko Tela. <verse eid="NUM 33:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 33:28" />Kulawa Tela nawatowa nk'hambi yawe uko Mitika. <verse eid="NUM 33:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 33:29" />Kulawa Mitika nawatowa nk'hambi yawe uko Hashimona. <verse eid="NUM 33:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 33:30" />Kulawa Hashimona nawatowa nk'hambi yawe uko Moseloti. <verse eid="NUM 33:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 33:31" />Kulawa Moseloti nawatowa nk'hambi yawe uko Bene Yaakani. <verse eid="NUM 33:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 33:32" />Kulawa Bene Yaakani nawatowa nk'hambi yawe uko Holi Hagidigadi. <verse eid="NUM 33:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 33:33" />Kulawa Holi Hagidigadi nawatowa nk'hambi yawe uko Yoti Bata. <verse eid="NUM 33:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 33:34" />Kulawa Yoti Bata nawatowa nk'hambi yawe uko Abilona. <verse eid="NUM 33:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 33:35" />Kulawa Abilona nawatowa nk'hambi yawe uko Esion Gebeli. <verse eid="NUM 33:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 33:36" />Nawahauka Esion Gebeli, na kuita na kutowa nk'hambi yawe mwe dijangwa dya Sini, iyo Kadeshi. <verse eid="NUM 33:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 33:37" />Kulawa Kadeshi nawatowa nk'hambi yawe mwo mnima Holi, mwe mihaka ya isi ya Edomu.<verse eid="NUM 33:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 33:38" />Kwa sigilizi ya Zumbe mlava nt'hambiko Haluni nakakwela mwo mnima Holi, uko niyo abanika mwe dizuwa dya nk'hongo dyo mwezi wa shano, mwaka wa milongo mine kukongela aho Waizilaeli wahalawaga mwe isi ya Misili. <verse eid="NUM 33:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 33:39" />Haluni andaga na miaka gana dimwenga na milongo miid na mitatu umwo akabanika mwo mnima Holi. <verse eid="NUM 33:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 33:40" />Seuta ywa Aladi, Mkanani, ekalaga Kwa mwenye mzi ye isi ya Kanaani evaga kugamba waizilaili wandaga wakeza. <verse eid="NUM 33:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 33:41" />Kulawa mwo mnima Holi, Waizilaeli waikaga nk'hambi yawe Salimona. <verse eid="NUM 33:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 33:42" />Kulawa Salimona, waikaga nk'hambi yawe uko Punoni. <verse eid="NUM 33:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 33:43" />Kulawa Punoni, wakimaga nk'hambi yawe uko Oboti. <verse eid="NUM 33:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 33:44" />Kulawa Oboti, wakimaga nk'hambi yawe Iiye Abalimu, mwe mihaka ya Moabu. <verse eid="NUM 33:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 33:45" />Kulawa Iiye Abalimu, waikaga nk'hambi yawe uko Diboni Gagadi. <verse eid="NUM 33:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 33:46" />Kulawa Diboni Gadi waikaga nk'hambi yawe uko Alimoni Dibulataimu. <verse eid="NUM 33:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 33:47" />Kulawa Alimoni Dibulataimu, nawatamba na kutowa nk'hambi yawe mwo milima ya Abalimu kuhinga no minima Nebo. <verse eid="NUM 33:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 33:48" />Kulawa milima ya Abalimu, nawatamba na kutowa nk'hambi yawe mwe zint'hindiga za Moabu ng'ambu ya mto Yolodani hagihi na Yeliko. <verse eid="NUM 33:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 33:49" />Nawaika nt'hulwe iyo hagihi no mto Yolodani hagatigati mwa Beti Yeshimoti kwe dikolongo dya Abel Shitimu mwe zint'hidiga za Moabu.<verse eid="NUM 33:49" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sigilizi mwo kwingila Kanaani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 33:50" />Mwe zint'hindiga za Moabu, ng'ambu yo mto Yolodani hagihi na Yeliko, Zumbe amgambaga Musa, <verse eid="NUM 33:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 33:51" />“Wagambile Waizilaeli kugamba mkeza komboka mto Yolodani na kwingila mwe isi ya Kaanani, <verse eid="NUM 33:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="NUM 33:52" />wakulumbuzeni wakaya wose mwe isi iyo ha meso yenyu, naho banangeni mahili yose ya kusongola na ya kusana na kubananga kila hant'hu aho ho kuvikila. <verse eid="NUM 33:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="NUM 33:53" />Nomwiguhe isi iyo na kwikala umwo kwaviya hiwenk'hani inde yenyu. <verse eid="NUM 33:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="NUM 33:54" />Nomuipange isi iyo kwa kutoa kula viligane ne zimp'huga zenyu, hant'hu hakulu kwa kabila kulu, hant'hu hadodo kwa kabila dodo. Hant'hu aho isimbi neimgweele mnt'hu yeyose hant'hu hakwe nounde ukipe enga makabila ya watati zenyu ivo yeli. <verse eid="NUM 33:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="NUM 33:55" />Mna uneva hamkuunga kuwagulusa wakaya we isi iyo, nawande enga mitunga mwe meso yawe na miwa mwe zimbavu zenu ivo awo nawawageleni nk'huswa nk'huswa mwe isi mkwikala. <verse eid="NUM 33:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="NUM 33:56" />Naho hamna wakulumbuze name neniwabanangeni enga ivo nehaunga niwabanange woho.”<verse eid="NUM 33:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="NUM 34" />
  <para style="s">Mihaka ye Isi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 34:1" />Zumbe Mnungu niyo amgamba Musa, <verse eid="NUM 34:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 34:2" />Wagambe Waizilaeli, “Umwo mkeza kwingila Kanaani, isi huwenk'ha kunda ukipe wenyu, mihaka ya isi yenyu yose neinde ivi. <verse eid="NUM 34:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 34:3" />Hant'hu ha Kwa mwenye mzi kwenyu nounde kulawa kwe dijangwa dya Sini kombokela mwe mihaka ya Edomu. Noukongele mwo uheelo mwe Bahali yo munyu kuhinga ulailo wa zuwa. <verse eid="NUM 34:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 34:4" />Niyo wombokela Kwa mwenye mzi kuita Akilabimu na kombokela Sini mpaka Kadesh Balinea, nt'hendelo ya Kwa mwenye mzi. Kulawa aho mhaka nougonje kugendeela kaskazini mwo usweelo wa zuwa mpaka Hasal Adali na komboka mpaka Azimoni. <verse eid="NUM 34:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 34:5" />Kulawa Azimoni nouhituke kugendeela mto wa Misili, mwe mhaka wa Misili na mpaka Bahali ya Meditelania.<verse eid="NUM 34:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 34:6" />“Mhaka wenyu wa hant'hu ha ulailo wa zuwa nounde Bahali ya Meditelania.<verse eid="NUM 34:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 34:7" />“Ko mhaka wenyu wa mkoma mahanya nomwiike boya kulawa kwe Bahali ya Meditelania mpaka kwo Mnima Holi. <verse eid="NUM 34:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 34:8" />Naho nomwiike boya kulawa kwo mnima Holi mpaka Hamati niyo mwagendeela mpaka Zedadi, <verse eid="NUM 34:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 34:9" />naho nomwombokele Zifuloni nomkaheele Hazali Enani, uwo nounde mhaka wenyu wa mkoma mahanya.<verse eid="NUM 34:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 34:10" />“Mhaka wenyu wa nt'hendelo ya ulailo wa zuwa nomwike kulawa Hazali Enani mpaka Shefamu. <verse eid="NUM 34:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 34:11" />Kulawa Shefamu nougendele Kwa mwenye mzi mpaka Liba, kwo ulailo wa zuwa mwa Aini, niyo mhaka uwo nowite hasi mpaka mwe seleza ya ulailo wa zuwa wa mto wa Galilaya, <verse eid="NUM 34:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 34:12" />naho nouseele kutimila mto Yolodani mpaka Bahali yo Munyu,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 34:12">“Ino neinde isi yako ne mihaka yose.”<verse eid="NUM 34:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 34:13" />Ivo, Musa niyo awasigiila Waizilaeli, “Ino niyo isi neinde ukipe wenyu kwa kutowa kula, isi izo Zumbe asigiile yenk'higwe makabila kenda na nusu. <verse eid="NUM 34:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 34:14" />Kwaviya kabila dya Lubeni na dya Gadi, na nusu ye dikabila dya Manase yapata ukipe wawe, <verse eid="NUM 34:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 34:15" />Makabila ayo maidi na nusu yapata ukipe wawe mwe nt'hendelo ya ulailo wa zuwa wa mto Yolodani ng'ambu ya Yeliko.”<verse eid="NUM 34:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vilongozi wakukimaila upasi we isi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 34:16" />Zumbe niyo amgamba Musa, <verse eid="NUM 34:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 34:17" />“Mlava nt'hambiko Eliyazali na Yoshua mwana Nuni nawo nawawapangile want'hu isi inde yawe. <verse eid="NUM 34:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 34:18" />Nouguhe kilongozi yumwenga kila kabila kwambiza upasi we isi. <verse eid="NUM 34:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 34:19" />Aya nayo mazina yawe, mwe dikabila dya Yuda ni Kalebu mwana wa Yefune. <verse eid="NUM 34:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 34:20" />Kulawa we dikabila dya Simeoni ni Shemueli mwana Amihudi. <verse eid="NUM 34:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 34:21" />Kulawa mwe dikabila dya Benjamini ni Elidadi mwana Kisiloni. <verse eid="NUM 34:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 34:22" />Kulawa mwe dikabila dya Dani ni Buki mwana Yogili. <verse eid="NUM 34:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 34:23" />Kulawa mwe dikabila dya Manase mwana Yusefu ni Hanieli mwana Efodi. <verse eid="NUM 34:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 34:24" />Kulawa mwe dikabila dya Efulaimu mwana Yosefu ni Kemueli mwana Shifutani. <verse eid="NUM 34:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 34:25" />Kulawa mwe dikabila dya Zabuloni ni Elisafani mwana Panaki. <verse eid="NUM 34:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 34:26" />Kulawa mwe dikabila dya Isikali ni Palitieli mwana Azani. <verse eid="NUM 34:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 34:27" />Kulawa mwe dikabila dya Asheli ni Amihudi mwana Shelomi. <verse eid="NUM 34:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 34:28" />Kulawa mwe dikabila dya Nafutali ni Pedaheli mwana Amihudi.<verse eid="NUM 34:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 34:29" />“Awa nawo want'hu Zumbe asigiilaga wawapangile Waizilaeli ukipe we isi ya Kanaani kunda wawe.”<verse eid="NUM 34:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="NUM 35" />
  <para style="s">Mizi iikilwe Walawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 35:1" />Zumbe alongaga na Musa mwe zint'hindiga za Moabu, hagihi no mto Yolidani uko Yeliko, akamgamba, <verse eid="NUM 35:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 35:2" />“Wagambile Waizilaeli, wawenk'he Walawi mizi ya kwikala na madimilo mnk'handa mwe mizi iyo. <verse eid="NUM 35:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 35:3" />Mizi iyo neinde yawe, woho nawo nawekale uumwo naho madimilo nayande kwaajili ye mifugwa yawe na makala yawe matuhu. <verse eid="NUM 35:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 35:4" />Madimilo mkuunga muwenk'he Walawi mnk'handa mwe mizi nayande na uhale wa nk'hacho magana mane na milongo mishano nt'hendelo zose kulawa kwe digomela dye mizi iyo. <verse eid="NUM 35:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 35:5" />Naivo elo madimilo ayo nayande nk'hacho magana kenda nt'hendelo zose zo mzi, mzi yenye ukanda hagati. Ayo nayande madimilo yawe mnk'hada mwe mizi yawe. <verse eid="NUM 35:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 35:6" />Nomuwenk'he Walawi mizi mtandatu ya kunyilikila, ya mnt'hu amkomile miyawe haheina kumkambila. Kwa kongezela muwenk'he mizi mituhu milongo mine na miidi. <verse eid="NUM 35:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 35:7" />Kwa hamwenga mizi yose mkuungwa kuwenk'ha Walawi ikanda ni hamwenga no madimilo neinde milongo mine na mnane. <verse eid="NUM 35:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 35:8" />Uwazilo we mizi mkuunga muwenk'he Walawi mwo ukipe wa Waizilaeli, nomuwenk'he viligne no ukulu hegu udodo we dikabila dyawe. Kabila kulu nedilave mizi mingi, kabila dodo nedilave mizi migeke. Kila kabila dya Izilaeli nedilave mizi yakwe kwa Walawi viligane na hant'hu aho nedink'higwe kunda ukipe.”<verse eid="NUM 35:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mizi yo kunyilikila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 35:9" />Naho Zumbe agambaga Musa, <verse eid="NUM 35:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 35:10" />Wagambe Waizilaeli, “Umwo mkeza komboka mto Yolodani na kwingila isi ya Kanaani, <verse eid="NUM 35:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 35:11" />nomsagule mizi ya kunyilikila mnt'hu uyo akudaha kuhona uneva kamkoma miyawe haheina kumkambila. <verse eid="NUM 35:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 35:12" />Mizi iyo neinde hant'hu hakunyilikila ho utondowazi vileke mkomi uyo asekukomwa na mta kulihiza akanda akei kusengelwa ha want'hu. <verse eid="NUM 35:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 35:13" />Naho mizi iyo ya kunyilikila nomuwenk'he neinde mizi mtandatu. <verse eid="NUM 35:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 35:14" />Mwe mizi iyo mtandatu nomuike, mitatu inde ng'ambu ya mto Yolodani, mitatu nayo inde mwe isi ya Kanaani. <verse eid="NUM 35:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 35:15" />Imizi ino mtandatu neinde ni unyilikilo wa Waizilaeli na watakwiza wa mazuwa yose hegu wa lupisi du wakwikala hamwenga nawo, kugamba yeyose ukumkoma mnt'hu kwa kwitukila adahe kunyilikila uukwo.<verse eid="NUM 35:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 35:16" />“Mna uneva mnt'hu anamtoa miyawe na kilama niyo atoigwe abanika, mnt'hu uyo mkomi nae akomwe. <verse eid="NUM 35:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 35:17" />Mnt'hu yeyose anamtoa iwe miyawe niyo abanika mnt'hu mkomi uyo naye, akomwe.<verse eid="NUM 35:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 35:18" />“Mna uneva anamtowa kwa kint'hu cha ziti niyo miyawe abanika, mnt'hu uyo mkomi, nae akomwe. <verse eid="NUM 35:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 35:19" />Wandagu wa hagihi wa mnt'hu akomigwe nawalihize umwo wanadugana no mkomi, nawamkome.<verse eid="NUM 35:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 35:20" />“Hata ivo, uneva mnt'hu amuihia miyawe, niyo amsunk'ha na kumduila kint'hu kwa kinyele, <verse eid="NUM 35:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 35:21" />hegu kwa kumtowa no kubanika, ivo mnt'hu uyo amtoile miyawe naye akomigwe. Mndugu ywa hagihi ywa mnt'hu akomigwe aho naadugane na uyo mkomi naye naamkome.<verse eid="NUM 35:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 35:22" />“Mna uneva mnt'hu ketukila kamsindika miyawe haheina kumwiihiya, hegu kumduila kint'hu haheina kumkambila, <verse eid="NUM 35:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 35:23" />uneva mnt'hu anaduula iwe dikudaha kukoma, niyo akoma mnt'hu mtuhu haheina kumuwona, naho uneva handile mnk'hondo ywakwe hegu hamkambile kumnumiza, <verse eid="NUM 35:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 35:24" />ivo, want'hu wa Izilaeli nawalamule mwa uyo mkomi na wandugu wa hagihi wakuunga walihize viligane ne zisigilizi izo. <verse eid="NUM 35:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 35:25" />Want'hu wa Izilaeli nawamyokole mnt'hu uyo akomile mwe mikono ya wandugu wo mnt'hu uyo akomigwe na kumvuza mwo mzi wo kunyilikila uko anyilikile. Neekale uuko mpaka mlava nt'hambiko mkulu wo lupisi ulwo asagulwe kwa kuhakwa mavuta yakukile, abanike. <verse eid="NUM 35:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 35:26" />Mna yudya akomile anafosa kuse yo mzi anyilikile mwo lupisi ulo lwose, <verse eid="NUM 35:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 35:27" />niyo mndugu ywa hagihi wo mnt'hu akomigwe ambwiila kuse ye mihaka yo mzi uwo wa kunyilikila niyo amkoma, uyo haande na masa ya kukoma. <verse eid="NUM 35:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 35:28" />Ivo elo mkomi uyo ekale mwo mzi wa kunyilikila mpaka mlava nt'hambiko mkulu abanike, mna mlavant'hambiko mkulu anabanika adaha kuuya kaya. <verse eid="NUM 35:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 35:29" />Sigilizi izi nezidamanye ndima mwe vyeleko venyu vose naho hant'hu hohose nomwikale.<verse eid="NUM 35:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 35:30" />“Mnt'hu yeyose naamkome mnt'hu, naasengelwe kukomwa kwa uwona wa want'hu waidi hegu kugendeela, mnt'hu yeyose hakudaha kusengelwa kukomwa kwa uwona wa mnt'hu yumwenga. <verse eid="NUM 35:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 35:31" />Msekuhokela maliho yoyose kumhonya mkomi apatile masa niyo asengelwa kukomwa, mnt'hu uyo naakomwe. <verse eid="NUM 35:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 35:32" />Msekuhokela hegu msekuzumila maliho yoyose kulawa kwa mnt'hu anyilikile kwo mzi wa kunyilikila vileke azumilwe kuuya kwe kaya yakwe uneva mlava nt'hambiko mkulu akei kubanika. <verse eid="NUM 35:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 35:33" />Mnadamanya ivo nomnitende miye nisekuizumila isi iyo mkwikala. Kwitika kwa sakame kwagela usavu mwe isi, naho hahana malavo ya kuikukiza isi idamanyilwe ukomi, sakame yo mkomi uyo du niyo neikukize. <verse eid="NUM 35:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 35:34" />Msekuigela usavu isi mkwikala, isi iyo miye hwikala mndani mwakwe, kwaviya Miye Zumbe nekala mwa Waizilaeli.”<verse eid="NUM 35:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="NUM 36" />
  <para style="s">Ukipe wa Mvele alombigwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 36:1" />Akajika wakulu we zink'holo za Gileadi welekwa wa Makili mwana Manase uyo mwana Yusufu, wawabasaga Musa na wakulu watuhu we zimp'huga za Waizilaeli. <verse eid="NUM 36:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 36:2" />Niyo wagamba, “Umwo Zumbe akusigiilaga uwapangile Waizilaeli isi kunda ukipe wawe kwa kuwatowela kula, iviyaiviya Zumbe akusigiilaga uwapange ukipe wa ndugu yetu Zelofehad kwa wanawe we kike. <verse eid="NUM 36:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 36:3" />Mna woho wanalombigwa ni waizilaeli wa makabila matuhu, ukipe we isi noulawe kwetu na kuwaitila want'hu we dikabila walombigwe, kwaivo ukipe wetu nowage. <verse eid="NUM 36:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 36:4" />Naho mwo mwe dizuwa dye kinyemi dye miaka milongo mishano umwo vint'hu va mnt'hu vatagagwa vikavuzwa kwo mwenye, ukipe we isi wa wanakike wa Zelofehadi neunde uguhigwa kudya kwedikabila idyo walombigwe na ivo kabila dyetu nedinde dyaza ukipe wakwe.”<verse eid="NUM 36:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 36:5" />Ivo Musa awasigiilaga Waizilaeli viligane na ivo Zumbe asigiilaga akawagamba, “Icho wakulonga want'hu wo lukolo lwe dikabila dya Yusefu ni kindedi. <verse eid="NUM 36:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 36:6" />Naivi nivo akusigiila Zumbe mwa wanakike wa Selofehadi, wadaha kulombigwa ni mnt'hu yeyose wakumuunga, mna walombigwe mwe lukolo lwawe du. <verse eid="NUM 36:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 36:7" />Vileke ukipe wa Waizilaeli usekusamizwa mwe dikabila dituhu, kila Mwizilaeli naakaulise ukipe mwo lukolo lwakwe. <verse eid="NUM 36:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 36:8" />Mvele yeyose mta ukipe mwe dikabila dyodyose dya Izilaeli vaungwa alombigwe ni mnt'hu wo lukolo lwalwe vileke kila Mwizilaeli aguhe ukipe wa waise. <verse eid="NUM 36:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 36:9" />Ivo nahande hahana ukipe wowose nousamizwe kulawa mwo dikabila dimwenga kuita tuhu. Kila kabila dya waizilaeli nolutozese ukipe wawe.”<verse eid="NUM 36:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 36:10" />Wanakike wa Selofehadi nawadamanya enga ivo Zumbe Mnungu amsigiile Musa. <verse eid="NUM 36:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 36:11" />Kwaivo Mala na Tiliza na Hogila na Milika na Noa nawalombigwa ni wana watati zawe wakulu zawe. <verse eid="NUM 36:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 36:12" />Nawalombigwa mwe lukolo lwa kabila dya Manase mwana ywa Yusufu, ukipe wawe nawo nousigale mwe dikabila dya tati yawe.<verse eid="NUM 36:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 36:13" />Iyo niyo imiko ne zisigilizi izo Zumbe awenk'hile Waizilaeli kwa sila ya Musa mwe zint'hindika za Moabu, mwe nt'hendelo ya kaidi yo mto Yolodani hagihi no mzi wa Yeliko.<verse eid="NUM 36:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 36" />
</usx>